{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_10","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The title is \"Open Table Second Opinion\".\n\nThe folder and HTML file names are set. I will create the directory structure and clone the engine and hub in parallel. I also need to read the engine API.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The title is **Open Table Second Opinion**. Next I’ll create the dev folder and clone the engine and Hub client."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-088791d8-3045-4425-aa34-19889a211148-9","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"set -e\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916\"\nmkdir -p \"$DEV/vendor\" \"$DEV/src\" \"$DEV/tests\" \"$DEV/tools\" \"$DEV/notes\"\ncd \"$DEV\"\ngit clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge.git vendor/my-3d2dge\ngit -C vendor/my-3d2dge sparse-checkout set dist/handoff\nmkdir -p vendor/hub\ncd vendor/hub\nfor f in README.md session.js harness.html bridge.js round.js examples/arena.html; do\n  curl -fsSL --create-dirs -o \"$f\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/$f\"\ndone\necho \"CLONE_OK\"\nls -la vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff | head -40\necho \"--- hub ---\"\nls -la vendor/hub vendor/hub/examples\nwc -c vendor/hub/session.js vendor/hub/README.md vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API.md vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/README.md","description":"Create dev folder and clone engine plus Hub"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11853,"output_tokens":773,"cache_read_input_tokens":69632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"9faac1bb-369e-46ca-bb9f-8c416784afee"}
