12,111,116,105,111,110,115,44,32,107,101,121,115,32,102,111,114,32,100,111,111,114,115,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":19,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"| `tools/check.mjs` | plays a game in headless Chromium, switches its views, and reports errors, what is on screen, and `game.debug.snapshot()` |\"},{\"line_number\":88,\"content\":\"- `game.go('play')` fades for `game.fadeTime` (.22 s) before the new scene enters: advance past it, or set\"},{\"line_number\":89,\"content\":\"  `game.fadeTime = 0` in a test.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"`game.go(name, data)` switches after a short dithered fade (`game.fadeTime`: a test advances past it; `{ fade: 0 }` cuts; `{ fade: 'wipe' | 'iris' | 'mosaic' | 'swirl' | 'dissolve' | 'white', seconds: .4, at: hero }` a transition, a plain fade under reduce motion); timers (but `after(s, fn, { keep: true })`) and particles are cleared, a hit-stop ends (`timeScale` stays). `pausable: true`: Escape / P / Start pauses it, with the pause menu (below). `view`, `views`, `input`, `res`, `expand`, `touch`, `camera`, `propSize` are options applied on entry (a method so named warns). A scene is one object every visit: reset its state in `enter`. `back()` takes a phone's back gesture first (true if it went back: a sub-menu closed).\"},{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"- Players (two to four on one machine): `game.players` is `[game.input, ...]`, each an input with this API, its `player` number, `name` (`'P2'`), `color` (`E.PLAYER_COLORS`) and device. `game.allowJoin({ max: 2, onJoin: (input, n) => {} })` lets them in: Start on a free gamepad, or 2 on the keyboard (player 2 takes its right half: arrows, `.` `/` `,` and the numpad; player 1 keeps WASD with F G H; a preset's `halves: { left: { pass: ['KeyR'] }, right: {...} }` its own); `game.addPlayer({ pad: 0 })` or `({ keys: 'right' })`, `game.removePlayer(p)`. Prompts, the pause (P2 PAUSED), a lost controller and the Controls screen are per player. One screen: `cam.frame(heroes)`. Split: `game.splitScreen(2, { follow: [h1, h2], layout: 'auto' })` (`'columns'`, `'rows'`, `'grid'`; up to 4) draws the scene once per viewport (`r.viewport` is `{ i, x, y, w, h }`), then `scene.hud(r)` once over the whole screen; `game.viewports[i].follow(t)` or `.focus(x, y)`.\"},{\"line_number\":235,\"content\":\"| Beat-'em-up (Final Fight, Streets of Rage, TMNT) | `brawler` | TileMap street strip, Body, Humanoid (`weapon: null`) + `E.Combo` punches and `kick: true` kicks, `E.knockback`, waves that lock the screen; a second player drops in (`game.allowJoin`, `cam.frame` on both) | BRAWLER |\"},{\"line_number\":252,\"content\":\"| Sports (Sensible Soccer, NBA Jam) | `threequarter` / `topdown` | the ball an `E.Body` (`bounce`; curl: turn its velocity across its path), passes led to the teammate, `E.arc` for a lob, a shot's meter, formations by where the ball is, `game.allowJoin({ max: 4 })` | SPORTS |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":479,\"content\":\"- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\"},{\"line_number\":499,\"content\":\"- `game.players` †: the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an input with player (1..4), name ('P1'), color (E.PLAYER_COLORS) and device. A game of one: [game.input]\"},{\"line_number\":532,\"content\":\"- `game.fadeTime = .22`: seconds for the dithered fade between scenes (0 = instant cuts)\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/AI_GUIDE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":165,\"content\":\"- `game.allowJoin({ max: 2, onJoin: (input, n) => dropIn(input) })` in a scene's `enter` lets them in: Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard. Two on one keyboard each get half: player 1 WASD with F G H R T Y (`Input.halfKeys(preset, 'left')`), player 2 the arrows with `.` `/` `,` L `;` `'` and the numpad (`'right'`), each half taking the preset's actions in turn. `game.addPlayer({ pad: 1 })` or `({ keys: 'right' })` adds one directly (tests, a versus menu); `game.removePlayer(p)`.\"},{\"line_number\":354,\"content\":\"if (game.debug.snapshot().hero[2] !== 32) throw new Error('the hero should have climbed onto the roof');\"},{\"line_number\":384,\"content\":\"  - `--log \\\"My3D2dge.current.sceneName\\\"` prints any state at the end (a game's `game.debug.snapshot()` prints by itself);\"},{\"line_number\":436,\"content\":\"- A second player drops in (`game.allowJoin({ max: 2, onJoin })`): a hero of its own driven by its input, foes going for the nearer hero, `cam.frame(heroes)` instead of `follow`, game over when both are out.\"},{\"line_number\":441,\"content\":\"- Two players: `game.allowJoin({ max: 2 })` and `inputs: [game.input, game.players[1]]` (a pad each, or half a keyboard each); the select and the menus read every player.\"},{\"line_number\":459,\"content\":\"- Two players: `game.allowJoin({ max: 2 })`, `game.splitScreen(2, { layout: 'rows' })`, and in `draw` each viewport its own camera: `m7.draw(r, cams[r.viewport.i])`, `race.hud(r, players[r.viewport.i])`. On a phone the gas goes on by itself (`car.o.auto`), the stick steers, DRIFT and ITEM are buttons; held upright, draw from further back with a wider field of view.\"},{\"line_number\":571,\"content\":\"- The players a person doesn't run play by formation, by where the ball is: with it, the other one runs ahead on the far side; without it, the nearer presses and the other covers the goal. `game.allowJoin({ max: 4 })` lets players 2 to 4 in, each taking a side's next player.\"},{\"line_number\":582,\"content\":\"- Two to four players on one machine: `game.allowJoin({ max: 4 })`, a mover and an input each (`game.players[i]`).\"},{\"line_number\":585,\"content\":\"- Up to four heroes (`game.allowJoin({ max: 4 })`, `cam.frame(heroes)`), health draining by the second, food and potions, keys for doors.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ca62094e-347b-4c94-a37f-8292b22edc5c-15","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,50,48,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,47,79,112,101,110,45,84,97,98,108,