{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_52","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"AIHub is global. The skeleton uses window.\n\nThe hub scene must connect and call ready() immediately. Clients answer ready on Enter. The host runs the Grand Rounds simulation, sends snapshots, and receives client input. Time-up triggers finish. Host leave does not end the game. The server draws nothing. The harness window is only about six seconds, so the game only needs to satisfy protocol timing, not complete the surgery.\n\nClients send `i` and the host sends `s`. The test feeds a client cursor through a stroke to verify the host state. The card hello must set showsCard. Metas must be correct.\n\nThe host will apply client `i` messages to the simulation player position. Player positions will be included in `s` snapshots. A `window.__hubProbe` object will expose player data for testing. The harness must be checked to see how it injects cursor strokes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2a94d58e-5668-4e34-a671-4093c504047a-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"checks\\.push|name:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/hub/harness.html","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":475,"output_tokens":577,"cache_read_input_tokens":125440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"027225f9-87af-48a3-9b47-2514b5b2a5bc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2a94d58e-5668-4e34-a671-4093c504047a-29","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,47,79,112,101,110,45,84,97,98,108,101,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,47,118,101,110,100,111,114,47,104,117,98,47,104,97,114,110,101,115,115,46,104,116,109,108,10,49,55,51,58,32,32,99,111,110,115,116,32,112,108,97,121,101,114,115,32,61,32,65,114,114,97,121,46,102,114,111,109,40,123,32,108,101,110,103,116,104,58,32,110,32,125,44,32,40,95,44,32,115,108,111,116,41,32,61,62,32,40,123,32,107,101,121,58,32,96,112,36,123,115,108,111,116,125,96,44,32,115,108,111,116,44,32,110,97,109,101,58,32,78,65,77,69,83,91,115,108,111,116,93,32,125,41,41,59,10,50,48,56,58,32,32,102,111,114,32,40,99,111,110,115,116,32,112,32,111,102,32,91,46,46,46,112,108,97,121,101,114,115,44,32,46,46,46,40,115,101,114,118,101,114,77,111,100,101,32,63,32,91,123,32,107,101,121,58,32,39,115,101,114,118,101,114,39,44,32,115,108,111,116,58,32,110,117,108,108,44,32,110,97,109,101,58,32,39,83,101,114,118,101,114,39,44,32,115,101,114,118,101,114,58,32,116,114,117,101,32,125,93,32,58,32,91,93,41,93,41,32,123,10,52,48,55,58,32,32,32,32,99,104,101,99,107,115,46,112,117,115,104,40,123,32,110,97,109,101,44,32,112,97,115,115,58,32,33,33,112,97,115,115,44,32,100,101,116,97,105,108,32,125,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":3,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/hub/harness.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":173,\"content\":\"  const players = Array.from({ length: n }, (_, slot) => ({ key: `p${slot}`, slot, name: NAMES[slot] }));\"},{\"line_number\":208,\"content\":\"  for (const p of [...players, ...(serverMode ? [{ key: 'server', slot: null, name: 'Server', server: true }] : [])]) {\"},{\"line_number\":407,\"content\":\"    checks.push({ name, pass: !!pass, detail });\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"1e71fcaf-05b3-4ef9-84be-14aca7e875fa"}
