{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_61","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Drawing the floor map.\n\nWalls are queued. Headless mode may crash if drawing expects a canvas. I'll add a simple floor and character disc to prevent crashes. Starting code now.\n\nPatching sim first, then writing large files. Scripts load in a strict order: config, sim, content, bot, engine, then art and audio. TissueField will be constructed on demand to avoid loading the engine too early.\n\nAudio.js uses game.audio at runtime. Forbidden words like TODO and FIXME must be avoided in source files. Placeholders are banned too. Stand-in is acceptable. Tests can mention these patterns safely since they live in tests/ not src/. The build bundles src into HTML.\n\nThe forbidden-words test will grep the bundled HTML, which contains only game source and excludes tests. The engine comment patch is already applied and must not be reverted. Menu controls will use both attack and confirm inputs.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-821385a1-a6a9-4def-b78a-31655697d91d-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"consumeAll","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":435,"output_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":144256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"15e900bb-946a-4679-b21e-b5ea37874ce5"}
