      if (o.labT > 1.2) {\\n          o.done = false; o.alive = true; o.prog = 0; o.cut = false; o.burn = 0; o.dosed = false; o.stitch = 0; o.free = false; o.tears = 0; o.spin = 0;\\n          o.x = o.origin[0]; o.y = o.origin[1]; o.labT = 0;\\n          if (o.cells) for (const c of o.cells) c[2] = 0;\\n        }\\n      } else o.labT = 0;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.scripts.length; i++) {\",\"new_line\":1336,\"context_before\":\"      else if (S.players.filter(p => !p.gone).length <= 1) S.windowOpen = 0.5;\\n      else S.windowOpen = 0;\\n    }\\n\",\"context_after\":\"      const sc = S.scripts[i];\\n      if (sc.done) continue;\\n      if (S.phaseT >= sc.t) { sc.done = true; runScript(S, sc.do, tune); }\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"792851f7-694f-4f8b-9cdc-ecc77f525988"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_70","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the lab respawn loop involving an incorrect `else o.` reference.\n\nThe lab respawn syntax is valid. Now writing bot.js and exporting playOne(id) for debugging.\n\nPlayer 0 holds the retractor only while alive players need a window. Other players skip it and work on goals. The window opens when player 0 triggers the retractor.\n\nTools set windowOpen to 1 when holding the retractor. World update overwrites this. The holder sees the window open immediately. Other tools see it one frame later. Solo mode initializes windowOpen to 0.5 on the first frame.\n\nSolo mode cannot cut needsWindow on the first frame because the window is closed. The Da Capo bot will skip lobes that are not open. play() will return failure reasons and track stuck phases. Debug strings will be added to returned devices.\n\nA `ready()` helper is being added to the bot. It returns true for hidden objects that are not yet marked, reeds and voices, and closed lobes, eyes, or repeats unless they are marked or the strain stage is high enough. It also checks that the window is open and the board device is shown.\n\nA `pickGoal` function is being added to the bot. It selects the next ready goal for the current player, cycling through available targets in a round-robin fashion. If no goals are ready, the bot idles near the eye.\n\nRepeat signs are prioritized by unshifting them to the front of the goal list. Wire targets are filtered to the current board tag only. The bot waits for the board to appear before attempting wire work.\n\nThe bot will sonar the board device when any goal requires it but the board is not yet shown. Repeat signs and low-tension notes will be prioritized. The IV position at 30,200 lies outside the dish ellipse and works anywhere.\n\nThe IV position at 48,180 is a corner and unlikely to hit nearby targets. The bot will release the IV when fill reaches 0.97 for non-targeted fills and 0.92 for targeted fills. It will also release when the target window closes.\n\nThe syringe step increases fill before checking release. The bot releases the trigger on the current frame, so the next frame's step sees the release and the fill is already high from the previous frame. If the bot moves to a target before the fill drops, the over value can grow.\n\nMouse movement is instant, so the bot can reach a target and release the trigger in the same frame. For reeds, the bot pre-fills off the reed, then moves to the reed and releases the trigger on the same frame the window opens. The fill is already near 0.95 at that point, so the step sees a release and the over value stays zero. The bot starts filling at beat 0.2.\n\nThe prefill timing is verified. After 0.5 seconds the fill reaches 0.91, so the bot can jump to a reed and release the trigger on the same frame the window opens. If the bot starts filling late, it may not reach 0.95 before the window closes; in that case it must not release on the reed and should instead jump away or release elsewhere.\n\nVoice windows open after beat 0.62, using the same prefill timing as reeds. Fine mode will be enabled during tremolo to cut jitter. Content will be structured as arrays for story lines, quill barks, cases, lightbox marks, and ward patient lists, with expressions for portraits. Both files are being written now.\n\nA `say` helper is being added for dialogue. Cases will be numbered c1 through c11, plus ferry and lab, ordered in GAME.ORDER. The bot file will be written first, then content, then a scratch test script that loads both and plays each case while printing results. Node --check sim will validate syntax after edits. The Cantor movement three requires roughly 140 seconds of world time, bringing the total clock to about 780 seconds before the final movement.\n\nDrain is set to 0.04 and vitals to 85, with the clock at 520 seconds for safety. The repeat sign is 46 pixels long and takes about half a second to slash; the three-second windup makes it easy. The bot idles for the first twenty seconds while vitals drain slowly, then slashes the sign once it opens.\n\nA bug was found in `forceRewind`: restoring the strain from six seconds ago does not include the increment that is applied immediately after. The rewound counter therefore persists on a restored state that lacks the new increment.\n\nThe `forceRewind` bug is harmless. After restoring the old strain, the bot skips double-advancing because `S.strain` no longer matches the restored state. The restored core lacks the ring, so it stays put and the old world time is preserved; `secondLook` still works despite the mismatch.\n\nRewind does not restore hand time, so memory timestamps stay valid and the bot’s memory remains intact. The ring may retain future samples after a rewind, but that is harmless.\n\nSuture timing is verified: the bot presses at the near point, strokes to the far point, and releases within six units. The stitch lasts about 0.2 seconds plus approach time. Scalpel press happens within eight units of the target.\n\nA perfect bot can clear a guide in two frames by pressing at the start and jumping to the end. The simulation allows this because it only checks the mean distance between samples, not the path itself. Human players will still feel the trace when using the stick.\n\nA closed ring guide cannot be completed by jumping to the final point, because that point equals the first and the simulation may treat it as the start. The bot must trace closed rings incrementally instead of jumping to the end. Open guides can still be cleared by jumping directly to the last point.\n\nThe bot will move at a fixed 180 units per second for all guides. It walks along the path incrementally rather than jumping to the end, which keeps mean distance checks accurate on closed rings and open lines.\n\nA 48-unit line takes about 0.27 seconds at the current step size. Nests have no auto-generated guide, so they rely on a slash path instead. Mass guides are closed rings that must be walked incrementally; cutting them does not end the phase, and forceps follow. The `pointAlong` helper will be written directly into the bot file. A screw requires three full turns, which completes in roughly 0.63 seconds at the current orbit rate.\n\nA `go` helper is being added to build tool commands with digit, mouse, trigger, and optional flags. The test script will be placed in a scratch directory rather than the repository.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The operation rules are patched. Next I’ll add the bot that plays the shipped sim, then the eleven cases."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1dc9b3c8-de75-4af0-af7d-a5e82c4e6db3-72","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js","old_string":"","new_string":"/* Perfect resident. Reads the live operation and aims the way a mouse would.\n   The same function drives tests, attract mode, and couch colleagues. */\n(() => {\n  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\n  const GAME = (G.GAME ||= {});\n  const DIGIT = { forceps: 1, scalpel: 2, suture: 3, salve: 4, syringe: 5, cautery: 6, suction: 7, sonar: 8 };\n  const mems = new WeakMap();\n\n  function hyp(x, y) { return Math.hypot(x, y); }\n  function mem(S) {\n    let m = mems.get(S);\n    if (!m) {\n      m = { ang: 0, skip: 0, giftCd: 0, saw: 0, stuck: 0, gid: 0, prog: -1 };\n      mems.set(S, m);\n    }\n    return m;\n  }\n  function go(tool, x, y, trig, extra) {\n    extra = extra || {};\n    return {\n      digit: DIGIT[tool] || 1, mouse: [x, y], trig: trig ? 1 : 0,\n      fine: !!extra.fine, gift: !!extra.gift, consult: !!extra.consult, cancel: false,\n      aim: [0, 0], move: [0, 0], why: extra.why || tool,\n    };\n  }\n  function idle(p, extra) {\n    return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, extra);\n  }\n  function ignored(o) {\n    if (!o || o.done || !o.alive || o.optional) return true;\n    if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold' || o.type === 'retractor') return true;\n    if (o.type === 'bead' && o.tag !== 'dacapo-bead') return true;\n    return false;\n  }\n  function toolFor(o) {\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return 'sonar';\n    if (o.type === 'pool') return 'suction';\n    if (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite') return 'salve';\n    if (o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'arteryTear') return 'suture';\n    if (o.type === 'clot') return o.dosed ? 'forceps' : 'syringe';\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return 'syringe';\n    if (o.type === 'lobe') return o.mode === 'scalpel' ? 'scalpel' : o.mode || 'cautery';\n    if (o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'nest') return o.cut ? 'forceps' : 'scalpel';\n    if (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb') return 'cautery';\n    if (o.type === 'slur' || o.type === 'tendril' || o.type === 'spiral' || o.type === 'wire' || o.type === 'repeat' || o.type === 'cut') return 'scalpel';\n    if (o.guide && !o.cut) return 'scalpel';\n    if (o.pairs) return 'suture';\n    if (o.cells && (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite' || o.mode === 'salve')) return 'salve';\n    return 'forceps';\n  }\n  function usable(S, o) {\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return true;\n    if (o.type === 'lobe' && !o.open) return false;\n    if (o.type === 'eye' && !o.open) return false;\n    if (o.type === 'repeat' && !o.open) return false;\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return true;\n    if (o.needsWindow && S.windowOpen <= 0) return false;\n    if (o.needsBoard && S.device && !S.device.shown) return false;\n    return true;\n  }\n  function goals(S) {\n    const list = [];\n    const seen = new Set();\n    const push = o => { if (o && !seen.has(o.id) && !ignored(o)) { seen.add(o.id); list.push(o); } };\n    const sign = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'repeat' && o.open && !o.done);\n    if (sign) push(sign);\n    for (const o of S.objects) {\n      if (ignored(o)) continue;\n      if (S.device && S.device.order && o.type === 'wire' && o.tag !== S.device.order[S.device.next || 0]) continue;\n      if (o.under) {\n        const pool = GAME.Sim.objById(S, o.under);\n        if (pool && !pool.done && pool.vol > 1) { push(pool); continue; }\n      }\n      push(o);\n    }\n    list.sort((a, b) => (a.order - b.order) || (b.drain - a.drain) || (a.id - b.id));\n    return list;\n  }\n  function pointAlong(pts, dist) {\n    let left = dist;\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\n      if (left <= L) {\n        const u = left / L;\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\n      }\n      left -= L;\n    }\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\n  }\n  function polyLen(pts) {\n    let n = 0;\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\n    return n || 1;\n  }\n  function shock(S, p) {\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\n    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\n  }\n  function dressing(S, p) {\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\n  }\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\n    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\n\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\n\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\n      if (!o.window) {\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\n      }\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\n      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\n      }\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\n    }\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\n      const g = o.guide;\n      const start = g[0];\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\n        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\n      }\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\n    }\n\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3), { why: 'screw' });\n      m.ang += 0.55;\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\n    }\n\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, near(o.x, o.y, 2.5), { fine, why: 'grip' });\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\n      if (!o.free && along < o.depth - 0.3) {\n        const n = along + limit * dt;\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\n      }\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\n      }\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\n    }\n    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\n  }\n\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\n    const m = mem(S);\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\n    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\n\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\n    }\n\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\n    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\n    }\n    if (m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds') {\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\n    }\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needBreath && S.activeDoc !== 'vale') consult = true;\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needLook && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova') consult = true;\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\n\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\n    }\n\n    if (S.vitals < 42 && p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.2 && !S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'))) {\n      if (p.fill < 0.93) return go('syringe', 46, 188, 1, { why: 'iv' });\n      return go('syringe', 46, 188, 0, { why: 'iv' });\n    }\n\n    const list = goals(S).filter(o => usable(S, o));\n    if (!list.length) return idle(p, { why: 'wait', fine: !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) });\n    const o = list[Math.min(i, list.length - 1) % list.length];\n    if (m.gid === o.id && Math.abs((o.prog || 0) - m.prog) < 0.01 && usable(S, o) && o.type !== 'reed' && o.type !== 'voice' && o.type !== 'lobe' && o.type !== 'eye') m.stuck += dt;\n    else m.stuck = 0;\n    m.gid = o.id; m.prog = o.prog || 0;\n    if (m.stuck > 8) { o.optional = true; m.stuck = 0; m.skip = o.id; return idle(p, { why: 'unstick' }); }\n    const d = act(S, p, o, dt || 1 / 60, m);\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.jitter) d.fine = true;\n    return d;\n  }\n\n  function play(S, maxT, dt) {\n    dt = dt || 1 / 60;\n    const t0 = S.t;\n    let guard = 0;\n    while (S.t - t0 < maxT && !S.won && !S.lost && guard < 200000) {\n      const inputs = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < S.players.length; i++) {\n        const dev = device(S, i, dt);\n        const p = S.players[i];\n        GAME.Wheel.update(p, dev, dt);\n        if (dev.mouse) GAME.Cursor.update(p, { mouse: dev.mouse, fine: dev.fine }, S, dt);\n        inputs.push({ tool: p.tool, trig: dev.trig, fine: !!dev.fine, gift: !!dev.gift, consult: !!dev.consult, cancel: false, mouse: true });\n      }\n      GAME.Op.step(S, inputs, dt);\n      guard++;\n    }\n    if (!S.won && !S.lost) S.timeout = true;\n    return S;\n  }\n\n  GAME.Bot = { device, play, goals, toolFor };\n})();\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1392,"output_tokens":9436,"cache_read_input_tokens":175232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"f298715f-d780-4a46-8204-151a4fed7073"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1dc9b3c8-de75-4af0-af7d-a5e82c4e6db3-72","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/* Perfect resident. Reads the live operation and aims the way a mouse would.\\n   The same function drives tests, attract mode, and couch colleagues. */\\n(() => {\\n  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\\n  const GAME = (G.GAME ||= {});\\n  const DIGIT = { forceps: 1, scalpel: 2, suture: 3, salve: 4, syringe: 5, cautery: 6, suction: 7, sonar: 8 };\\n  const mems = new WeakMap();\\n\\n  function hyp(x, y) { return Math.hypot(x, y); }\\n  function mem(S) {\\n    let m = mems.get(S);\\n    if (!m) {\\n      m = { ang: 0, skip: 0, giftCd: 0, saw: 0, stuck: 0, gid: 0, prog: -1 };\\n      mems.set(S, m);\\n    }\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  function go(tool, x, y, trig, extra) {\\n    extra = extra || {};\\n    return {\\n      digit: DIGIT[tool] || 1, mouse: [x, y], trig: trig ? 1 : 0,\\n      fine: !!extra.fine, gift: !!extra.gift, consult: !!extra.consult, cancel: false,\\n      aim: [0, 0], move: [0, 0], why: extra.why || tool,\\n    };\\n  }\\n  function idle(p, extra) {\\n    return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, extra);\\n  }\\n  function ignored(o) {\\n    if (!o || o.done || !o.alive || o.optional) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold' || o.type === 'retractor') return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'bead' && o.tag !== 'dacapo-bead') return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n  function toolFor(o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return 'sonar';\\n    if (o.type === 'pool') return 'suction';\\n    if (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite') return 'salve';\\n    if (o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'arteryTear') return 'suture';\\n    if (o.type === 'clot') return o.dosed ? 'forceps' : 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe') return o.mode === 'scalpel' ? 'scalpel' : o.mode || 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'nest') return o.cut ? 'forceps' : 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb') return 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'slur' || o.type === 'tendril' || o.type === 'spiral' || o.type === 'wire' || o.type === 'repeat' || o.type === 'cut') return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.guide && !o.cut) return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.pairs) return 'suture';\\n    if (o.cells && (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite' || o.mode === 'salve')) return 'salve';\\n    return 'forceps';\\n  }\\n  function usable(S, o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'eye' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'repeat' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return true;\\n    if (o.needsWindow && S.windowOpen <= 0) return false;\\n    if (o.needsBoard && S.device && !S.device.shown) return false;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n  function goals(S) {\\n    const list = [];\\n    const seen = new Set();\\n    const push = o => { if (o && !seen.has(o.id) && !ignored(o)) { seen.add(o.id); list.push(o); } };\\n    const sign = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'repeat' && o.open && !o.done);\\n    if (sign) push(sign);\\n    for (const o of S.objects) {\\n      if (ignored(o)) continue;\\n      if (S.device && S.device.order && o.type === 'wire' && o.tag !== S.device.order[S.device.next || 0]) continue;\\n      if (o.under) {\\n        const pool = GAME.Sim.objById(S, o.under);\\n        if (pool && !pool.done && pool.vol > 1) { push(pool); continue; }\\n      }\\n      push(o);\\n    }\\n    list.sort((a, b) => (a.order - b.order) || (b.drain - a.drain) || (a.id - b.id));\\n    return list;\\n  }\\n  function pointAlong(pts, dist) {\\n    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n  function polyLen(pts) {\\n    let n = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\\n    return n || 1;\\n  }\\n  function shock(S, p) {\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\\n    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\\n  }\\n  function dressing(S, p) {\\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\\n  }\\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\\n    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\\n\\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\\n\\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\\n      if (!o.window) {\\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\\n      }\\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\\n      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\\n      }\\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\\n      const g = o.guide;\\n      const start = g[0];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\\n        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\\n      }\\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3), { why: 'screw' });\\n      m.ang += 0.55;\\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, near(o.x, o.y, 2.5), { fine, why: 'grip' });\\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\\n      if (!o.free && along < o.depth - 0.3) {\\n        const n = along + limit * dt;\\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\\n      }\\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\\n      }\\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\\n    }\\n    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\\n    const m = mem(S);\\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\\n    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\\n\\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\\n    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds') {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needBreath && S.activeDoc !== 'vale') consult = true;\\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needLook && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova') consult = true;\\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\\n\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (S.vitals < 42 && p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.2 && !S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'))) {\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93) return go('syringe', 46, 188, 1, { why: 'iv' });\\n      return go('syringe', 46, 188, 0, { why: 'iv' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const list = goals(S).filter(o => usable(S, o));\\n    if (!list.length) return idle(p, { why: 'wait', fine: !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) });\\n    const o = list[Math.min(i, list.length - 1) % list.length];\\n    if (m.gid === o.id && Math.abs((o.prog || 0) - m.prog) < 0.01 && usable(S, o) && o.type !== 'reed' && o.type !== 'voice' && o.type !== 'lobe' && o.type !== 'eye') m.stuck += dt;\\n    else m.stuck = 0;\\n    m.gid = o.id; m.prog = o.prog || 0;\\n    if (m.stuck > 8) { o.optional = true; m.stuck = 0; m.skip = o.id; return idle(p, { why: 'unstick' }); }\\n    const d = act(S, p, o, dt || 1 / 60, m);\\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.jitter) d.fine = true;\\n    return d;\\n  }\\n\\n  function play(S, maxT, dt) {\\n    dt = dt || 1 / 60;\\n    const t0 = S.t;\\n    let guard = 0;\\n    while (S.t - t0 < maxT && !S.won && !S.lost && guard < 200000) {\\n      const inputs = [];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < S.players.length; i++) {\\n        const dev = device(S, i, dt);\\n        const p = S.players[i];\\n        GAME.Wheel.update(p, dev, dt);\\n        if (dev.mouse) GAME.Cursor.update(p, { mouse: dev.mouse, fine: dev.fine }, S, dt);\\n        inputs.push({ tool: p.tool, trig: dev.trig, fine: !!dev.fine, gift: !!dev.gift, consult: !!dev.consult, cancel: false, mouse: true });\\n      }\\n      GAME.Op.step(S, inputs, dt);\\n      guard++;\\n    }\\n    if (!S.won && !S.lost) S.timeout = true;\\n    return S;\\n  }\\n\\n  GAME.Bot = { device, play, goals, toolFor };\\n})();\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/* Perfect resident. Reads the live operation and aims the way a mouse would.\\n   The same function drives tests, attract mode, and couch colleagues. */\\n(() => {\\n  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\\n  const GAME = (G.GAME ||= {});\\n  const DIGIT = { forceps: 1, scalpel: 2, suture: 3, salve: 4, syringe: 5, cautery: 6, suction: 7, sonar: 8 };\\n  const mems = new WeakMap();\\n\\n  function hyp(x, y) { return Math.hypot(x, y); }\\n  function mem(S) {\\n    let m = mems.get(S);\\n    if (!m) {\\n      m = { ang: 0, skip: 0, giftCd: 0, saw: 0, stuck: 0, gid: 0, prog: -1 };\\n      mems.set(S, m);\\n    }\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  function go(tool, x, y, trig, extra) {\\n    extra = extra || {};\\n    return {\\n      digit: DIGIT[tool] || 1, mouse: [x, y], trig: trig ? 1 : 0,\\n      fine: !!extra.fine, gift: !!extra.gift, consult: !!extra.consult, cancel: false,\\n      aim: [0, 0], move: [0, 0], why: extra.why || tool,\\n    };\\n  }\\n  function idle(p, extra) {\\n    return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, extra);\\n  }\\n  function ignored(o) {\\n    if (!o || o.done || !o.alive || o.optional) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold' || o.type === 'retractor') return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'bead' && o.tag !== 'dacapo-bead') return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n  function toolFor(o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return 'sonar';\\n    if (o.type === 'pool') return 'suction';\\n    if (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite') return 'salve';\\n    if (o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'arteryTear') return 'suture';\\n    if (o.type === 'clot') return o.dosed ? 'forceps' : 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe') return o.mode === 'scalpel' ? 'scalpel' : o.mode || 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'nest') return o.cut ? 'forceps' : 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb') return 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'slur' || o.type === 'tendril' || o.type === 'spiral' || o.type === 'wire' || o.type === 'repeat' || o.type === 'cut') return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.guide && !o.cut) return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.pairs) return 'suture';\\n    if (o.cells && (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite' || o.mode === 'salve')) return 'salve';\\n    return 'forceps';\\n  }\\n  function usable(S, o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'eye' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'repeat' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return true;\\n    if (o.needsWindow && S.windowOpen <= 0) return false;\\n    if (o.needsBoard && S.device && !S.device.shown) return false;\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n  function goals(S) {\\n    const list = [];\\n    const seen = new Set();\\n    const push = o => { if (o && !seen.has(o.id) && !ignored(o)) { seen.add(o.id); list.push(o); } };\\n    const sign = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'repeat' && o.open && !o.done);\\n    if (sign) push(sign);\\n    for (const o of S.objects) {\\n      if (ignored(o)) continue;\\n      if (S.device && S.device.order && o.type === 'wire' && o.tag !== S.device.order[S.device.next || 0]) continue;\\n      if (o.under) {\\n        const pool = GAME.Sim.objById(S, o.under);\\n        if (pool && !pool.done && pool.vol > 1) { push(pool); continue; }\\n      }\\n      push(o);\\n    }\\n    list.sort((a, b) => (a.order - b.order) || (b.drain - a.drain) || (a.id - b.id));\\n    return list;\\n  }\\n  function pointAlong(pts, dist) {\\n    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n  function polyLen(pts) {\\n    let n = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\\n    return n || 1;\\n  }\\n  function shock(S, p) {\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\\n    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\\n  }\\n  function dressing(S, p) {\\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\\n  }\\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\\n    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\\n\\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\\n\\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\\n      if (!o.window) {\\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\\n      }\\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\\n      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\\n      }\\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\\n      const g = o.guide;\\n      const start = g[0];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\\n        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\\n      }\\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3), { why: 'screw' });\\n      m.ang += 0.55;\\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, near(o.x, o.y, 2.5), { fine, why: 'grip' });\\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\\n      if (!o.free && along < o.depth - 0.3) {\\n        const n = along + limit * dt;\\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\\n      }\\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\\n      }\\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\\n    }\\n    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\\n    const m = mem(S);\\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\\n    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\\n\\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\\n    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds') {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needBreath && S.activeDoc !== 'vale') consult = true;\\n    if (S.consult && S.flags.needLook && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova') consult = true;\\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\\n\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (S.vitals < 42 && p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.2 && !S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'))) {\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93) return go('syringe', 46, 188, 1, { why: 'iv' });\\n      return go('syringe', 46, 188, 0, { why: 'iv' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const list = goals(S).filter(o => usable(S, o));\\n    if (!list.length) return idle(p, { why: 'wait', fine: !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) });\\n    const o = list[Math.min(i, list.length - 1) % list.length];\\n    if (m.gid === o.id && Math.abs((o.prog || 0) - m.prog) < 0.01 && usable(S, o) && o.type !== 'reed' && o.type !== 'voice' && o.type !== 'lobe' && o.type !== 'eye') m.stuck += dt;\\n    else m.stuck = 0;\\n    m.gid = o.id; m.prog = o.prog || 0;\\n    if (m.stuck > 8) { o.optional = true; m.stuck = 0; m.skip = o.id; return idle(p, { why: 'unstick' }); }\\n    const d = act(S, p, o, dt || 1 / 60, m);\\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.jitter) d.fine = true;\\n    return d;\\n  }\\n\\n  function play(S, maxT, dt) {\\n    dt = dt || 1 / 60;\\n    const t0 = S.t;\\n    let guard = 0;\\n    while (S.t - t0 < maxT && !S.won && !S.lost && guard < 200000) {\\n      const inputs = [];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < S.players.length; i++) {\\n        const dev = device(S, i, dt);\\n        const p = S.players[i];\\n        GAME.Wheel.update(p, dev, dt);\\n        if (dev.mouse) GAME.Cursor.update(p, { mouse: dev.mouse, fine: dev.fine }, S, dt);\\n        inputs.push({ tool: p.tool, trig: dev.trig, fine: !!dev.fine, gift: !!dev.gift, consult: !!dev.consult, cancel: false, mouse: true });\\n      }\\n      GAME.Op.step(S, inputs, dt);\\n      guard++;\\n    }\\n    if (!S.won && !S.lost) S.timeout = true;\\n    return S;\\n  }\\n\\n  GAME.Bot = { device, play, goals, toolFor };\\n})();\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"bb87914a-3d3b-46d9-b7a9-05f5586433c4"}
