{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_72","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now working on content.js. All 11 cases are needed, along with the grand rounds factory, skills lab, story, cast, barks, and lightbox.\n\nWorking through the Glasshouse case in content.js. The scripted dip phase would clear immediately if no objects are required, so I'm adding a dummy object that must be treated by the IV to keep the phase active.\n\nThe scripted dip phase would clear before the player acts because no IV object exists. I'll add a flag-based fix: set `S.flags.iv` in the syringe step when there's no target, and make `phaseClear` check that flag against `needIv` to keep the phase active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b56c8484-4193-4d64-83f9-28d631c8e81d-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","old_string":"        award(S, p, g, 40, tune);\n        pushEv(S, ['iv', Math.round(add), g]);","new_string":"        award(S, p, g, 40, tune);\n        S.flags.iv = (S.flags.iv || 0) + 1;\n        pushEv(S, ['iv', Math.round(add), g]);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b56c8484-4193-4d64-83f9-28d631c8e81d-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","old_string":"    if (S.strain && S.strain.kind === 'staccato') {","new_string":"    if (S.flags.needIv && (S.flags.iv || 0) < S.flags.needIv) return false;\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.kind === 'staccato') {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":434,"output_tokens":885,"cache_read_input_tokens":186112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool