{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_86","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed the bug. `nearest()` measures distance to the object's center.\n\nStitch points can lie 11–22 units from the center. `nearest()` only searches within 9 units, so it never finds them.\n\nThe fix is to measure distance to the current stitch point instead of the object center. The code will iterate objects and check proximity to `q.pairs[q.stitch][0]`.\n\nThe suture fix is complete. The scalpel tool likely has the same bug: it uses `nearest()` with radius 8 against the object center, then checks distance to the guide start. If the guide start is far from the center, the press will miss. I need to check how cut guides are added in the content.\n\nMass rings confirm the same flaw. Their guide starts sit `rad` units from the center, so a 14-unit ring’s start is 30 units from the midpoint, far beyond the 8-unit scalpel radius.\n\nThis explains why the c2 opening cut never begins.\n\nForceps are unaffected because it grasps the object center directly.\n\nSalve is unaffected because it checks cells directly rather than using nearest(). I will also verify the forceps grip radius and review PLAN.md to ensure the fix matches the intended gesture specifications.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28369c16-d271-47b1-8a78-74104b79b81b-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":680,"limit":110}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28369c16-d271-47b1-8a78-74104b79b81b-12","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"suture|within 9|within 8|guide start|needle","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8683,"output_tokens":1219,"cache_read_input_tokens":49536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"90732b8f-91fd-474c-97e7-bb2716c21a5a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-28369c16-d271-47b1-8a78-74104b79b81b-11","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"680→    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (down && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      if (p.fill < 1) p.fill = Math.min(1, p.fill + dt / 0.55);\\n      else p.over += dt;\\n    }\\n    if (p.trigRelease && p.fill > 0.05 && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      const bubble = p.over >= 0.3;\\n      const tgt = nearest(S, p, 10, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'clot' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'syringe')));\\n      if (tgt) {\\n        if ((tgt.type === 'reed' || tgt.type === 'voice') && !tgt.window) {\\n690→          addObj(S, { type: 'laceration', x: tgt.x + 6, y: tgt.y, r: 8, order: 50, drain: 0.2 });\\n          slip(S, p, 'spit', 2, tune);\\n        } else {\\n          const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n          tgt.dosed = true;\\n          tgt.dose = (bubble ? 0.5 : 1) * p.fill;\\n          if (tgt.follow === 'salve') {\\n            tgt.mode = 'salve';\\n            if (!tgt.cells) {\\n              const r = tgt.r || 8;\\n700→              tgt.cells = [];\\n              for (let y = -r; y <= r; y += 4) for (let x = -r; x <= r; x += 4) {\\n                if (x * x + y * y <= r * r) tgt.cells.push([tgt.x + x, tgt.y + y, 0]);\\n              }\\n            }\\n          } else if (tgt.type === 'clot') { tgt.drain = 0.1; }\\n          else { tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; }\\n          award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n          pushEv(S, ['inject', tgt.id, g]);\\n        }\\n710→      } else {\\n        const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n        const add = syringeDose(S, tune) * p.fill * (bubble ? 0.5 : 1);\\n        S.vitals = Math.min(99, S.vitals + add);\\n        award(S, p, g, 40, tune);\\n        S.flags.iv = (S.flags.iv || 0) + 1;\\n        pushEv(S, ['iv', Math.round(add), g]);\\n      }\\n      p.fill = 0; p.over = 0; p.cool = 0.35;\\n    }\\n720→    if (!down && p.trigRelease === false) { /* keep fill while aiming */ }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepCautery(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.lock > 0) { p.lock -= dt; p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt); return; }\\n    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (!down) {\\n      p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt);\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      return;\\n730→    }\\n    p.heat += tune.fluids.cauteryHeat * dt;\\n    if (p.heat >= 1) { p.lock = 1.2; p.heat = 1; slip(S, p, 'lock', 1, tune); pushEv(S, ['lock', p.id]); return; }\\n    if (nerveHit(S, p, tune)) return;\\n    const tgt = nearest(S, p, 6, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'cautery') || o.type === 'barb'));\\n    if (tgt) {\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      tgt.burn = (tgt.burn || 0) + dt;\\n      tgt.prog = tgt.burn / (tgt.need || 0.5);\\n      if (tgt.burn >= (tgt.need || 0.5) / Math.max(0.25, tune.strains.health) && !tgt.done) {\\n740→        const dirty = tgt.charred || p.lockedDuring;\\n        const g = (!tgt.charred && p.lock <= 0 && !p.hadLock) ? 'textbook' : 'clean';\\n        tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; tgt.grade = g;\\n        p.burned += 1;\\n        award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n        pushEv(S, ['burn', tgt.id, g]);\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      p.bareT = (p.bareT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (p.bareT >= 0.25) {\\n750→        /* char on the field */\\n        p.charT = (p.charT || 0) + dt;\\n        S.vitals -= 0.8 * dt * tune.patient.slip;\\n        if (p.bareT >= 0.6 && !p.charSlip) { p.charSlip = true; slip(S, p, 'char', 2, tune); pushEv(S, ['char', Math.round(p.x), Math.round(p.y)]); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSuction(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n760→    const pool = nearest(S, p, 14, o => o.type === 'pool' && !o.done && o.vol > 0);\\n    if (!pool) return;\\n    const rate = tune.fluids.suction;\\n    const before = pool.vol;\\n    pool.vol = Math.max(0, pool.vol - rate * dt);\\n    p.suctioned += before - pool.vol;\\n    pool.prog = 1 - pool.vol / (pool.max || 1);\\n    if (pool.vol <= 0.2) { pool.done = true; pool.alive = false; pool.vol = 0; pushEv(S, ['dry', pool.id]); }\\n  }\\n\\n770→  function stepSonar(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n    let rad = 38;\\n    if (S.activeDoc === 'vale' || S.gift === 'breath') rad *= 1.25;\\n    if (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc === 'vale') rad *= 1.25;\\n    p.sonarR = rad;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n      const o = S.objects[i];\\n      if (!o.hidden || o.done) continue;\\n      if (hypot(o.x - p.x, o.y - p.y) <= rad) { o.marked = true; o.markT = 4; pushEv(S, ['mark', o.id]); }\\n780→    }\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && hypot(p.x - (S.device.x || 213), p.y - (S.device.y || 116)) <= rad) {\\n      S.device.shown = true;\\n      for (const o of S.objects) if (o.needsBoard) { o.hidden = false; o.marked = true; o.markT = 6; }\\n      pushEv(S, ['board', 1]);\\n    }\\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.kind === 'legato') {\\n      for (const w of S.strain.worms || []) if (hypot(w.x - p.x, w.y - p.y) <= rad) w.marked = true;\\n    }\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"680→    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (down && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      if (p.fill < 1) p.fill = Math.min(1, p.fill + dt / 0.55);\\n      else p.over += dt;\\n    }\\n    if (p.trigRelease && p.fill > 0.05 && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      const bubble = p.over >= 0.3;\\n      const tgt = nearest(S, p, 10, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'clot' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'syringe')));\\n      if (tgt) {\\n        if ((tgt.type === 'reed' || tgt.type === 'voice') && !tgt.window) {\\n690→          addObj(S, { type: 'laceration', x: tgt.x + 6, y: tgt.y, r: 8, order: 50, drain: 0.2 });\\n          slip(S, p, 'spit', 2, tune);\\n        } else {\\n          const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n          tgt.dosed = true;\\n          tgt.dose = (bubble ? 0.5 : 1) * p.fill;\\n          if (tgt.follow === 'salve') {\\n            tgt.mode = 'salve';\\n            if (!tgt.cells) {\\n              const r = tgt.r || 8;\\n700→              tgt.cells = [];\\n              for (let y = -r; y <= r; y += 4) for (let x = -r; x <= r; x += 4) {\\n                if (x * x + y * y <= r * r) tgt.cells.push([tgt.x + x, tgt.y + y, 0]);\\n              }\\n            }\\n          } else if (tgt.type === 'clot') { tgt.drain = 0.1; }\\n          else { tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; }\\n          award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n          pushEv(S, ['inject', tgt.id, g]);\\n        }\\n710→      } else {\\n        const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n        const add = syringeDose(S, tune) * p.fill * (bubble ? 0.5 : 1);\\n        S.vitals = Math.min(99, S.vitals + add);\\n        award(S, p, g, 40, tune);\\n        S.flags.iv = (S.flags.iv || 0) + 1;\\n        pushEv(S, ['iv', Math.round(add), g]);\\n      }\\n      p.fill = 0; p.over = 0; p.cool = 0.35;\\n    }\\n720→    if (!down && p.trigRelease === false) { /* keep fill while aiming */ }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepCautery(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.lock > 0) { p.lock -= dt; p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt); return; }\\n    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (!down) {\\n      p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt);\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      return;\\n730→    }\\n    p.heat += tune.fluids.cauteryHeat * dt;\\n    if (p.heat >= 1) { p.lock = 1.2; p.heat = 1; slip(S, p, 'lock', 1, tune); pushEv(S, ['lock', p.id]); return; }\\n    if (nerveHit(S, p, tune)) return;\\n    const tgt = nearest(S, p, 6, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'cautery') || o.type === 'barb'));\\n    if (tgt) {\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      tgt.burn = (tgt.burn || 0) + dt;\\n      tgt.prog = tgt.burn / (tgt.need || 0.5);\\n      if (tgt.burn >= (tgt.need || 0.5) / Math.max(0.25, tune.strains.health) && !tgt.done) {\\n740→        const dirty = tgt.charred || p.lockedDuring;\\n        const g = (!tgt.charred && p.lock <= 0 && !p.hadLock) ? 'textbook' : 'clean';\\n        tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; tgt.grade = g;\\n        p.burned += 1;\\n        award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n        pushEv(S, ['burn', tgt.id, g]);\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      p.bareT = (p.bareT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (p.bareT >= 0.25) {\\n750→        /* char on the field */\\n        p.charT = (p.charT || 0) + dt;\\n        S.vitals -= 0.8 * dt * tune.patient.slip;\\n        if (p.bareT >= 0.6 && !p.charSlip) { p.charSlip = true; slip(S, p, 'char', 2, tune); pushEv(S, ['char', Math.round(p.x), Math.round(p.y)]); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSuction(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n760→    const pool = nearest(S, p, 14, o => o.type === 'pool' && !o.done && o.vol > 0);\\n    if (!pool) return;\\n    const rate = tune.fluids.suction;\\n    const before = pool.vol;\\n    pool.vol = Math.max(0, pool.vol - rate * dt);\\n    p.suctioned += before - pool.vol;\\n    pool.prog = 1 - pool.vol / (pool.max || 1);\\n    if (pool.vol <= 0.2) { pool.done = true; pool.alive = false; pool.vol = 0; pushEv(S, ['dry', pool.id]); }\\n  }\\n\\n770→  function stepSonar(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n    let rad = 38;\\n    if (S.activeDoc === 'vale' || S.gift === 'breath') rad *= 1.25;\\n    if (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc === 'vale') rad *= 1.25;\\n    p.sonarR = rad;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n      const o = S.objects[i];\\n      if (!o.hidden || o.done) continue;\\n      if (hypot(o.x - p.x, o.y - p.y) <= rad) { o.marked = true; o.markT = 4; pushEv(S, ['mark', o.id]); }\\n780→    }\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && hypot(p.x - (S.device.x || 213), p.y - (S.device.y || 116)) <= rad) {\\n      S.device.shown = true;\\n      for (const o of S.objects) if (o.needsBoard) { o.hidden = false; o.marked = true; o.markT = 6; }\\n      pushEv(S, ['board', 1]);\\n    }\\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.kind === 'legato') {\\n      for (const w of S.strain.worms || []) if (hypot(w.x - p.x, w.y - p.y) <= rad) w.marked = true;\\n    }\\n  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js\",\"offset\":680,\"limit\":110,\"raw_output\":\"    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (down && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      if (p.fill < 1) p.fill = Math.min(1, p.fill + dt / 0.55);\\n      else p.over += dt;\\n    }\\n    if (p.trigRelease && p.fill > 0.05 && p.cool <= 0) {\\n      const bubble = p.over >= 0.3;\\n      const tgt = nearest(S, p, 10, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'clot' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'syringe')));\\n      if (tgt) {\\n        if ((tgt.type === 'reed' || tgt.type === 'voice') && !tgt.window) {\\n          addObj(S, { type: 'laceration', x: tgt.x + 6, y: tgt.y, r: 8, order: 50, drain: 0.2 });\\n          slip(S, p, 'spit', 2, tune);\\n        } else {\\n          const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n          tgt.dosed = true;\\n          tgt.dose = (bubble ? 0.5 : 1) * p.fill;\\n          if (tgt.follow === 'salve') {\\n            tgt.mode = 'salve';\\n            if (!tgt.cells) {\\n              const r = tgt.r || 8;\\n              tgt.cells = [];\\n              for (let y = -r; y <= r; y += 4) for (let x = -r; x <= r; x += 4) {\\n                if (x * x + y * y <= r * r) tgt.cells.push([tgt.x + x, tgt.y + y, 0]);\\n              }\\n            }\\n          } else if (tgt.type === 'clot') { tgt.drain = 0.1; }\\n          else { tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; }\\n          award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n          pushEv(S, ['inject', tgt.id, g]);\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        const g = bubble ? 'sloppy' : (p.fill >= 0.9 ? 'textbook' : 'clean');\\n        const add = syringeDose(S, tune) * p.fill * (bubble ? 0.5 : 1);\\n        S.vitals = Math.min(99, S.vitals + add);\\n        award(S, p, g, 40, tune);\\n        S.flags.iv = (S.flags.iv || 0) + 1;\\n        pushEv(S, ['iv', Math.round(add), g]);\\n      }\\n      p.fill = 0; p.over = 0; p.cool = 0.35;\\n    }\\n    if (!down && p.trigRelease === false) { /* keep fill while aiming */ }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepCautery(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.lock > 0) { p.lock -= dt; p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt); return; }\\n    const down = p.trig > 0.3;\\n    if (!down) {\\n      p.heat = Math.max(0, p.heat - 0.6 * dt);\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    p.heat += tune.fluids.cauteryHeat * dt;\\n    if (p.heat >= 1) { p.lock = 1.2; p.heat = 1; slip(S, p, 'lock', 1, tune); pushEv(S, ['lock', p.id]); return; }\\n    if (nerveHit(S, p, tune)) return;\\n    const tgt = nearest(S, p, 6, o => canTouch(S, o) && (o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'cautery') || o.type === 'barb'));\\n    if (tgt) {\\n      p.bareT = 0;\\n      tgt.burn = (tgt.burn || 0) + dt;\\n      tgt.prog = tgt.burn / (tgt.need || 0.5);\\n      if (tgt.burn >= (tgt.need || 0.5) / Math.max(0.25, tune.strains.health) && !tgt.done) {\\n        const dirty = tgt.charred || p.lockedDuring;\\n        const g = (!tgt.charred && p.lock <= 0 && !p.hadLock) ? 'textbook' : 'clean';\\n        tgt.done = true; tgt.alive = false; tgt.drain = 0; tgt.grade = g;\\n        p.burned += 1;\\n        award(S, p, g, 90, tune);\\n        pushEv(S, ['burn', tgt.id, g]);\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      p.bareT = (p.bareT || 0) + dt;\\n      if (p.bareT >= 0.25) {\\n        /* char on the field */\\n        p.charT = (p.charT || 0) + dt;\\n        S.vitals -= 0.8 * dt * tune.patient.slip;\\n        if (p.bareT >= 0.6 && !p.charSlip) { p.charSlip = true; slip(S, p, 'char', 2, tune); pushEv(S, ['char', Math.round(p.x), Math.round(p.y)]); }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSuction(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n    const pool = nearest(S, p, 14, o => o.type === 'pool' && !o.done && o.vol > 0);\\n    if (!pool) return;\\n    const rate = tune.fluids.suction;\\n    const before = pool.vol;\\n    pool.vol = Math.max(0, pool.vol - rate * dt);\\n    p.suctioned += before - pool.vol;\\n    pool.prog = 1 - pool.vol / (pool.max || 1);\\n    if (pool.vol <= 0.2) { pool.done = true; pool.alive = false; pool.vol = 0; pushEv(S, ['dry', pool.id]); }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepSonar(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n    let rad = 38;\\n    if (S.activeDoc === 'vale' || S.gift === 'breath') rad *= 1.25;\\n    if (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc === 'vale') rad *= 1.25;\\n    p.sonarR = rad;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n      const o = S.objects[i];\\n      if (!o.hidden || o.done) continue;\\n      if (hypot(o.x - p.x, o.y - p.y) <= rad) { o.marked = true; o.markT = 4; pushEv(S, ['mark', o.id]); }\\n    }\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && hypot(p.x - (S.device.x || 213), p.y - (S.device.y || 116)) <= rad) {\\n      S.device.shown = true;\\n      for (const o of S.objects) if (o.needsBoard) { o.hidden = false; o.marked = true; o.markT = 6; }\\n      pushEv(S, ['board', 1]);\\n    }\\n    if (S.strain && S.strain.kind === 'legato') {\\n      for (const w of S.strain.worms || []) if (hypot(w.x - p.x, w.y - p.y) <= rad) w.marked = true;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":1747}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-28369c16-d271-47b1-8a78-74104b79b81b-12","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,52,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,47,80,76,65,78,46,109,100,10,50,52,50,58,42,42,83,99,97,108,112,101,108,46,42,42,32,84,104,101,32,103,117,105,100,101,32,105,115,32,97,32,112,111,108,121,108,105,110,101,46,32,80,114,101,115,115,32,119,105,116,104,105,110,32,56,32,117,32,111,102,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,97,114,116,46,32,80,114,111,103,114,101,115,115,32,105,115,32,116,104,101,32,102,117,114,116,104,101,115,116,32,97,114,99,32,108,101,110,103,116,104,32,114,101,97,99,104,101,100,46,32,68,105,115,116,97,110,99,101,32,102,114,111,109,32,116,104,101,32,108,105,110,101,32,111,118,101,114,32,57,32,117,32,102,111,114,32,46,49,50,32,115,32,105,115,32,97,32,42,42,115,108,105,112,42,42,32,40,115,104,111,114,116,32,108,97,99,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,44,32,118,105,116,97,108,115,32,45,51,41,44,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,114,111,107,101,32,103,111,101,115,32,111,110,32,119,104,101,110,32,121,111,117,32,99,111,109,101,32,98,97,99,107,46,32,82,101,108,101,97,115,101,32,101,97,114,108,121,32,97,110,