{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_95","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"c1 and c3 won. c2 lost on the mass.\n\nThe mass phase timed out after 240 seconds. The bot likely got stuck tracing the ring or extracting the forceps. Phases 0 through 2 completed with a score of 1198.\n\nThe mass timeout likely stems from one of four issues. The ring guide start may be blocked. Tracing a closed ring could cause the distance metric to wrap incorrectly. The bot might slash healthy tissue or slip off the ring. Or the cut flag never sets, so the forceps cannot extract the mass.\n\nThe ring progress likely stalls because `polyDist.along` resets to zero near the end of a closed loop. The bot's position snaps back to the start, so `far` never increases and the stroke never completes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c462029e-8658-4a2e-a83b-34b52eb29be5-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function polyDist","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":481,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":85504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"73676e10-8ecb-4a85-8f70-be6a81733775"}
