{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_102","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fermata stage 1 covers the eye with a dome for five seconds.\n\nTools inside the dome do nothing. The eye opens for 0.7 seconds after the dome expires, or 2.8 seconds if the bot breathes. The bot must cautery the eye during that window. If it misses, another dome lasts five seconds unless the bot has already hit three times. After three hits, stage two begins. The bot triggers Long Breath one second after the script sets needBreath.\n\nThe bot should easily hit the eye during the open window. The dome is centered at (200, 116) with radius 34. The eye is closed when the dome is up and open when it expires. Cautery burns at the eye's coordinates.\n\nThe 0.3-second burn is well within the 2-second heat lock limit. The bot might be pressing gift instead of cautery, which would waste the open window. I need to check the initial steady value in blank() because the bot only triggers gift once steady reaches 35.\n\nThe eye opens in stepFermata after applyTools, so the dome stays up for one extra frame. The bot detects the open eye on the next frame and should cautery then. The 0.7-second window should be reachable.\n\nThe 0.7-second window spans roughly 31 frames. Vitals should be around 68 during that first open period, so IVing is unlikely. The bot can touch the eye exactly within six pixels while it is open. Eloquent is ignored by the goal system.\n\nThe bot idles when nothing is usable. The eye becomes the first goal once it opens.\n\nIf the bot burns the eye to done during the open window, stepFermata immediately increments hits and resets the eye state. This means the bot could reach three hits before the window closes.\n\nThe bot should finish stage one in about seventeen seconds. The burn might not register because of Long Breath world scale.\n\nBreath scales world time to 0.25× real time. The eye window therefore lasts 2.8 seconds of real time instead of 0.7, which is easier for the bot to hit.\n\nI will write a scratch script to log fermata stage, eye state, dome status, and bot behavior for the first fifteen seconds. The initial dome and eye share the same center coordinates.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-25ae3eca-35dc-411e-a191-65988f32874c-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"steady:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-25ae3eca-35dc-411e-a191-65988f32874c-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1268,"limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5395,"output_tokens":1918,"cache_read_input_tokens":94720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"d38e2a3e-0ce9-472e-9044-db0d27357353"}
