'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916\\\" && node --check src/core/sim.js && node --check src/bot/bot.js && node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/play.js\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Replay all eleven cases and Grand Rounds\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9%2Fwork/01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e/terminal/call-04645644-f053-4ffd-9c71-c6d9cd3a05bc-47.log\",\"total_bytes\":1458}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"64dae225-17e0-46f0-803b-d7bb84c85005"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_110","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"c10 reached stage 3. A leftover eye and fermata-pull note remain.\n\nThe bot scored 1325. It failed to pull the note before time ran out. The note type triggers a snap instead of a tear.\n\nSnap does not block progress. The bot should still free the note when along reaches depth. The slip does not release the grip. The reason it remains stuck is unclear.\n\nThe eye is not the goal. It is closed and filtered out. The note has lower priority than the eye but remains usable. The bot should pull the note. Something else must be blocking it.\n\nThe eye may still be hidden and unmarked. The usable() function returns true for hidden, unmarked objects, so the bot sonars the eye forever instead of pulling the note.\n\nThe hidden-eye theory is unlikely. After a successful stage 2 mark, the eye is unhidden and closed, so the note should be targeted. The pull may be snapping or tearing before reaching depth, or the note's origin and axis may misdirect it. The bot cannot grip the eye. I will examine the note pull logic more closely.\n\nA snapped note may be stuck because of a bug that prevents freeing it. The pull path from (250, 90) upward to y=32 is valid and not blocked by field clamps. A lingering dome from stage two might be blocking the tool at the eye's old position.\n\nStage 2 does not raise domes. The stage 1 dome at (200, 116) is too far from the note at (250, 90) to block tools. I will add logging to ferm.js to inspect stage 3 behavior directly. The bot's pull speed is 24 units per second, calculated from tension 40.\n\nThe pull math checks out. The origin is fixed at spawn, the axis points straight up, and the bot moves exactly along it with no sideways drift. Tension 40 is not exceeded, so speed or perpendicular forces cannot trigger a snap. Fermata jitter is disabled. The only remaining explanation is that the bot is stuck sonaring the eye instead of pulling the note.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d21f6de-29e3-4caf-a060-ab6e365b5ef5-48","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/ferm.js","old_string":"  if (S.phaseName === 'Fermata' && acc > 0.4) {\n    acc = 0;\n    const st = S.strain;\n    const eye = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'eye');\n    console.log(\n      't', S.t.toFixed(1), 'why', dev.why, 'tool', p.tool, 'trig', dev.trig,\n      'at', Math.round(p.x), Math.round(p.y),\n      'st', st && st.stage, 'hits', st && st.hits, 'openT', st && (st.eyeOpen || 0).toFixed(2),\n      'domes', st && st.domes.length,\n      'eyeOpen', eye && eye.open, 'burn', eye && (eye.burn || 0).toFixed(2), 'edone', eye && eye.done,\n      'breath', S.breath, 'steady', Math.round(S.steady), 'vit', Math.round(S.vitals),\n      'needB', !!S.flags.needBreath\n    );\n  }","new_string":"  if (S.strain && S.strain.stage >= 2 && acc > 0.5) {\n    acc = 0;\n    const st = S.strain;\n    const eye = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'eye');\n    const note = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'fermata-pull');\n    const sl = S.objects.filter(o => o.tag === 'sliver-a' || o.tag === 'sliver-b').map(o => (o.done ? 'D' : 'o') + (o.hidden ? 'h' : '') + (o.free ? 'f' : ''));\n    console.log(\n      't', S.t.toFixed(1), 'why', dev.why, 'tool', p.tool, 'trig', dev.trig,\n      'at', Math.round(p.x), Math.round(p.y), 'held', p.held,\n      'st', st.stage, 'hits', st.hits,\n      'eye', eye && ['hid'+eye.hidden, 'mk'+eye.marked, 'op'+eye.open, 'dn'+eye.done, 'al'+eye.alive].join(' '),\n      'sl', sl.join(','),\n      'note', note && ['p'+Math.round(note.prog||0), 'free'+note.free, 'dn'+note.done, 'snap'+note.snapped, 'xy'+Math.round(note.x)+','+Math.round(note.y)].join(' '),\n      'vit', Math.round(S.vitals), 'clk', Math.round(S.clock)\n    );\n    if (S.t > 120) break;\n  }"}}],"stop_reason