{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_118","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"When free and distance are both at least 26, dish immediately.\n\nThe bot reads state before the step, so it dishes on the next frame after free is set. However, crossing depth 27 to 29.5 in one frame spikes instant tension to 112, which exceeds the 40 limit and triggers a snap.\n\nA snap does not prevent the object from freeing. The instant tension spike only occurs on the single crossing frame, and a 0.28-second cooldown prevents repeated snaps. The object still completes despite one slip.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c958af2d-26d3-40a8-8229-8b46774f2ee1-57","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916\" && node --check src/bot/bot.js && node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/play.js","description":"Replay all cases after deep-pull dish fix","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":546,"output_tokens":687,"cache_read_input_tokens":142720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"d0ebc6f2-fc15-48d7-8165-d4cf29150b97"}
