-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":575,\"content\":\"- `settings.define(sp)`: add a setting: { key, label, type: 'toggle' | 'slider' | 'select', value, min, max, step, options: [[value, label]] or [value], help, group: 'Game', apply(game, value) }. Its saved value is loaded (when it is a valid one) and applied; it shows on the settings screen. Returns its value\"},{\"line_number\":1070,\"content\":\"- `game.audio.bus(name = 'sfx')`: a bus for a sound of the game's own (Web Audio nodes it makes on audio.ctx: a babble voice, a loop, an instrument) to connect to, so it follows the volume, the mute and the player's settings: 'sfx', 'music', 'voice' (its level is voiceVolume) or 'master'. Returns a GainNode, or null where there is no sound (headless, no Web Audio)\"},{\"line_number\":1072,\"content\":\"- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\"},{\"line_number\":1091,\"content\":\"- `game.audio.musicVolume = .5`, `game.audio.sfxVolume = 1`, `game.audio.voiceVolume = 1`: 0..1 for effects, music and the voice bus (bus('voice'))\"},{\"line_number\":1094,\"content\":\"- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"7bf2974b-abcb-4ae4-a78d-99615b514316"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_126","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I understand how to boot the game.\n\nI'm structuring the game.js state machine around scenes for title, menu, files, story, chart, op, results, ward, credits, about, attract, lobby, and lab. The playthrough test will use zero fade time, skip story, and drive the bot through ops with confirmations. It will follow the full flow from New Game to difficulty selection, then story skip, chart lightbox, ops, results, ward, door, and next story.\n\nStory lines auto-advance every 0.08 seconds. Choices wait for confirmation. Events with wait:true trigger the operation and hold until story.resume(). The test must drive this reliably.\n\nAttract mode hooks input for idle. It shows title, menu, casefiles, and lobby for ten seconds. A reel plays real scenes with a bot using cheats. Any input returns to title and consumes all events.\n\nDev mode adds a pause menu item. A panel controls GAME.Dev.set, reset, and cheat. It also allows jumping directly to a case.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a80e1cba-fdce-4e43-b9d7-b79991790e18-75","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"getGamepads","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a80e1cba-fdce-4e43-b9d7-b79991790e18-76","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js","offset":430,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3597,"output_tokens":672,"cache_read_input_tokens":182272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"53eff75f-d64a-4dbf-a9cf-8c1840148565"}
