{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_140","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the cursor update signature and wheel to determine how to feed devices from the game loop.\n\nPlanning the full implementation. Will write game.js with all scenes, hub integration, attract hook, dev panel, and debug snapshot. Also creating art/field.js for visuals and audio.js. A test runner will validate both the shipped sim and the new game.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4317c35-41c5-43e9-a653-3a5ed1d03cde-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":88,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4317c35-41c5-43e9-a653-3a5ed1d03cde-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1640,"limit":130}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4317c35-41c5-43e9-a653-3a5ed1d03cde-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js","offset":280,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4317c35-41c5-43e9-a653-3a5ed1d03cde-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"roundsCase|LIGHT =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4317c35-41c5-43e9-a653-3a5ed1d03cde-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-22391