{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_150","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tissue shade uses putImageData and Uint32Array on the image data buffer.\n\nThe nullCanvas proxy correctly maps createImageData arguments to image dimensions. Uint32Array views alias the Uint8ClampedArray buffer. putImageData is a no-op. shade() will compute values directly. Now writing files.\n\nThe game will be split into src/art/field.js, src/audio/audio.js, and src/scenes/shell.js. manifest.json lists the module load order. Tests load modules after the engine. about.js will hold GAME.ABOUT. Input labels and settings glyphs need review. Audio will use a browser OfflineAudioContext renderer plus a pure buffer synthesizer for Node tests.\n\nNode tests assert music volume at 0.1. The renderProbe method accepts an OfflineAudioContext and returns RMS, or creates one if none exists; in Node it returns null. The music signature accepts a song object. Song definitions use step-based notation with waveforms and volumes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-13c855ed-dc40-4a1d-b7e3-4cdd4a0a38e6-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"portrait","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2960,"output_tokens":1137,"cache_read_input_tokens":122368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"cb474356-6f3c-4ffa-8464-b7d12b16b330"}
