{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_153","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed that Enter, Space, and Pad0 are the key inputs for confirm and useTool.\n\nStory and menu dialogs will use confirm or start. Ward movement will use input.move() for left stick, dpad, and WASD.\n\nMouse clicks will set a walk target. Interact uses confirm near people or doors. The ward will be a 20x12 corridor with a door within eight tiles, patient markers, and 48 px/s movement. Leaving requires standing within eighteen pixels of the door and pressing confirm. Chapter logic will derive from the last case. Save access will be enabled only in the ward scene.\n\nRank saves will store the current rank in RT.save.ranks when the save is clean and no cheat was used. A DEV tag will appear if the game was tuned or a cheat was active.\n\nThe attract reel will run real scene logic inside the attract scene rather than switching scenes. Each segment will set up its own state. The first segment will play a brief story that auto-advances after four seconds.\n\nThe attract reel will cycle through real OP cases with bots and active cheats for fifteen seconds each. Cheats like lockVitals, freezeClock, and oneHit will keep the demo ops busy without killing them. No saves will be written during the reel. A DEMO ribbon will be drawn on screen. Any input will exit the reel immediately; the hook consumes all presses before the scene update runs.\n\nA latch will prevent the title scene from reacting to the exit press in the same frame. The attract flag will be cleared before returning to the title. The dev panel will have Tuning, Cheats, Jump, and Info tabs across eight rows.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-56c84457-5c1d-452c-ab47-93a67ce528fe-47","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"do === 'code'|case 'code'|scripts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":903,"output_tokens":1004,"cache_read_input_tokens":129664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"ca892ec9-8456-4758-b526-bb2afd790a97"}
