{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_157","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cheats are functional through S.cheat.\n\nDev panel toggles will control cheats. Slow motion will be handled via GAME.Dev.slow and game.timeScale. Autosurgeon will set RT.bot to true for Bot.device. Now writing all files.\n\nWriting files in this order: art, audio, about, shell, tests, then build. The operation field renderer will center the background and stamp alive objects like pools and wounds.\n\nThe operation field renderer shades the tissue canvas with beat, breath, and sonar lens effects. It overlays instruments and HUD elements on top. The developer estimates the shade call will add roughly nine seconds of CPU time across thirty seconds of gameplay, which should be acceptable; otherwise it can run every other frame.\n\nShading will run every frame. The title scene will fill the full buffer with sky, buildings, rain lines, and centered title text using E.font.title and r.text. The title scene view will be set to 'side', while the main game runs in 'overhead'.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6cfea71f-1352-473b-8274-a8f43dab6084-51","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"setView|this\\.view =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1372,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":134272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"f4173505-327e-4661-8899-3c525c0594eb"}
