{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_171","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"p.inst is set in readInputs from movement since the last frame.\n\nA large position jump while held creates high instantaneous tension, causing a tear. Slow movement avoids this. Tests will be deterministic. The cursor test will call updateCursor directly with a forceps tool and empty objects to bypass magnet targets.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b56d8867-941f-478e-a825-06ea66529a7a-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function secondLook|function forceRewind|function pushRing","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1839,"output_tokens":477,"cache_read_input_tokens":167936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"99fdbf14-b5f3-4c85-b4ff-c3422332b614"}
