{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_174","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A code blue is triggered when a resident's vitals read zero.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b41acdf9-6cce-4274-a42f-fb4bf9ca3e0e-71","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1489,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1487,"output_tokens":336,"cache_read_input_tokens":172416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"dd3266a4-05b1-4900-96ee-64d8913d39bd"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b41acdf9-6cce-4274-a42f-fb4bf9ca3e0e-71","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1489→  function stepCodeBlue(S, dt) {\\n1490→    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    if (!cb) return;\\n    cb.t += dt;\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const p = S.players[0];\\n    if (cb.next == null) cb.next = 0;\\n    if (cb.next < 4) {\\n      const peak = peaks[cb.next];\\n      if (p && p.trigEdge) {\\n        const err = Math.abs(cb.t - peak);\\n1500→        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        if (err <= 0.14) {\\n          cb.hits += 1;\\n          if (err <= 0.06) cb.textbook = (cb.textbook || 0) + 1;\\n          pushEv(S, ['shock', cb.hits, err]);\\n        } else pushEv(S, ['miss', err]);\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n      } else if (cb.t > peak + 0.14) {\\n        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n1510→        pushEv(S, ['miss', 1]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (cb.next >= 4 && !cb.resolved) {\\n      cb.resolved = true;\\n      S.codeBlue = null;\\n      if (cb.hits >= 2) {\\n        S.vitals = 30;\\n        S.flags.crash = 0;\\n        pushEv(S, ['revived', cb.textbook >= 2 ? 'textbook' : 'clean']);\\n1520→      } else lose(S, 'code');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function maybeDie(S) {\\n    if (S.won || S.lost || S.codeBlue || S.dressing) return;\\n    if (S.clock <= 0) { lose(S, 'time'); return; }\\n    if (S.vitals <= 0) {\\n      if (S.diff === 'attending' || S.codeBlueUsed) { lose(S, 'vitals'); return; }\",\"content_concise\":\"1489→  function stepCodeBlue(S, dt) {\\n1490→    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    if (!cb) return;\\n    cb.t += dt;\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const p = S.players[0];\\n    if (cb.next == null) cb.next = 0;\\n    if (cb.next < 4) {\\n      const peak = peaks[cb.next];\\n      if (p && p.trigEdge) {\\n        const err = Math.abs(cb.t - peak);\\n1500→        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        if (err <= 0.14) {\\n          cb.hits += 1;\\n          if (err <= 0.06) cb.textbook = (cb.textbook || 0) + 1;\\n          pushEv(S, ['shock', cb.hits, err]);\\n        } else pushEv(S, ['miss', err]);\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n      } else if (cb.t > peak + 0.14) {\\n        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n1510→        pushEv(S, ['miss', 1]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (cb.next >= 4 && !cb.resolved) {\\n      cb.resolved = true;\\n      S.codeBlue = null;\\n      if (cb.hits >= 2) {\\n        S.vitals = 30;\\n        S.flags.crash = 0;\\n        pushEv(S, ['revived', cb.textbook >= 2 ? 'textbook' : 'clean']);\\n1520→      } else lose(S, 'code');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function maybeDie(S) {\\n    if (S.won || S.lost || S.codeBlue || S.dressing) return;\\n    if (S.clock <= 0) { lose(S, 'time'); return; }\\n    if (S.vitals <= 0) {\\n      if (S.diff === 'attending' || S.codeBlueUsed) { lose(S, 'vitals'); return; }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js\",\"offset\":1489,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  function stepCodeBlue(S, dt) {\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    if (!cb) return;\\n    cb.t += dt;\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const p = S.players[0];\\n    if (cb.next == null) cb.next = 0;\\n    if (cb.next < 4) {\\n      const peak = peaks[cb.next];\\n      if (p && p.trigEdge) {\\n        const err = Math.abs(cb.t - peak);\\n        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        if (err <= 0.14) {\\n          cb.hits += 1;\\n          if (err <= 0.06) cb.textbook = (cb.textbook || 0) + 1;\\n          pushEv(S, ['shock', cb.hits, err]);\\n        } else pushEv(S, ['miss', err]);\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n      } else if (cb.t > peak + 0.14) {\\n        cb.attempts += 1;\\n        cb.next += 1;\\n        pushEv(S, ['miss', 1]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (cb.next >= 4 && !cb.resolved) {\\n      cb.resolved = true;\\n      S.codeBlue = null;\\n      if (cb.hits >= 2) {\\n        S.vitals = 30;\\n        S.flags.crash = 0;\\n        pushEv(S, ['revived', cb.textbook >= 2 ? 'textbook' : 'clean']);\\n      } else lose(S, 'code');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function maybeDie(S) {\\n    if (S.won || S.lost || S.codeBlue || S.dressing) return;\\n    if (S.clock <= 0) { lose(S, 'time'); return; }\\n    if (S.vitals <= 0) {\\n      if (S.diff === 'attending' || S.codeBlueUsed) { lose(S, 'vitals'); return; }\\n\",\"total_lines\":1762}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"72eaf681-59ef-4cb3-888c-10aacb810d31"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_175","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The trigEdge condition requires prevTrig to be less than or equal to zero.\n\nThe press-and-release logic works correctly. The trigger only activates for one frame at each peak, then stays off until the next peak arrives.\n\nA zero-clock loss without code blue is confirmed. A zero-vitals loss also occurs without code blue.\n\nRank lettering is being verified. An S rank with zero slips becomes S+. The B cap clamps S to B.\n\nStrain tests will cover spawning, stepping, and failure branches.\n\nLegato snap requires creating a legato-head note, gripping it, yanking fast, and confirming the snap.\n\nDa capo regrowth may be complex. I will check its failure behavior if time allows.\n\nA cantor forceRewind test will verify that worldT moves backward.\n\nFailure branches will be triggered directly in tests so they reach their ends.\n\nThe legato test plan is now concrete: spawn a legato-head note, step with a trigger edge, yank fast, and check for slips or snapped.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b970fb22-d5b6-49ba-b642-de25b0b3c9b3-72","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function stepDacapo|regrow|round === 2|kind === 'dacapo'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":894,"output_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":173824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"e253847c-267d-45d6-8e1f-724c54d9e456"}
