{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_189","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a solid picture. I need to write the remaining game files.\n\nI'm checking engine details for dialog choices, fonts, settings, tile maps, humanoids, splash screens, saves, input, menus, and drawing. I'm also designing a playthrough test to verify the startup flow.\n\nI'm designing the runtime state object to track the full playthrough. It will hold difficulty, chapter, saved patients, chart data, and live operation states. The test flow covers story skips, dialog choices, chart clicks, surgery, results, and the final credits.\n\nThe runtime state now includes menu, lobby, reel, and rankSave fields. The full scene list spans fifteen stages: title, menu, difficulty selection, case files, story, chart, operation, results, ward, credits, about, lobby, lab, and attract.\n\nDev mode will be a pause menu item rather than a separate scene. It sets a flag and hides the shell, so the operation can still draw its own dev panel. Tests need to verify the menu item exists and Dev.set and Dev.reset work. I'm adding `['Dev Mode', () => GAME.openDev()]` to the pause menu items.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-642610e8-fd5b-4e93-aa5b-3457bf0f1991-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","offset":3980,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-642610e8-fd5b-4e93-aa5b-3457bf0f1991-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"_hooks|hook\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-642610e8-fd5b