{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_268","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine includes built-in presets, including select.\n\nMenu audio warnings are fixed. shell.js will be written with sparse comments. The async hub connection will resolve before game.start.\n\nStandalone mode will show the title scene and probe phase solo or idle. The hub probe returns active status, scene name, host flag, player positions, and elapsed time. Without a session, connect is skipped and the title screen appears after 1200ms.\n\nThe shell will set the document title to the game name. The title scene draws safely in headless mode because draw is enabled and the backdrop uses standard rendering calls.\n\nInput bindings are being set up with Object.assign to preserve defaults while overriding specific keys. The menu action is not being lost in this process.\n\nWASD keys are removed from menu direction bindings. Only arrow keys and pad buttons will control the menu cursor, preventing held surgery keys from also triggering menu navigation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c9b1cc6b-a61e-4a39-9b18-ef69ce542ef0-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"STICK_CODES|PadAxisUp","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":729,"output_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":160512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"16c89b95-23db-46d9-aae2-19e25e157870"}
