{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_299","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default lastDevice is the keyboard, so the boot label for useTool maps to the keyboard key rather than R2.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b196c88-8665-4e26-a3f4-459b21207208-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","offset":1294,"limit":8}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2378,"output_tokens":414,"cache_read_input_tokens":107008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"e22b18fa-9d8f-438f-a1ce-b7c95547e2ba"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7b196c88-8665-4e26-a3f4-459b21207208-35","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1294→/* a standard gamepad's buttons by position (0 bottom, 1 right, 2 left, 3 top, 4-7 shoulders and triggers, 8 back, 9 start,\\n   10-11 stick clicks, 12-15 d-pad, 16 home), as each family prints them */\\nconst PAD_GLYPHS = {\\n  xbox: ['A', 'B', 'X', 'Y', 'LB', 'RB', 'LT', 'RT', 'View', 'Menu', 'LS', 'RS', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Guide'],\\n  playstation: ['✕', '○', '□', '△', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Create', 'Options', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'PS'],\\n  nintendo: ['B', 'A', 'Y', 'X', 'L', 'R', 'ZL', 'ZR', '−', '+', 'L stick', 'R stick', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home'],\\n1300→  generic: ['Bottom', 'Right', 'Left', 'Top', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Select', 'Start', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home']\\n};\",\"content_concise\":\"1294→/* a standard gamepad's buttons by position (0 bottom, 1 right, 2 left, 3 top, 4-7 shoulders and triggers, 8 back, 9 start,\\n   10-11 stick clicks, 12-15 d-pad, 16 home), as each family prints them */\\nconst PAD_GLYPHS = {\\n  xbox: ['A', 'B', 'X', 'Y', 'LB', 'RB', 'LT', 'RT', 'View', 'Menu', 'LS', 'RS', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Guide'],\\n  playstation: ['✕', '○', '□', '△', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Create', 'Options', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'PS'],\\n  nintendo: ['B', 'A', 'Y', 'X', 'L', 'R', 'ZL', 'ZR', '−', '+', 'L stick', 'R stick', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home'],\\n1300→  generic: ['Bottom', 'Right', 'Left', 'Top', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Select', 'Start', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home']\\n};\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js\",\"offset\":1294,\"limit\":8,\"raw_output\":\"/* a standard gamepad's buttons by position (0 bottom, 1 right, 2 left, 3 top, 4-7 shoulders and triggers, 8 back, 9 start,\\n   10-11 stick clicks, 12-15 d-pad, 16 home), as each family prints them */\\nconst PAD_GLYPHS = {\\n  xbox: ['A', 'B', 'X', 'Y', 'LB', 'RB', 'LT', 'RT', 'View', 'Menu', 'LS', 'RS', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Guide'],\\n  playstation: ['✕', '○', '□', '△', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Create', 'Options', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'PS'],\\n  nintendo: ['B', 'A', 'Y', 'X', 'L', 'R', 'ZL', 'ZR', '−', '+', 'L stick', 'R stick', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home'],\\n  generic: ['Bottom', 'Right', 'Left', 'Top', 'L1', 'R1', 'L2', 'R2', 'Select', 'Start', 'L3', 'R3', 'D-pad ↑', 'D-pad ↓', 'D-pad ←', 'D-pad →', 'Home']\\n};\\n\",\"total_lines\":14974}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"89a60b40-2f49-46ad-96ae-6ad1c503847f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_300","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Set the gamepad glyphs to Xbox. The right trigger is labeled RT.\n\nSwitched back to PlayStation glyphs. Will write the file and scan for banned words. Also fixing the syringe nearest-predicate so closed reeds are found.\n\nThe syringe fix special-cases reeds and voices in the nearest predicate to ignore window coverage. This lets closed reeds be found.\n\nPatching sim.js now so the first test run is green. Voice has the same reed issue. I'm also checking step ordering: clock is checked before vitals, and createRaw hold=true prevents phase advancement when only one object remains.\n\nConfirmed the time-out and vitals-loss test cases. The wheel test uses a 0.1-second stick input to switch the tool to scalpel, then triggers sonar with digit 8 within the 0.08-second threshold.\n\nThe wheel tool switches to scalpel within 100 ms. Sonar triggers immediately on the digit input. The cursor test starts at bx=20, by=120 with zero speed. No nearby objects exist so the assist magnet does not apply. Full stick input for one second exceeds the 300 ms threshold. Field width is 398 and fine distance is within 120.\n\nVale should be 15% faster than Sokolova. The distance ratio must stay between 1.10 and 1.20.\n\nEmpty objects are valid targets. The player is a cursor, not an object, so it cannot be targeted.\n\nCursor.update does not step the simulation. The blank action sets the active doctor from the doctor option, but the gift defaults to 'breath' rather than using the create() doctor mapping.\n\nThe Vale doctor test will use doctor: 'vale' so activeDoc becomes vale and speed receives the 1.15 bonus. Sokolova's assist bonus only affects the magnet, not top speed. I'll explicitly pass CFG.cloneTune(CFG.TUNING) to prevent a dirty TUNE from interfering with cursor tests.\n\nBot playthroughs will be deterministically hashed across two runs with identical seeds. Art.force will be tested with both enabled and disabled. The 11-case bot test is the priority. A short shell playthrough will be included in --fast. A grep for Math.random in source files will enforce the no-random rule.\n\nThe banned-word scan will use exact case-sensitive matches for TODO, FIXME, placeholder, and stub. It will skip bundle checks in --fast if the HTML output is missing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8c93197-e52a-415a-a912-685d59715543-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__hubCheck|players|scenario|auto","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/hub/harness.html","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8c93197-e52a-415a-a912-685d59715543-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/hub/README.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":859,"output_tokens":1736,"cache_read_input_tokens":109312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"6f3787ea-6882-4ad7-8769-1fa75611c00f"}
