{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_314","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Phase 1 is Tremolo. Vitals are at zero.\n\nThe bot is dying on Tremolo. The recent syringe change likely caused this: it now injects when the window is closed, which lacerates reeds and kills vitals. Previously, canTouch was false during a closed window, so the bot would IV or wait instead.\n\nReleasing near a closed reed now lacerates and slips. The bot may be spamming these hits. Previously the same release was an IV with no target, which healed.\n\nThe bot must wait for the window before releasing. Reverting the syringe change would break the intended laceration behavior.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c04c8b94-6b17-4bbe-b45e-02a4fbf8098f-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js","offset":80,"limit":170}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4624,"output_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":146688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"3da197b3-a536-4bf7-a93e-b588ff659b31"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c04c8b94-6b17-4bbe-b45e-02a4fbf8098f-57","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"80→    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\\n90→  }\\n  function polyLen(pts) {\\n    let n = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\\n    return n || 1;\\n  }\\n  function shock(S, p) {\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\\n100→    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\\n  }\\n  function dressing(S, p) {\\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\\n  }\\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\\n110→    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\\n\\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\\n\\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\\n    }\\n120→\\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\\n      if (!o.window) {\\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\\n      }\\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\\n130→      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\\n140→      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\\n150→      }\\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n160→    }\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\\n      const g = o.guide;\\n      const start = g[0];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\\n170→        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\\n      }\\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n180→        const on = near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { why: 'screw' });\\n      }\\n      m.ang += 0.55;\\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n190→        const on = near(o.x, o.y, 2.5);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { fine, why: 'grip' });\\n      }\\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\\n      /* Stay on the trigger until the sim calls it free. Releasing at depth-epsilon drops a deep pull. */\\n      if (!o.free) {\\n        const n = Math.min((o.depth || 16) + 1.5, along + limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\\n200→      }\\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\\n      }\\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\\n    }\\n210→    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\\n    const m = mem(S);\\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\\n    if (m.consultCd > 0) m.consultCd -= dt;\\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\\n220→    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\\n\\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\\n230→    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (!gift && !S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds' && (S.slips || 0) > (m.seenSlips || 0)) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 1.2; m.seenSlips = S.slips;\\n    }\\n    const wantDoc = S.flags.needLook ? 'sokolova' : (S.flags.needBreath ? 'vale' : null);\\n    if (S.consult && wantDoc && S.activeDoc !== wantDoc && (m.consultCd || 0) <= 0) {\\n240→      consult = true; m.consultCd = 0.45;\\n    }\\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\\n\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const needIv = S.flags.needIv && (S.flags.iv || 0) < S.flags.needIv;\\n    const blocking = S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'));\",\"content_concise\":\"80→    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\\n90→  }\\n  function polyLen(pts) {\\n    let n = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\\n    return n || 1;\\n  }\\n  function shock(S, p) {\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\\n100→    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\\n  }\\n  function dressing(S, p) {\\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\\n  }\\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\\n110→    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\\n\\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\\n\\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\\n    }\\n120→\\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\\n      if (!o.window) {\\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\\n      }\\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\\n130→      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\\n140→      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\\n150→      }\\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n160→    }\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\\n      const g = o.guide;\\n      const start = g[0];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\\n170→        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\\n      }\\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n180→        const on = near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { why: 'screw' });\\n      }\\n      m.ang += 0.55;\\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n190→        const on = near(o.x, o.y, 2.5);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { fine, why: 'grip' });\\n      }\\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\\n      /* Stay on the trigger until the sim calls it free. Releasing at depth-epsilon drops a deep pull. */\\n      if (!o.free) {\\n        const n = Math.min((o.depth || 16) + 1.5, along + limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\\n200→      }\\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\\n      }\\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\\n    }\\n210→    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\\n    const m = mem(S);\\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\\n    if (m.consultCd > 0) m.consultCd -= dt;\\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\\n220→    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\\n\\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\\n230→    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (!gift && !S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds' && (S.slips || 0) > (m.seenSlips || 0)) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 1.2; m.seenSlips = S.slips;\\n    }\\n    const wantDoc = S.flags.needLook ? 'sokolova' : (S.flags.needBreath ? 'vale' : null);\\n    if (S.consult && wantDoc && S.activeDoc !== wantDoc && (m.consultCd || 0) <= 0) {\\n240→      consult = true; m.consultCd = 0.45;\\n    }\\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\\n\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const needIv = S.flags.needIv && (S.flags.iv || 0) < S.flags.needIv;\\n    const blocking = S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'));\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js\",\"offset\":80,\"limit\":170,\"raw_output\":\"    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [pts[i - 1][0] + (pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0]) * u, pts[i - 1][1] + (pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return pts[pts.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n  function polyLen(pts) {\\n    let n = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < pts.length; i++) n += hyp(pts[i][0] - pts[i - 1][0], pts[i][1] - pts[i - 1][1]);\\n    return n || 1;\\n  }\\n  function shock(S, p) {\\n    const peaks = [0.9, 1.8, 2.7, 3.6];\\n    const cb = S.codeBlue;\\n    const peak = peaks[cb.next] == null ? 99 : peaks[cb.next];\\n    const on = Math.abs(cb.t - peak) <= 0.045;\\n    return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, on, { why: 'shock' });\\n  }\\n  function dressing(S, p) {\\n    const u = S.dressing.t % 1.2;\\n    return go('suture', p.bx, p.by, u < 0.045, { why: 'stamp' });\\n  }\\n  function act(S, p, o, dt, m) {\\n    const tool = toolFor(o);\\n    const fine = !!(S.strain && S.strain.jitter) || (o.tension && o.tension < 80) || tool === 'suture' || tool === 'scalpel';\\n    const near = (x, y, r) => hyp(p.bx - x, p.by - y) <= r;\\n\\n    if (tool === 'sonar') return go('sonar', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'sonar' });\\n    if (tool === 'suction') return go('suction', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'suction' });\\n\\n    if (tool === 'salve') {\\n      const cell = (o.cells || []).find(c => !c[2]);\\n      const x = cell ? cell[0] : o.x, y = cell ? cell[1] : o.y;\\n      return go('salve', x, y, 1, { why: 'salve' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe' && (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice')) {\\n      const beat = (S.strain && S.strain.beat) || 0;\\n      const side = [o.x + 22, o.y + 6];\\n      if (!o.window) {\\n        if (p.fill >= 0.97) return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'dump' });\\n        const charging = p.cool <= 0 && p.fill < 0.94 && beat >= 0.12 && beat < 0.68;\\n        return go('syringe', side[0], side[1], charging || (p.fill > 0.05 && p.fill < 0.94), { fine: true, why: 'prime' });\\n      }\\n      if (p.fill < 0.9) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine: true, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine: true, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'syringe') {\\n      if (!near(o.x, o.y, 3)) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, p.fill > 0.2 && p.fill < 0.96 ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'aimdose' });\\n      if (p.fill < 0.93 && p.cool <= 0) return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 1, { fine, why: 'fill' });\\n      return go('syringe', o.x, o.y, 0, { fine, why: 'dose' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'cautery') {\\n      if (p.lock > 0 || p.heat > 0.78) return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 0, { why: 'cool' });\\n      return go('cautery', o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'burn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'suture') {\\n      const pair = o.pairs[o.stitch || 0];\\n      if (!pair) return idle(p, { why: 'nopair' });\\n      const a = pair[0], b = pair[1];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.stroke.id === o.id)) {\\n        return go('suture', a[0], a[1], near(a[0], a[1], 2), { fine: true, why: 'needle' });\\n      }\\n      if (near(b[0], b[1], 1.2)) return go('suture', b[0], b[1], 0, { fine: true, why: 'pop' });\\n      const dx = b[0] - p.bx, dy = b[1] - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      const step = Math.min(d, 90 * dt);\\n      return go('suture', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'cross' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && (o.slash || o.type === 'nest' || (o.type === 'lobe' && o.mode === 'scalpel')) && !o.guide) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.type === 'lobe' && o.slash && !o.cut) {\\n      if (!near(o.x - 8, o.y, 2)) return go('scalpel', o.x - 8, o.y, 0, { why: 'windup' });\\n      return go('scalpel', o.x + 8, o.y, 1, { why: 'slash' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'scalpel' && o.guide) {\\n      const g = o.guide;\\n      const start = g[0];\\n      if (!(p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'scalpel' && p.stroke.id === o.id) || p.stroke.paused) {\\n        return go('scalpel', start[0], start[1], near(start[0], start[1], 2) ? 1 : 0, { fine, why: 'start' });\\n      }\\n      if (o.beatLock && S.flags.onBeat) return go('scalpel', p.bx, p.by, 1, { fine: true, why: 'waitbeat' });\\n      const far = p.stroke.far || 0;\\n      const pt = pointAlong(g, Math.min(polyLen(g), far + 160 * dt + 0.8));\\n      return go('scalpel', pt[0], pt[1], 1, { fine, why: 'trace' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (o.type === 'screw') {\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n        const on = near(o.x + 12, o.y, 3);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x + 12, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { why: 'screw' });\\n      }\\n      m.ang += 0.55;\\n      return go('forceps', o.x + Math.cos(m.ang) * 12, o.y + Math.sin(m.ang) * 12, 1, { why: 'turn' });\\n    }\\n\\n    if (tool === 'forceps') {\\n      if (p.held && p.held !== o.id) return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'drop' });\\n      if (p.held !== o.id) {\\n        const on = near(o.x, o.y, 2.5);\\n        return go('forceps', o.x, o.y, on && p.prevTrig <= 0.3, { fine, why: 'grip' });\\n      }\\n      const limit = Math.min(78, (o.tension || 120) * 0.6);\\n      const ox = o.origin[0], oy = o.origin[1];\\n      const along = (p.bx - ox) * o.axis[0] + (p.by - oy) * o.axis[1];\\n      /* Stay on the trigger until the sim calls it free. Releasing at depth-epsilon drops a deep pull. */\\n      if (!o.free) {\\n        const n = Math.min((o.depth || 16) + 1.5, along + limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', ox + o.axis[0] * n, oy + o.axis[1] * n, 1, { fine: limit < 70, why: 'pull' });\\n      }\\n      const tx = ox + o.axis[0] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const ty = oy + o.axis[1] * (Math.max(o.depth, 0) + 30);\\n      const dx = tx - p.bx, dy = ty - p.by, d = hyp(dx, dy) || 1;\\n      if (hyp(p.bx - ox, p.by - oy) < 26) {\\n        const step = Math.min(d, limit * dt);\\n        return go('forceps', p.bx + dx / d * step, p.by + dy / d * step, 1, { fine: true, why: 'carry' });\\n      }\\n      return go('forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { why: 'dish' });\\n    }\\n    return go(tool, o.x, o.y, 1, { why: 'generic' });\\n  }\\n\\n  function device(S, i, dt) {\\n    const p = S.players[i] || S.players[0];\\n    const m = mem(S);\\n    if (m.giftCd > 0) m.giftCd -= dt;\\n    if (m.consultCd > 0) m.consultCd -= dt;\\n    if (!p || p.gone) return idle(S.players[0] || { bx: 213, by: 150, tool: 'forceps' });\\n    if (S.won || S.lost) return idle(p);\\n    if (S.codeBlue) return shock(S, p);\\n    if (S.dressing) return dressing(S, p);\\n\\n    const n = S.players.filter(q => !q.gone).length;\\n    if (n > 1 && i === 0 && S.objects.some(o => o.needsWindow && !o.done && o.alive)) {\\n      const h = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'retractor' && !o.done);\\n      if (h) return go('forceps', h.x, h.y, 1, { why: 'hold' });\\n    }\\n\\n    let gift = false, consult = false;\\n    const breathOk = S.gift === 'breath' || S.activeDoc === 'vale' || (S.gift === 'both' && S.activeDoc !== 'sokolova');\\n    const lookOk = S.gift === 'look' || S.activeDoc === 'sokolova' || S.gift === 'both';\\n    if (!S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 35 && breathOk && (S.flags.needBreath || (S.strain && S.strain.jitter && S.strain.kind === 'tremolo'))) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (!gift && !S.breath && m.giftCd <= 0 && S.steady >= 45 && lookOk && S.flags.needLook && S.mode !== 'rounds' && (S.slips || 0) > (m.seenSlips || 0)) {\\n      gift = true; m.giftCd = 1.2; m.seenSlips = S.slips;\\n    }\\n    const wantDoc = S.flags.needLook ? 'sokolova' : (S.flags.needBreath ? 'vale' : null);\\n    if (S.consult && wantDoc && S.activeDoc !== wantDoc && (m.consultCd || 0) <= 0) {\\n      consult = true; m.consultCd = 0.45;\\n    }\\n    if (gift || consult) return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, { gift, consult, why: 'gift' });\\n\\n    if (S.device && !S.device.shown && S.objects.some(o => o.needsBoard && !o.done)) {\\n      return go('sonar', S.device.x || 213, S.device.y || 100, 1, { why: 'board' });\\n    }\\n\\n    const needIv = S.flags.needIv && (S.flags.iv || 0) < S.flags.needIv;\\n    const blocking = S.objects.some(o => !o.done && (o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'arteryTear'));\\n\",\"total_lines\":288}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"8d79da04-5a10-4769-8085-7e67b5f2ed85"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_315","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot dumps the syringe at side [o.\n\nThe dump position is safe from the reed. c6's failure likely stems from something other than the syringe change. I will inspect stepTremolo to find what broke.\n\nThe syringe dump is confirmed safe from the reed. The bot releases at a 22-unit distance, so pathing through the reed is not the issue. The zero vitals on phase 1 may stem from Tremolo's damage sources: reeds, jitter, and mass. The bot might be burning healthy tissue or draining strain too quickly.\n\nTUNE mutation is unlikely. The grades tests use explicit clones, and shell boot only changes volumes. TUNE should still hold defaults. I will reproduce c6 alone to isolate the cause.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e7da3b8-5154-4d33-8af4-7e045acdee45-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":920,"limit":110}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e7da3b8-5154-4d33-8af4-7e045acdee45-59","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js","offset":1,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3950,"output_tokens":1363,"cache_read_input_tokens":151296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"c75dd118-0ce0-4a12-8d67-11e1193a6cb6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8e7da3b8-5154-4d33-8af4-7e045acdee45-58","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"920→          tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.15, hidden: false,\\n          holdZone: w.hold || null, barbs: w.barbAt || 0,\\n        });\\n        w.head = head.id;\\n      }\\n      const head = w.head ? objById(S, w.head) : null;\\n      if (head && head.snapped && !w.snapped) {\\n        w.snapped = true; st.snapped = true;\\n        /* regrow a head further along and flee */\\n        head.done = true; head.alive = false;\\n930→        w.surfaced = false; w.out = false; w.head = 0;\\n        w.along = Math.min(w.pathLen - 4, w.along + 30);\\n        w.slurs.push({ i: 90 + w.slurs.length, x: w.x + 16, y: w.y, opened: false, done: false });\\n        pushEv(S, ['regrow', w.id]);\\n      }\\n      if (head && head.done && !w.out) {\\n        w.pulled = (w.pulled || 0) + 1;\\n        /* barb every 4th segment: if not clamped, snapping already handled via tension */\\n        if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0 && !head.clamped && !w.barbCleared) {\\n          /* require a clamp before the next length counts — head.done means the whole pull finished.\\n940→             Barbs are separate cautery objects spawned at the hold. */\\n        }\\n        w.segments -= 4;\\n        if (w.segments <= w.half && !w.split && st.worms.length < 3) {\\n          w.split = true; w.half = -1;\\n          st.worms.push(makeWorm(S, w.x + 20, w.y + 14, Math.max(4, w.segments >> 1), w.id + 1));\\n          pushEv(S, ['split', w.id]);\\n        }\\n        if (w.segments <= 0) { w.done = true; w.out = true; }\\n        else {\\n950→          /* next length */\\n          w.out = false; w.surfaced = true;\\n          const h2 = addObj(S, {\\n            type: 'shard', x: w.x, y: w.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 14, order: 2,\\n            tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.1,\\n            holdZone: w.barbAt && (w.pulled % 4 === 0) ? [w.x + 30, w.y, 16] : null,\\n          });\\n          w.head = h2.id;\\n          if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0) {\\n            addObj(S, { type: 'barb', x: w.x + 30, y: w.y, need: 0.35, order: 3, tag: 'barb-' + w.id, drain: 0 });\\n960→          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.worms.every(w => w.done)) st.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function makeWorm(S, x, y, segments, id) {\\n    const path = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) path.push([x + i * 14, y + Math.sin(i) * 8]);\\n970→    let pathLen = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) pathLen += hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]);\\n    const slurs = [0.25, 0.5, 0.75].map((u, i) => {\\n      const p = pointAlong(path, pathLen * u);\\n      return { i, x: p[0], y: p[1], opened: false, done: false };\\n    });\\n    return { id, x, y, path, pathLen, along: 0, segments, half: segments / 2, slurs, surfaced: false, done: false, t: 0, split: false, pulled: 0, barbAt: 4, marked: false, axis: [1, 0] };\\n  }\\n  function pointAlong(path, dist) {\\n    let left = dist;\\n980→    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [path[i - 1][0] + (path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0]) * u, path[i - 1][1] + (path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return path[path.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n990→\\n  function stepTremolo(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    st.beat = (st.t % 1);\\n    const peak = st.beat > 0.7;\\n    st.flare = peak;\\n    S.flags.onBeat = st.beat > 0.45 && st.beat < 0.7 ? false : st.beat < 0.15;\\n    /* vitals shake and drain */\\n    if (!S.breath) S.vitals -= 0.6 * st.amp * dt * tune.strains.damage;\\n    for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && o.tag === 'reed') o.window = !!st.flare;\\n1000→    const reeds = S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && reeds.length === 0) { st.stage = 2; st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2); }\\n    if (st.amp <= 0.2 && st.stage === 1) st.stage = 2;\\n    if (st.stage === 2) {\\n      st.wake -= dt;\\n      if (st.wake <= 0) {\\n        st.wake = 6;\\n        /* a reed returns */\\n        if (S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length < 2) {\\n          addObj(S, { type: 'reed', x: st.x - 20 + rnd(S) * 40, y: st.y - 10, order: 1, tag: 'reed', drain: 0, window: false });\\n1010→        }\\n      }\\n      const mass = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'tremass');\\n      if (mass && mass.done && st.stage === 2) {\\n        st.stage = 3;\\n        addObj(S, { type: 'shard', x: st.x, y: st.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 40, order: 4, tag: 'tremolo-pull', tension: 90, drain: 0.2 });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.stage === 3) {\\n      const pull = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'tremolo-pull');\\n1020→      if (pull && pull.done) {\\n        st.done = true;\\n        for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && !o.done) { o.done = true; o.alive = false; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* amp falls when a reed is dosed */\\n    const deadReeds = st.reed0 - S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length;\\n    st.amp = clamp(1 - deadReeds * 0.2, 0.15, 1);\\n    if (st.stage >= 2) st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2);\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"920→          tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.15, hidden: false,\\n          holdZone: w.hold || null, barbs: w.barbAt || 0,\\n        });\\n        w.head = head.id;\\n      }\\n      const head = w.head ? objById(S, w.head) : null;\\n      if (head && head.snapped && !w.snapped) {\\n        w.snapped = true; st.snapped = true;\\n        /* regrow a head further along and flee */\\n        head.done = true; head.alive = false;\\n930→        w.surfaced = false; w.out = false; w.head = 0;\\n        w.along = Math.min(w.pathLen - 4, w.along + 30);\\n        w.slurs.push({ i: 90 + w.slurs.length, x: w.x + 16, y: w.y, opened: false, done: false });\\n        pushEv(S, ['regrow', w.id]);\\n      }\\n      if (head && head.done && !w.out) {\\n        w.pulled = (w.pulled || 0) + 1;\\n        /* barb every 4th segment: if not clamped, snapping already handled via tension */\\n        if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0 && !head.clamped && !w.barbCleared) {\\n          /* require a clamp before the next length counts — head.done means the whole pull finished.\\n940→             Barbs are separate cautery objects spawned at the hold. */\\n        }\\n        w.segments -= 4;\\n        if (w.segments <= w.half && !w.split && st.worms.length < 3) {\\n          w.split = true; w.half = -1;\\n          st.worms.push(makeWorm(S, w.x + 20, w.y + 14, Math.max(4, w.segments >> 1), w.id + 1));\\n          pushEv(S, ['split', w.id]);\\n        }\\n        if (w.segments <= 0) { w.done = true; w.out = true; }\\n        else {\\n950→          /* next length */\\n          w.out = false; w.surfaced = true;\\n          const h2 = addObj(S, {\\n            type: 'shard', x: w.x, y: w.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 14, order: 2,\\n            tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.1,\\n            holdZone: w.barbAt && (w.pulled % 4 === 0) ? [w.x + 30, w.y, 16] : null,\\n          });\\n          w.head = h2.id;\\n          if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0) {\\n            addObj(S, { type: 'barb', x: w.x + 30, y: w.y, need: 0.35, order: 3, tag: 'barb-' + w.id, drain: 0 });\\n960→          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.worms.every(w => w.done)) st.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function makeWorm(S, x, y, segments, id) {\\n    const path = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) path.push([x + i * 14, y + Math.sin(i) * 8]);\\n970→    let pathLen = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) pathLen += hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]);\\n    const slurs = [0.25, 0.5, 0.75].map((u, i) => {\\n      const p = pointAlong(path, pathLen * u);\\n      return { i, x: p[0], y: p[1], opened: false, done: false };\\n    });\\n    return { id, x, y, path, pathLen, along: 0, segments, half: segments / 2, slurs, surfaced: false, done: false, t: 0, split: false, pulled: 0, barbAt: 4, marked: false, axis: [1, 0] };\\n  }\\n  function pointAlong(path, dist) {\\n    let left = dist;\\n980→    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [path[i - 1][0] + (path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0]) * u, path[i - 1][1] + (path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return path[path.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n990→\\n  function stepTremolo(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    st.beat = (st.t % 1);\\n    const peak = st.beat > 0.7;\\n    st.flare = peak;\\n    S.flags.onBeat = st.beat > 0.45 && st.beat < 0.7 ? false : st.beat < 0.15;\\n    /* vitals shake and drain */\\n    if (!S.breath) S.vitals -= 0.6 * st.amp * dt * tune.strains.damage;\\n    for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && o.tag === 'reed') o.window = !!st.flare;\\n1000→    const reeds = S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && reeds.length === 0) { st.stage = 2; st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2); }\\n    if (st.amp <= 0.2 && st.stage === 1) st.stage = 2;\\n    if (st.stage === 2) {\\n      st.wake -= dt;\\n      if (st.wake <= 0) {\\n        st.wake = 6;\\n        /* a reed returns */\\n        if (S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length < 2) {\\n          addObj(S, { type: 'reed', x: st.x - 20 + rnd(S) * 40, y: st.y - 10, order: 1, tag: 'reed', drain: 0, window: false });\\n1010→        }\\n      }\\n      const mass = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'tremass');\\n      if (mass && mass.done && st.stage === 2) {\\n        st.stage = 3;\\n        addObj(S, { type: 'shard', x: st.x, y: st.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 40, order: 4, tag: 'tremolo-pull', tension: 90, drain: 0.2 });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.stage === 3) {\\n      const pull = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'tremolo-pull');\\n1020→      if (pull && pull.done) {\\n        st.done = true;\\n        for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && !o.done) { o.done = true; o.alive = false; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* amp falls when a reed is dosed */\\n    const deadReeds = st.reed0 - S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length;\\n    st.amp = clamp(1 - deadReeds * 0.2, 0.15, 1);\\n    if (st.stage >= 2) st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2);\\n  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js\",\"offset\":920,\"limit\":110,\"raw_output\":\"          tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.15, hidden: false,\\n          holdZone: w.hold || null, barbs: w.barbAt || 0,\\n        });\\n        w.head = head.id;\\n      }\\n      const head = w.head ? objById(S, w.head) : null;\\n      if (head && head.snapped && !w.snapped) {\\n        w.snapped = true; st.snapped = true;\\n        /* regrow a head further along and flee */\\n        head.done = true; head.alive = false;\\n        w.surfaced = false; w.out = false; w.head = 0;\\n        w.along = Math.min(w.pathLen - 4, w.along + 30);\\n        w.slurs.push({ i: 90 + w.slurs.length, x: w.x + 16, y: w.y, opened: false, done: false });\\n        pushEv(S, ['regrow', w.id]);\\n      }\\n      if (head && head.done && !w.out) {\\n        w.pulled = (w.pulled || 0) + 1;\\n        /* barb every 4th segment: if not clamped, snapping already handled via tension */\\n        if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0 && !head.clamped && !w.barbCleared) {\\n          /* require a clamp before the next length counts — head.done means the whole pull finished.\\n             Barbs are separate cautery objects spawned at the hold. */\\n        }\\n        w.segments -= 4;\\n        if (w.segments <= w.half && !w.split && st.worms.length < 3) {\\n          w.split = true; w.half = -1;\\n          st.worms.push(makeWorm(S, w.x + 20, w.y + 14, Math.max(4, w.segments >> 1), w.id + 1));\\n          pushEv(S, ['split', w.id]);\\n        }\\n        if (w.segments <= 0) { w.done = true; w.out = true; }\\n        else {\\n          /* next length */\\n          w.out = false; w.surfaced = true;\\n          const h2 = addObj(S, {\\n            type: 'shard', x: w.x, y: w.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 14, order: 2,\\n            tag: 'legato-head', worm: w.id, tension: 70, drain: 0.1,\\n            holdZone: w.barbAt && (w.pulled % 4 === 0) ? [w.x + 30, w.y, 16] : null,\\n          });\\n          w.head = h2.id;\\n          if (w.barbAt && w.pulled % 4 === 0) {\\n            addObj(S, { type: 'barb', x: w.x + 30, y: w.y, need: 0.35, order: 3, tag: 'barb-' + w.id, drain: 0 });\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.worms.every(w => w.done)) st.done = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function makeWorm(S, x, y, segments, id) {\\n    const path = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) path.push([x + i * 14, y + Math.sin(i) * 8]);\\n    let pathLen = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) pathLen += hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]);\\n    const slurs = [0.25, 0.5, 0.75].map((u, i) => {\\n      const p = pointAlong(path, pathLen * u);\\n      return { i, x: p[0], y: p[1], opened: false, done: false };\\n    });\\n    return { id, x, y, path, pathLen, along: 0, segments, half: segments / 2, slurs, surfaced: false, done: false, t: 0, split: false, pulled: 0, barbAt: 4, marked: false, axis: [1, 0] };\\n  }\\n  function pointAlong(path, dist) {\\n    let left = dist;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < path.length; i++) {\\n      const L = hypot(path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0], path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) || 1;\\n      if (left <= L) {\\n        const u = left / L;\\n        return [path[i - 1][0] + (path[i][0] - path[i - 1][0]) * u, path[i - 1][1] + (path[i][1] - path[i - 1][1]) * u];\\n      }\\n      left -= L;\\n    }\\n    return path[path.length - 1].slice();\\n  }\\n\\n  function stepTremolo(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    st.beat = (st.t % 1);\\n    const peak = st.beat > 0.7;\\n    st.flare = peak;\\n    S.flags.onBeat = st.beat > 0.45 && st.beat < 0.7 ? false : st.beat < 0.15;\\n    /* vitals shake and drain */\\n    if (!S.breath) S.vitals -= 0.6 * st.amp * dt * tune.strains.damage;\\n    for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && o.tag === 'reed') o.window = !!st.flare;\\n    const reeds = S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && reeds.length === 0) { st.stage = 2; st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2); }\\n    if (st.amp <= 0.2 && st.stage === 1) st.stage = 2;\\n    if (st.stage === 2) {\\n      st.wake -= dt;\\n      if (st.wake <= 0) {\\n        st.wake = 6;\\n        /* a reed returns */\\n        if (S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length < 2) {\\n          addObj(S, { type: 'reed', x: st.x - 20 + rnd(S) * 40, y: st.y - 10, order: 1, tag: 'reed', drain: 0, window: false });\\n        }\\n      }\\n      const mass = S.objects.find(o => o.type === 'tremass');\\n      if (mass && mass.done && st.stage === 2) {\\n        st.stage = 3;\\n        addObj(S, { type: 'shard', x: st.x, y: st.y, axis: [1, 0], depth: 40, order: 4, tag: 'tremolo-pull', tension: 90, drain: 0.2 });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (st.stage === 3) {\\n      const pull = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'tremolo-pull');\\n      if (pull && pull.done) {\\n        st.done = true;\\n        for (const o of S.objects) if (o.type === 'reed' && !o.done) { o.done = true; o.alive = false; }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    /* amp falls when a reed is dosed */\\n    const deadReeds = st.reed0 - S.objects.filter(o => o.type === 'reed' && !o.done).length;\\n    st.amp = clamp(1 - deadReeds * 0.2, 0.15, 1);\\n    if (st.stage >= 2) st.amp = Math.min(st.amp, 0.2);\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":1767}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8e7da3b8-5154-4d33-8af4-7e045acdee45-59","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/* Perfect resident. Reads the live operation and aims the way a mouse would.\\n   The same function drives tests, attract mode, and couch colleagues. */\\n(() => {\\n  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\\n  const GAME = (G.GAME ||= {});\\n  const DIGIT = { forceps: 1, scalpel: 2, suture: 3, salve: 4, syringe: 5, cautery: 6, suction: 7, sonar: 8 };\\n  const mems = new WeakMap();\\n\\n  function hyp(x, y) { return Math.hypot(x, y); }\\n10→  function mem(S) {\\n    let m = mems.get(S);\\n    if (!m) {\\n      m = { ang: 0, skip: 0, giftCd: 0, saw: 0, stuck: 0, gid: 0, prog: -1 };\\n      mems.set(S, m);\\n    }\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  function go(tool, x, y, trig, extra) {\\n    extra = extra || {};\\n20→    return {\\n      digit: DIGIT[tool] || 1, mouse: [x, y], trig: trig ? 1 : 0,\\n      fine: !!extra.fine, gift: !!extra.gift, consult: !!extra.consult, cancel: false,\\n      aim: [0, 0], move: [0, 0], why: extra.why || tool,\\n    };\\n  }\\n  function idle(p, extra) {\\n    return go(p.tool || 'forceps', p.bx, p.by, 0, extra);\\n  }\\n  function ignored(o) {\\n30→    if (!o || o.done || !o.alive || o.optional) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold' || o.type === 'retractor') return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'bead' && o.tag !== 'dacapo-bead') return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n  function toolFor(o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return 'sonar';\\n    if (o.type === 'pool') return 'suction';\\n    if (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite') return 'salve';\\n    if (o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'arteryTear') return 'suture';\\n40→    if (o.type === 'clot') return o.dosed ? 'forceps' : 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return 'syringe';\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe') return o.mode === 'scalpel' ? 'scalpel' : o.mode || 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'nest') return o.cut ? 'forceps' : 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb') return 'cautery';\\n    if (o.type === 'slur' || o.type === 'tendril' || o.type === 'spiral' || o.type === 'wire' || o.type === 'repeat' || o.type === 'cut') return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.guide && !o.cut) return 'scalpel';\\n    if (o.pairs) return 'suture';\\n    if (o.cells && (o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'patch' || o.type === 'bite' || o.mode === 'salve')) return 'salve';\\n    return 'forceps';\\n50→  }\\n  function usable(S, o) {\\n    if (o.hidden && !o.marked) return true;\\n    if (o.type === 'lobe' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'eye' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'repeat' && !o.open) return false;\\n    if (o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice') return true;\\n    if (o.needsWindow && S.windowOpen <= 0) return false;\\n    if (o.needsBoard && S.device && !S.device.shown) return false;\\n    return true;\\n60→  }\\n  function goals(S) {\\n    const list = [];\\n    const seen = new Set();\\n    const push = o => { if (o && !seen.has(o.id) && !ignored(o)) { seen.add(o.id); list.push(o); } };\\n    const sign = S.objects.find(o => o.tag === 'repeat' && o.open && !o.done);\\n    if (sign) push(sign);\\n    for (const o of S.objects) {\\n      if (ignored(o)) continue;\\n      if (S.device && S.device.order && o.type === 'wire' && o.tag !== S.device.order[S.device.next || 0]) continue;\\n70→      if (o.under) {\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/* Perfect resident. Reads the live op