,108,32,105,116,39,115,32,103,111,111,100,59,32,101,118,101,114,121,116,104,105,110,103,32,114,101,115,116,115,32,111,110,32,105,116,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":20,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"| One hand picks a tool from an 8-way stick wheel, the other aims it | Left stick wheel, right stick or mouse cursor | Pointer precision is hard to carry to a pad | Cursor assist, guide-following, fine mode (5.3) |\"},{\"line_number\":127,\"content\":\"16. **Mouse bindings.** `WheelUp`, `WheelDown`, `Mouse1` (middle) and `Mouse2` (right) work as action codes. A scene with `camera: { zoom: false, wheel: false }` leaves the wheel to the game.\"},{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"### 5.4 The tool wheel\"},{\"line_number\":218,\"content\":\"- **Pad:** push the left stick past .6. The sector stable for 80 ms is picked. The ring shows around the cursor while the stick is out and .3 s after, with a clack, Quill's slap in the palm, and his gibberish bark of the tool's name. L1 and R1 step through the wheel too.\"},{\"line_number\":221,\"content\":\"- A swap takes .12 s. Time does not stop for the wheel.\"},{\"line_number\":326,\"content\":\"| Step tool | L1, R1 | Q, E, or the wheel |\"},{\"line_number\":338,\"content\":\"Settings adds **Swap sticks** for left-handers (cursor and wheel trade sticks).\"},{\"line_number\":344,\"content\":\"  toolPrev: ['Pad4', 'KeyQ', 'WheelUp'], toolNext: ['Pad5', 'KeyE', 'WheelDown'], wheelHold: ['Mouse2'],\"},{\"line_number\":351,\"content\":\"Read the two sticks from `input.padAim` and `input.padMove`, the trigger from `input.value('useTool')`. Name the actions and hide `tool1` to `tool8` from rebinding through `menu.controls`. Give the scene `camera: { zoom: false, wheel: false }`, because the wheel is the game's.\"},{\"line_number\":440,\"content\":\"**Case 1, Glasshouse** (Dr. Vale, forearm; clock 180, vitals 80, drain .1). *New: cursor, wheel, trigger, four tools, grades.* Tutorial freezes on.\"},{\"line_number\":596,\"content\":\"- *Case 11.* Across the city, every Anodyne patient begins to fail at once. Hale carries his daughter into St. Raz's himself, his voice finally breaking: \\\"I only wanted her not to hurt.\\\" Everyone is there: the Chief in a wheelchair in the gallery, Percy on the monitors, Odalys at the film, Quill passing instruments. The last operation.\"},{\"line_number\":618,\"content\":\"One case for 1 to 4 surgeons on one patient, each with their own cursor, wheel and glove color. The host runs the world. Team result, individual standings. About 4 minutes. It plays **the same on one couch and over the Hub.**\"},{\"line_number\":637,\"content\":\"The `lobby` scene: four seats. Player 1 is already in. `game.allowJoin({ max: 4, onJoin })` lets a second pad join with Start or the keyboard's right half with 2. **Add AI colleague** fills a seat with a bot, so a solo player can see co-op and the attract mode can show it. The mouse belongs to player 1. One shared screen, no split. Each player's wheel appears around their own cursor.\"},{\"line_number\":674,\"content\":\"**A looping 2.5 minute reel, AI-played with cheats allowed** (locked vitals, instant wheel, perfect aim), showing as much as possible:\"},{\"line_number\":676,\"content\":\"2. Case 1 for 15 s: wheel flicks, Forceps, Suture.\"},{\"line_number\":914,\"content\":\"src/ui/     hud.js wheel.js results.js menus.js casefiles.js about.js dev.js attract.js card.js\"},{\"line_number\":970,\"content\":\"    controls: { useTool: 'Use tool', fine: 'Steady hand', gift: 'The Steady', consult: 'Consult', toolPrev: 'Previous tool', toolNext: 'Next tool', wheelHold: 'Tool wheel', tool1: false, tool2: false, tool3: false, tool4: false, tool5: false, tool6: false, tool7: false, tool8: false },\"},{\"line_number\":1006,\"content\":\"- Pad with the Appendix E stub: `R2` and `△` prompts, stick cursor, wheel, trigger; keyboard and mouse switch the prompts.\"},{\"line_number\":1013,\"content\":\"**Screenshots, for what scripts can't judge:** each site, each stage, the portraits, one frame of each strain, the wheel, Long Breath. Use `tools/filmstrip.mjs` for motion. Judge at 1920x1080 for the 10-foot view. WebGPU isn't used, so screenshots work.\"},{\"line_number\":1026,\"content\":\"| M1 | **Hands:** sim core, tissue painter, cursor, wheel, Forceps, Salve, Suture, Syringe, vitals, clock, grades, HUD, Results, Case 1 end to end, bot | A person would enjoy Case 1 on a stubbed pad and mouse. Tune this until it's good; everything rests on it |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2f6c5708-4ebd-4446-8963-a2ce0a6d07a1-87","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"400→    const allow = (typeof document !== 'undefined') || GAME.Art.force;\\n    if (allow && F) {\\n      try { F.shade({ beat: ((S.t || 0) % 1), slow: !!S.breath, dim: S.dim || 0 }); }\\n      catch (e) { /* painter */ }\\n    }\\n    r.overlay(g => {\\n      const px = E.px;\\n      if (F && F.cv && F.cv.width) { try { g.drawImage(F.cv, 0, 0); } catch (e) { /* no image */ } }\\n      px.rect(g, 0, 0, r.W, Math.max(0, oy), '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, 0, oy + CFG.FIELD_H, r.W, Math.max(0, r.H - oy - CFG.FIELD_H), '#102830');\\n410→      px.rect(g, 0, oy, Math.max(0, ox), CFG.FIELD_H, '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, ox + CFG.FIELD_W, oy, Math.max(0, r.W - ox - CFG.FIELD_W), CFG.FIELD_H, '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, ox + 8, oy + 8, CFG.FIELD_W - 16, CFG.FIELD_H - 16, '#0c2428');\\n      if (!S) return;\\n      const ink = bloodCol();\\n      for (const o of S.objects) {\\n        if (!o.alive && o.type !== 'retractor') continue;\\n        if (o.hidden && !o.marked) continue;\\n        const x = o.x + ox, y = o.y + oy;\\n        let c = COL[o.type] || '#9ad0c8';\\n420→        if (ink && (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'pool' || o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'arteryTear')) c = ink;\\n        const rad = o.type === 'pool' ? 8 + (o.vol || 0) * 0.15 : o.type === 'mass' ? (o.rad || 12) : o.type === 'bead' ? 3 : 4;\\n        if (o.guide && o.guide.length > 1 && (o.type === 'cut' || o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'slur')) {\\n          for (let k = 1; k < o.guide.length; k++) px.line(g, o.guide[k - 1][0] + ox, o.guide[k - 1][1] + oy, o.guide[k][0] + ox, o.guide[k][1] + oy, '#f2f0e6', 1);\\n        }\\n        px.disc(g, x, y, rad, o.done ? '#2a403c' : c);\\n        if (o.marked) px.disc(g, x, y, rad + 3, '#5ff0e0');\\n      }\\n      if (S.breath) {\\n        px.rect(g, ox + 20, oy + 16, CFG.FIELD_W - 40, 2, '#bfefff');\\n430→        px.rect(g, ox + 20, oy + CFG.FIELD_H - 18, CFG.FIELD_W - 40, 2, '#bfefff');\\n      }\\n      for (const p of S.players) if (!p.gone) GAME.Art.drawHand(g, p, ox, oy);\\n      const vit = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(S.vitals));\\n      const clk = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(S.clock));\\n      E.font.text(g, 'VIT ' + vit, 8, 6, vit < 30 ? '#ff7a6a' : '#e8fbf6', { scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      E.font.text(g, 'CLK ' + clk, 8, 26, clk < 20 ? '#ff7a6a' : '#e8fbf6', { scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      E.font.text(g, (S.phaseName || '') + '  ' + (S.activeDoc || ''), 8, 48, '#8fb8b0', { outline: '#06141a' });\\n      const tool = (S.players[0] && S.players[0].tool) || 'forceps';\\n      GAME.Art.toolIcon(g, tool, r.W - 28, r.H - 28, 1);\\n440→      E.font.text(g, tool.toUpperCase(), r.W - 8, r.H - 36, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'right', outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (PREFS.hints) E.font.text(g, game.input.label('useTool'), r.W - 8, r.H - 14, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'right', outline: false });\\n      const steady = Math.round(S.steady || 0);\\n      E.font.text(g, 'STEADY ' + steady, 8, r.H - 16, '#5ff0e0', { outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (S.codeBlue) E.font.text(g, 'SHOCK', r.W / 2, 64, '#ff7a6a', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (S.dressing) E.font.text(g, 'DRESSING', r.W / 2, 64, '#f2f0e6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (ribbon) E.font.text(g, 'DEMO', r.W - 8, 6, '#f5b700', { align: 'right', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (GAME.TUNE.dirty || RT.cheatUsed) E.font.text(g, 'DEV', 8, 66, '#f5b700', { outline: '#06141a' });\\n      if (S.t != null && GAME.BARKS && GAME.BARKS.length) {\\n        const bark = GAME.BARKS[Math.floor(S.t / 4) % GAME.BARKS.length];\\n450→        E.font.text(g, bark, r.W / 2, r.H - 28, '#d8e4dc', { align: 'center', outline: '#06141a' });\\n      }\\n      if (RT.devOpen) drawDev(g, r);\\n    });\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"400→    const allow = (typeof document !== 'undefined') || GAME.Art.force;\\n    if (allow && F) {\\n      try { F.shade({ beat: ((S.t || 0) % 1), slow: !!S.breath, dim: S.dim || 0 }); }\\n      catch (e) { /* painter */ }\\n    }\\n    r.overlay(g => {\\n      const px = E.px;\\n      if (F && F.cv && F.cv.width) { try { g.drawImage(F.cv, 0, 0); } catch (e) { /* no image */ } }\\n      px.rect(g, 0, 0, r.W, Math.max(0, oy), '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, 0, oy + CFG.FIELD_H, r.W, Math.max(0, r.H - oy - CFG.FIELD_H), '#102830');\\n410→      px.rect(g, 0, oy, Math.max(0, ox), CFG.FIELD_H, '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, ox + CFG.FIELD_W, oy, Math.max(0, r.W - ox - CFG.FIELD_W), CFG.FIELD_H, '#102830');\\n      px.rect(g, ox + 8, oy + 8, CFG.FIELD_W - 16, CFG.FIELD_H - 16, '#0c2428');\\n      if (!S) return;\\n      const ink = bloodCol();\\n      for (const o of S.objects) {\\n        if (!o.alive && o.type !== 'retractor') continue;\\n        if (o.hidden && !o.marked) continue;\\n        const x = o.x + ox, y = o.y + oy;\\n        let c = COL[o.type] || '#9ad0c8';\\n420→        if (ink && (o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'pool' || o.type === 'wound' || o.type === 'laceration' || o.type === 'arteryTear')) c = ink;\\n    