{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_335","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan specifies that a ring should appear around the cursor while the stick is out.\n\nThe wheel ring will be drawn in drawOp when RT.wheelT is active. It triggers when stick magnitude exceeds 0.6 or wheelHold is pressed, decaying over 0.3 seconds. Eight discs will appear around the cursor.\n\nThe wheel ring will use CFG.WHEEL offsets. The variable will be named RT.wheelShow to avoid a conflict with player.wheelT. After adding the draw code, I will write the builder and documentation. For the shot, I can set RT.wheelShow to 1 before the screenshot so the ring appears in the image.\n\nThe shot will set RT.wheelShow to 2 seconds before the screenshot. This keeps the ring visible for 100ms while the game loop decrements it. If the flag were cleared immediately when the stick is neutral, the timeout would be too short.\n\nThe wheel ring will draw eight discs around the local player at CFG.WHEEL offsets scaled by 22 pixels. Active tools will render as cyan with a dark background, and each disc will display its tool icon. The draw logic will run in drawOp when RT.wheelShow is positive, while the drive loop will update the flag for the local seat.\n\nThe wheel flag will be set in drive when the local stick magnitude exceeds 0.6, and decremented by dt each loop. The 16 substeps per frame could burn it too fast, so the shot must set a longer initial value.\n\nThe wheel flag will be updated once per frame in the op update instead of inside the 16 substeps. This prevents the 0.35-second decay from burning too fast. The shot can set RT.wheelShow to 5 seconds so the ring lasts through the screenshot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8d2fc0e6-9b54-49da-9532-91302ac1fddc-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js","old_string":"      for (const p of S.players) if (!p.gone) GAME.Art.drawHand(g, p, ox, oy);","new_string":"      if (RT.wheelShow > 0 && S.players[0] && !S.players[0].gone) {\n        const c = S.players[0];\n        for (const w of CFG.WHEEL) {\n          const x = c.x + ox + w.x * 22, y = c.y + oy + w.y * 22;\n          const on = c.tool === w.tool;\n          px.disc(g, x, y, on ? 8 : 5, on ? '#5ff0e0' : '#14343c');\n          GAME.Art.toolIcon(g, w.tool, x - 4, y - 4, 1);\n        }\n      }\n      for (const p of S.players) if (!p.gone) GAME.Art.drawHand(g, p, ox, oy);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8d2fc0e6-9b54-49da-9532-91302ac1fddc-89","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js","old_string":"        if (fast) {\n          for (let k = 0; k < 16; k++) drive(S, 1 / 45);\n        } else drive(S, dt);","new_string":"        if (fast) {\n          for (let k = 0; k < 16; k++) drive(S, 1 / 45);\n        } else drive(S, dt);\n        const mv = game.input.padMove || [0, 0];\n        if (Math.hypot(mv[0] || 0, mv[1] || 0) > 0.6 || game.input.down('wheelHold')) RT.wheelShow = 0.35;\n        else RT.wheelShow = Math.max(0, (RT.wheelShow || 0) - dt);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3222,"output_tokens":1769,"cache_read_input_tokens":189440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"b6a9f7e5-bb9c-4e69-8505-ae6f16030574"}
