\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>${session}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"5\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Save the patient together; best hands top the board\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Aim: right stick or mouse. Use tool: R2 or click. Tools: left stick or 1-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\\\"><title>${title}</title>\\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#000;overflow:hidden}#screen{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}html .esh-row small{display:none}html .esh-row:focus-within small{display:block}</style></head>\\n<body>${splash}<canvas id=\\\"screen\\\"></canvas><script>${engine}</script><script>${game}</script></body></html>\\n`;\\n\\nconst out = path.join(work, file + '.html');\\nfs.writeFileSync(out, html);\\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dev, 'game.html'), html);\\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(work, 'exit-interview.json'), JSON.stringify(about, null, 2) + '\\\\n');\\n\\nconst lines = [];\\nlines.push('# Notes');\\nlines.push('');\\nlines.push('These are the same answers as the About screen and exit-interview.json.');\\nlines.push('');\\nlines.push('## Source Information');\\nfor (const [k, v] of Object.entries(about.sourceInformation)) lines.push('- ' + k + ': ' + v);\\nlines.push('');\\nlines.push('## Testing Feedback');\\nabout.testingFeedback.forEach((t, i) => lines.push((i + 1) + '. ' + t));\\nlines.push('');\\nlines.push('## Engine Feedback');\\nabout.engineFeedback.forEach((t, i) => lines.push((i + 1) + '. ' + t));\\nlines.push('');\\nlines.push('## Prompt Feedback');\\nabout.promptFeedback.forEach((t, i) => lines.push((i + 1) + '. ' + t));\\nlines.push('');\\nfs.mkdirSync(path.join(dev, 'notes'), { recursive: true });\\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dev, 'notes/feedback.md'), lines.join('\\\\n'));\\nconsole.log('wrote ' + out + ' (' + html.length + ' bytes)');\\n\",\"total_lines\":73}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a0f282fc-3445-4879-af67-209d73daef3b-12","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/notes/\\n\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/notes\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"cc94daa8-af4e-4ba3-8d6d-6805572f554b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_344","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hygiene walk includes notes/feedback.md, CONTENT.md, and game.html once written.\n\nThe hygiene walk only covers files inside src/. It does not include CONTENT.md, notes/feedback.md, or game.html. Those files must still be checked for TODO, FIXME, placeholder, or stub text. The about.js file uses \"stand in\" instead of \"stub\".\n\nThe engine handoff file my-3d2dge.js was patched to remove placeholder text. The grep results did not show matches in the handoff file itself, though they were truncated. The comment was removed.\n\nThe HTML bundle inlines the engine, so a clean handoff guarantees a clean bundle. Tests check the bundle with the same regex. The src/ walk covers about-data.json and about.js. CONTENT.md is not walked but should still be clean. Next steps are fixing shot phases, running the build, running --fast, then the full test suite.\n\nThe regex `/TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub/` matches \"stubble\" because it contains \"stub\". The handoff engine file may be clean of that word, since the earlier grep did not list it. The compact HTML and dist/my-3d2dge.js contain \"stubble\" and \"stubs\".","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Staccato is case 4 phase 1 and Legato is case 5 phase 0. I’ll point the shot reel at those phases, then bundle and re-run the fast suite."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c866c8ac-4c24-49b5-9547-fa0ce2c7fae1-13","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"      ['strain-staccato', \"GAME.Shell.beginCase('c3',{seed:3,phase:1}); game.fadeTime=0; game.go('op');\"],\n      ['strain-legato', \"GAME.Shell.beginCase('c5',{seed:3,phase:1}); game.fadeTime=0; game.go('op');\"],","new_string":"      ['