{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_366","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A polling monitor will track the process and print only when it completes or fails.\n\nThe test buffers stdout until the parent process exits, so the monitor will poll for the exit file instead of the process PID.\n\nThe monitor polls every 15 seconds and only prints once at the end. It will also check if the process died early, since otherwise it could hang until the 10-hour timeout.\n\nThe monitor will poll for the exit file up to 40 times, sleeping 15 seconds between attempts. This caps the wait at about 10 minutes and prevents hanging indefinitely if the process crashes before writing the exit file.\n\nI will prepare the deviations text and review PROGRESS.md while waiting. I will also check the terminal log to confirm the test suite started before flipping the checklist.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-155c55d4-4bd8-4bc5-b7bc-981e2473f2da-66","name":"monitor","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer\nfor i in $(seq 1 48); do\n  if [ -f \"$SCRATCH/tests.exit\" ]; then\n    code=$(cat \"$SCRATCH/tests.exit\")\n    body=$(cat \"$SCRATCH/tests.log\" 2>/dev/null)\n    if [ \"$code\" = \"0\" ]; then echo \"DONE: $body\"; exit 0; else echo \"FAILED: exit $code $body\"; exit 1; fi\n  fi\n  sleep 15\ndone\necho \"FAILED: timed out waiting for the test suite\"\nexit 1","description":"Watch the full test suite until it exits","timeout_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-155c55d4-4bd8-4bc5-b7bc-981e2473f2da-67","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["5288a5e1-cdae-483a-92d5-0e61a9c4df25"],"timeout_ms":25000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1867,"output_tokens":972,"cache_read_input_tokens":129536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"a372988c-7e78-4454-a732-fc653499af70"}
