[{\"line_number\":76,\"content\":\"    const banned = /TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub/;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/hub/harness.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"  <label>Game <input class=\\\"game\\\" id=\\\"game\\\" placeholder=\\\"mygame.html or /games/mygame/index.html\\\"></label>\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/API-INDEX.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"- `E.build: \\\"dev-build\\\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/CHANGELOG.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":72,\"content\":\"- **Tools**: the contract suite holds each (the host's chord on a scripted pad and on a stubbed gamepad, a live pause, a layout change, DEFAULT's halves as documented and a preset's own, player 2 waking the attract mode); `tools/engine-lib.mjs`'s `load` takes a page's own globals (a stubbed `navigator`).\"},{\"line_number\":579,\"content\":\"- **Tools**: the kit diet (`DIET` in `tools/build.mjs`, `tools/diet.mjs`): a genre kit's engine leaves out the core's sections its game never calls, worked out from the code (acorn reads the core's top-level statements; what the kit's shell, slice, sets, modules and, in 3D, the 3D engine call). A statement that extends a left-out class goes with it; a name kept code needs stays; what goes answers with a stub that warns once (a constructor throws) naming its section and the full engine. The kit's header lists what it left out and names the file for a game of several genres. 2D kits: adventure 195k tokens (was 203k), shooter 192k (208k), RPG 190k (205k), brawler 188k (205k), animation lab 181k (195k), platformer 180k (207k), stealth 180k (188k); 3D kits 215k, 210k and 285k (241k, 236k, 311k).\"},{\"line_number\":580,\"content\":\"- **Tools**: `tools/kits-test.mjs` (the `kits` suite, `npm run test:kits`): every kit's title and its slice's proof run twice (the same hash, no errors, no stub called), the 3D kits served on WebGL 2, the reference editions' title menu (families, keys, a click, scrolling); `--compare <dir>` films every 2D kit's title and play beside another build's and fails on any pixel that differs. Every 2D kit, filmed beside the build without the diet: the same pixels.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/my-3d2dge.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":81,\"content\":\" *  from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/src/assets/sets/emberdeep.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":101,\"content\":\"'tree-log': {about:'long fallen log with two branch stubs',tags:'plant forest camp',mats:{a:'clay-2',b:'sandstone-b-2'},parts:[['cyl','a',[-0.1,-28,6],7,56,{rot:[-90,0,0]}],['prism','a',[0,14,0],[[3.7,7.5],[0.7,9],[0.6,9.5],[5,15.5],[7,14]],3.7,{axis:'y'}],['prism','a',[0,-9.5,0],[[-4.5,7.5],[-7,13],[-7,13.5],[-5,14.5],[-1.6,9.5]],3.1,{axis:'y'}],['box','b',[-0.2,28.5,2],[4.5,0.5,1]],['box','b',[-2.7,28.5,2.5],[0.5,0.5,7]],['box','b',[-0.7,28.5,3],[3.5,0.5,0.5]],['box','b',[-3.2,28.5,3.5],[0.5,0.5,