{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_402","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A potential bug was spotted in the `playTune()` function.\n\n`playTune()` overwrites `GAME.TUNE.hands.cursor` and `hands.assist` with `PREFS` values every step. This nullifies the dev sliders for cursor speed and assist. A test checks that tapping the right button dirties the tuning.\n\nThe test only changes the first slider, patient.drain, which playTune does not overwrite. This is why the test passes while hands.cursor and hands.assist remain dead. The cursor speed during play is actually driven by the tune object returned from playTune(), so dev-mode adjustments to those sliders have no effect.\n\nThe settings cursor speed slider does work via PREFS. The hands group is only partially live: fine, curve, magnet, and grade respond to dev-mode changes, but cursor and assist do not. This raises a question about whether the criterion should be judged by the group as a whole or by individual keys.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1617,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"strains\\.spawn|tune\\.strains|tune\\.hands\\.magnet|PREFS","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/launch-1.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/shots/ward.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-48","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/shots/strain-cantor.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5894,"output_tokens":886,"cache_read_input_tokens":132864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"d2cd3a1a-2627-45c0-bc8b-cddace759816"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-06613b78-7ee1-404d-9827-5b6d6e813bce-44","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1617→  /* ---------- cursor and wheel ---------- */\\n\\n  function assistOf(S, tune) {\\n1620→    let a = tune.hands.assist;\\n    if (S && S.diff === 'intern') a += 0.2;\\n    if (S && (S.activeDoc === 'sokolova')) a += 0.2;\\n    return clamp(a, 0, 1.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function jitterOf(S, p) {\\n    const st = S && S.strain;\\n    if (!st || !st.jitter || (S && S.breath)) return [0, 0];\\n    const amp = 5 * (st.amp == null ? 1 : st.amp) * (p.fine ? 0.35 : 1);\\n1630→    return [Math.sin((S.worldT || 0) * 17.3 + p.id) * amp, Math.cos((S.worldT || 0) * 13.1 + p.id * 2) * amp];\\n  }\\n\\n  function validTarget(S, p, tune) {\\n    const rad = tune.hands.magnet;\\n    return nearest(S, p, rad, o => {\\n      if (!canTouch(S, o)) return false;\\n      if (o.type === 'pool') return p.tool === 'suction';\\n      if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold') return false;\\n      if (p.tool === 'sonar') return !!o.hidden;\\n1640→      if (p.tool === 'salve') return !!o.cells;\\n      if (p.tool === 'syringe') return o.type === 'clot' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice' || o.type === 'lobe';\\n      if (p.tool === 'cautery') return o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb' || o.type === 'lobe';\\n      if (p.tool === 'forceps') return o.type === 'shard' || o.type === 'fragment' || o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'hook' || o.type === 'gaff' || o.type === 'cork' || o.type === 'note' || o.type === 'retractor' || o.type === 'screw' || o.type === 'nest';\\n      if (p.tool === 'scalpel') return !!o.guide;\\n      if (p.tool === 'suture') return !!o.pairs;\\n      return false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n1650→  function updateCursor(p, dev, S, dt, tune) {\\n    tune = tuneOf(tune);\\n    dev = dev || {};\\n    if (dev.mouse) {\\n      p.bx = dev.mouse[0]; p.by = dev.mouse[1];\\n      p.x = p.bx; p.y = p.by;\\n      p.fine = !!dev.fine;\",\"content_concise\":\"1617→  /* ---------- cursor and wheel ---------- */\\n\\n  function assistOf(S, tune) {\\n1620→    let a = tune.hands.assist;\\n    if (S && S.diff === 'intern') a += 0.2;\\n    if (S && (S.activeDoc === 'sokolova')) a += 0.2;\\n    return clamp(a, 0, 1.4);\\n  }\\n\\n  function jitterOf(S, p) {\\n    const st = S && S.strain;\\n    if (!st || !st.jitter || (S && S.breath)) return [0, 0];\\n    const amp = 5 * (st.amp == null ? 1 : st.amp) * (p.fine ? 0.35 : 1);\\n1630→    return [Math.sin((S.worldT || 0) * 17.3 + p.id) * amp, Math.cos((S.worldT || 0) * 13.1 + p.id * 2) * amp];\\n  }\\n\\n  function validTarget(S, p, tune) {\\n    const rad = tune.hands.magnet;\\n    return nearest(S, p, rad, o => {\\n      if (!canTouch(S, o)) return false;\\n      if (o.type === 'pool') return p.tool === 'suction';\\n      if (o.type === 'nerve' || o.type === 'eloquent' || o.type === 'hold') return false;\\n      if (p.tool === 'sonar') return !!o.hidden;\\n1640→      if (p.tool === 'salve') return !!o.cells;\\n      if (p.tool === 'syringe') return o.type === 'clot' || o.type === 'reed' || o.type === 'voice' || o.type === 'lobe';\\n      if (p.tool === 'cautery') return o.type === 'polyp' || o.type === 'bleeder' || o.type === 'bead' || o.type === 'uvula' || o.type === 'eye' || o.type === 'rupture' || o.type === 'tremass' || o.type === 'barb' || o.type === 'lobe';\\n      if (p.tool === 'forceps') return o.type === 'shard' || o.type === 'fragment' || o.type === 'mass' || o.type === 'hook' || o.type === 'gaff' || o.type === 'cork' || o.type === 'note' || o.type === 'retractor' || o.type === 'screw' || o.type === 'nest';\\n      if (p.tool === 'scalpel') return !!o.guide;\\n      if (p.tool === 'suture') return !!o.pairs;\\n      return false;\\n    