{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_404","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"CONTENT.md mentions existing tuning as a strain.\n\nCONTENT.md claims spawn works, but it is never read and beat is unused. This is a documentation lie plus a dead slider. PROGRESS.md has no titles matching \"50\". The Cantor bug theory was ruled out because bot.play does not set cheats. Next steps are to inspect PROGRESS.md, scan HTML for forbidden words and script order, and confirm whether strains.beat is truly dead code.\n\nA real bug was found in `playTune`. It overwrites `hands.cursor` with the current preference value. This clobbers live cursor changes during dev mode. The function is called inside `drive()` and feeds the resulting tune into `GAME.Op.step()`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-86373d63-26bd-44e8-942c-bde372aaa751-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ghosts|ghostT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-86373d63-26bd-44e8-942c-bde372aaa751-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PROGRESS.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-86373d63-26bd-44e8-942c-bde372aaa751-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"strains\\.beat|tune\\.strains\\.beat|st\\.beat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-86373d63-26bd-44e8-942c-bde372aaa751-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"<script|AI Hub Session|TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Traum