{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_406","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"S.ghosts is never read outside secondLook's write.\n\ndrawOp never draws ghosts, so ghost replay is ineffective. tune.strains.beat is captured but unused in stepStaccato; beat periods are hardcoded instead. playTune overwrites hands.cursor and hands.assist. The clear phase never sets strain.done. Tests are missing for magnet, guide-follow, 8 wheel directions, loose stitch, and ghosts. Da Capo regrowth when all lobes die immediately is intended for round 2. The win cheat is clearly broken.\n\nThe CONTROLS config sets tool1 through tool8 to false. This may unbind the number keys and break keyboard tool selection. The pad wheel still works.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd4e95c4-8c05-4adf-8252-8052877b829e-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tool1|false","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API.md","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd4e95c4-8c05-4adf-8252-8052877b829e-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tool1","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff","glob":"*.md","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6136,"output_tokens":652,"cache_read_input_tokens":154624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"0a88cb4a-0a2c-4ab0-a4d0-3730986abb3b"}
