f (key === 'lose' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; GAME.Sim.lose(S, 'dev'); return; }\\n      if (key === 'code' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; S.vitals = 0; return; }\\n      if (S) {\\n        S.cheat = S.cheat || {};\",\"content_concise\":\"515→        const i = SLOW.indexOf(game.timeScale);\\n        game.timeScale = SLOW[(i + 1) % SLOW.length] || 1;\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n520→      if (key === 'win' && S) {\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n        for (const o of S.objects) { o.done = true; o.prog = 1; }\\n        S.hold = false;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (key === 'lose' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; GAME.Sim.lose(S, 'dev'); return; }\\n      if (key === 'code' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; S.vitals = 0; return; }\\n      if (S) {\\n        S.cheat = S.cheat || {};\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js\",\"offset\":515,\"limit\":15,\"raw_output\":\"        const i = SLOW.indexOf(game.timeScale);\\n        game.timeScale = SLOW[(i + 1) % SLOW.length] || 1;\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (key === 'win' && S) {\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n        for (const o of S.objects) { o.done = true; o.prog = 1; }\\n        S.hold = false;\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (key === 'lose' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; GAME.Sim.lose(S, 'dev'); return; }\\n      if (key === 'code' && S) { RT.cheatUsed = true; S.vitals = 0; return; }\\n      if (S) {\\n        S.cheat = S.cheat || {};\\n\",\"total_lines\":1410}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"4a9c7020-c35c-4979-a701-63c5264232ff"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_410","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bugs are also present in the shipped HTML.\n\nI found several unused code paths and missing tests. win cheat lines are in shell.js 520-524 and phaseClear in sim.js 1284-1285. playTune is at shell.js 167-171. stepStaccato beat is unused at sim.js 845. strains.spawn appears only in config.js 50 and ghosts are written at sim.js 330 but never read. Missing tests are a gap that needs assertions. I am also questioning whether the ghost data issue counts as a refute since the data is filled but invisible to players.\n\nGhost replay is wired to nothing and qualifies as a placeholder stub. The ghostT counter only decrements with no gameplay effect. I will write the output files and terminal token.\n\nplayTune overwrites hands.cursor and hands.assist from PREFS, so dev sliders for those values have no effect during play. The Clear phase never sets strain.done, leaving phaseClear permanently false. The verification plan lacks assertions for magnet, guide-follow, all eight wheel directions, loose stitch, and non-empty Second Look ghosts; the cautery lock check is also tautological.\n\nThe ghost array is never empty. The filter includes the pick target and any later entries, so at least one ghost is always produced when the ring is non-empty.\n\nThe terminal response must be exactly \"Refuted\" or \"Not Refuted\". The JSON schema and markdown summary will be written as separate files. The spawn and beat sliders are not live-changing; only speed, health, and damage respond to edits.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The shipped sim fills Second Look ghosts and several dev sliders, but nothing reads them. I’ll record those defects and the missing plan-required assertions."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccef1950-85e1-4505-8073-e9663d0cb669-69","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/goal-verdict-08d1b960e391-1-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": true,\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"src/core/sim.js:330\",\n      \"detail\": \"Second Look writes S.ghosts and ghostT, but nothing reads them: drawOp never paints afterimages, so the gift is only a rewind.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"src/scenes/shell.js:167\",\n      \"detail\": \"playTune() copies TUNE then overwrites hands.cursor and hands.assist from PREFS, so those dev sliders do not change the live cursor.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"src/core/sim.js:845\",\n      \"detail\": \"strains.beat is assigned and never used; strains.spawn is never read. Moving those dev sliders does not change bead timing or spawns.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"src/scenes/shell.js:520\",\n      \"detail\": \"Clear phase marks objects done but not strain.done, so phaseClear stays false and the cheat cannot finish any strain phase.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"gap\",\n      \"location\": \"tests/run.mjs\",\n      \"detail\": \"Verification step 1 requires assertions for magnet, guide-follow, all eight wheel directions, a loose stitch, and non-empty Second Look ghosts. Those checks are absent; the cautery lock check is true whenever slips > 0.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": \"src/core/sim.js:323-331 writes ghosts that src never reads; shell.js:167-171 clobbers hands sliders; sim.js:845 leaves strains.beat unused; shell.js:520-524 vs sim.js:1285; tests/run.mjs cursor group only checks travel and one wheel sector; implementer/tests.log is '142 checks, 0 failed'.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"Second Look stores ghost samples and then ignores them, and several required dev controls do not change play. The captured suite is green because it never asserts those paths.\\n\\n- **Ghosts are a no-op.** `secondLook` (`src/core/sim.js:323-331`) fills `S.ghosts` and `ghostT`. The only later use is `ghostT -= dt` (`sim.js:1605`). `drawOp` never reads `S.ghosts`, so the six-second afterimage replay does not exist. Criterion 2 and PLAN.md §5.7 require that data to drive the look.\\n- **Hands sliders are overwritten.** `playTune` (`src/scenes/shell.js:167-171`) clones `GAME.TUNE` and then sets `hands.assist` and `hands.cursor` from Settings prefs. Dev-mode changes to those two keys never reach `updateCursor` or `step`. The test only nudges `patient.drain`, which is not clobbered.\\n- **Two strain sliders do nothing.** `tune.strains.beat` is captured in `stepStaccato` (`sim.js:845`) and never used. `strains.spawn` appears only in `DEV_KEYS` (`src/config.js:50`). Speed, health, and damage do apply; beat and spawn do not.\\n- **Clear phase cannot end a strain.** `devAct` (`shell.js:520-524`) sets every object's `done` and returns. `phaseClear` (`sim.js:1285`) returns false while `S.strain && !S.strain.done`, so Cases 4–11 stay in the phase.\\n- **Plan-required checks are missing.** `tests/run.mjs` does not assert magnet, guide-follow, the other seven wheel directions, a loose stitch, or `ghosts.length`. The cautery lock check passes on any slip. `implementer/tests.log` is `142 checks, 0 failed`, which does not cover these defects.\\n\\nLaunch, Hub, exit-interview shape, and the bot clear log were not the failure. Fix the four behaviors and assert them on the shipped sim.\"\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccef1950-85e1-4505-8073-e9663d0cb669-70","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/goal-classifier-08d1b960e391-1-skeptic-0.md","content":"Second Look stores ghost samples and then ignores them, and several required dev controls do not change play. The captured suite is green because it never asserts those paths.\n\n- **Ghosts are a no-op.** `secondLook` (`src/core/sim.js:323-331`) fills `S.ghosts` and `ghostT`. The only later use is `ghostT -= dt` (`sim.js:1605`). `drawOp` never reads `S.ghosts`, so the six-second afterimage replay does not exist. Criterion 2 and PLAN.md §5.7 require that data to drive the look.\n- **Hands sliders are overwritten.** `playTune` (`src/scenes/shell.js:167-171`) clones `GAME.TUNE` and then sets `hands.assist` and `hands.cursor` from Settings prefs. Dev-mode changes to those two keys never reach `updateCursor` or `step`. The test only nudges `patient.drain`, which is not clobbered.\n- **Two strain sliders do nothing.** `tune.strains.beat` is captured in `stepStaccato` (`sim.js:845`) and never used. `strains.spawn` appears only in `DEV_KEYS` (`src/config.js:50`). Speed, health, and damage do apply; beat and spawn do not.\n- **Clear phase cannot end a strain.** `devAct` (`shell.js:520-524`) sets every object's `done` and returns. `phaseClear` (`sim.js:1285`) returns false while `S.strain && !S.strain.done`, so Cases 4–11 stay in the phase.\n- **Plan-required checks are missing.** `tests/run.mjs` does not assert magnet, guide-follow, the other seven wheel directions, a loose stitch, or `ghosts.length`. The cautery lock check passes on any slip. `implementer/tests.log` is `142 checks, 0 failed`, which does not cover these defects.\n\nLaunch, Hub, exit-interview shape, and the bot clear log were not the failure. Fix the four behaviors and assert them on the shipped sim.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3062,"output_tokens":2496,"cache_read_input_tokens":167552,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"93d14c45-ce8c-4c62-90d6-a83178d84046"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ccef1950-85e1-4505-8073-e9663d0cb669-69","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": true,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"src/core/sim.js:330\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Second Look writes S.ghosts and ghostT, but nothing reads them: drawOp never paints afterimages, so the gift is only a rewind.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"src/scenes/shell.js:167\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"playTune() copies TUNE then overwrites hands.cursor and hands.assist from PREFS, so those dev sliders do not change the live cursor.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"src/core/sim.js:845\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"strains.beat is assigned and never used; strains.spawn is never read. Moving those dev sliders does not change bead timing or spawns.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"src/scenes/shell.js:520\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Clear phase marks objects done but not strain.done, so phaseClear stays false and the cheat cannot finish any strain phase.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"tests/run.mjs\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Verification step 1 requires assertions for magnet, guide-follow, all eight wheel directions, a loose stitch, and non-empty Second Look ghosts. Those checks are absent; the cautery lock check is true whenever slips > 0.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"src/core/sim.js:323-331 writes ghosts that src never reads; shell.js:167-171 clobbers hands sliders; sim.js:845 leaves strains.beat unused; shell.js:520-524 vs sim.js:1285; tests/run.mjs cursor group only checks travel and one wheel sector; implementer/tests.log is '142 checks, 0 failed'.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"Second Look stores ghost samples and then ignores them, and several required dev controls do not change play. The captured suite is green because it never asserts those paths.\\\\n\\\\n- **Ghosts are a no-op.** `secondLook` (`src/core/sim.js:323-331`) fills `S.ghosts` and `ghostT`. The only later use is `ghostT -= dt` (`sim.js:1605`). `drawOp` never reads `S.ghosts`, so the six-second afterimage replay does not exist. Criterion 2 and PLAN.md §5.7 require that data to drive the look.\\\\n- **Hands sliders are overwritten.** `playTune` (`src/scenes/shell.js:167-171`) clones `GAME.TUNE` and then sets `hands.assist` and `hands.cursor` from Settings prefs. Dev-mode changes to those two keys never reach `updateCursor` or `step`. The test only nudges `patient.drain`, which is not clobbered.\\\\n- **Two strain sliders do nothing.** `tune.strains.beat` is captured in `stepStaccato` (`sim.js:845`) and never used. `strains.spawn` appears only in `DEV_KEYS` (`src/config.js:50`). Speed, health, and damage do apply; beat and spawn do not.\\\\n- **Clear phase cannot end a strain.** `devAct` (`shell.js:520-524`) sets every object's `done` and returns. `phaseClear` (`sim.js:1285`) returns false while `S.strain && !S.strain.done`, so Cases 4–11 stay in the phase.\\\\n- **Plan-required checks are missing.** `tests/run.mjs` does not assert magnet, guide-follow, the other seven wheel directions, a loose stitch, or `ghosts.length`. The cautery lock check passes on any slip. `implementer/tests.log` is `142 checks, 0 failed`, which does not cover these defects.\\\\n\\\\nLaunch, Hub, exit-interview shape, and the bot clear log were not the failure. Fix the four behaviors and assert them on the shipped sim.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08