,106,101,99,116,32,97,116,32,116,104,101,32,99,117,114,115,111,114,44,32,106,117,109,112,32,116,111,32,97,110,121,32,115,116,111,114,121,32,110,111,100,101,44,32,117,110,108,111,99,107,32,97,108,108,44,32,99,108,101,97,114,32,115,97,118,101,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":6,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":389,\"content\":\"Swarm of beads hopping in bursts on a fixed beat, from hidden **nests**. A closing dotted ring shows each landing spot .5 s ahead. A landing bite leaves a `laceration`. Cautery kills a bead in .12 s. Find nests with Sonar; slash, then Forceps. When the last nest goes, the remaining beads die within 3 s. Sound: \\\"tk-tk-tk\\\" on the beat, so the rhythm is playable by ear.\"},{\"line_number\":463,\"content\":\"2. Something moved: Sonar, 2 hidden nests.\"},{\"line_number\":516,\"content\":\"**Skills Lab** in Case Files: a sandbox with no clock and locked vitals, respawning one of everything unlocked so far. It reuses the op scene. Quill: \\\"This is a pig's trotter. It has signed the waiver.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":624,\"content\":\"2. **Swarm:** Staccato, N nests, 4N beads at once.\"},{\"line_number\":696,\"content\":\"| **Tuning** | Live sliders, grouped in pages. **Patient:** drain x, slip damage x, healing x, syringe dose, clock x. **Hands:** cursor speed, fine factor, stick curve, assist, magnet radius, grade tolerance x. **Strains:** speed x, health x, spawn rate x, damage x, Staccato beat. **Gift:** charge x, Long Breath drain, Long Breath time factor, Second Look seconds. **Fluids:** bleed x, suction rate, cautery heat. **Reset to defaults** per page and for everything. Values persist under a dev key in `E.store`; a default mark shows on each slider |\"},{\"line_number\":698,\"content\":\"| **Jump** | Any case, any phase. Force win, force lost, trigger Code Blue, spawn any strain or object at the cursor, jump to any story node, unlock all, clear save |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-793a248c-0103-491b-a776-3c345385418e-125","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"620→    if (p.trigEdge) {\\n      /* Press within 9 u of the next near point. Stitches sit off the wound center. */\\n      const reach = 9 + extra + (p.mouse ? 1 : 0);\\n      let o = null, bd = reach;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n        const q = S.objects[i];\\n        if (!canTouch(S, q) || !q.pairs || (q.stitch || 0) >= q.pairs.length) continue;\\n        const a = q.pairs[q.stitch][0];\\n        const d = hypot(p.x - a[0], p.y - a[1]);\\n        if (d <= bd) { bd = d; o = q; }\\n630→      }\\n      if (o) {\\n        p.stroke = { kind: 'suture', id: o.id, i: o.stitch, t: 0 };\\n        pushEv(S, ['needle', o.id, o.stitch]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && down) p.stroke.t += dt;\\n    if (p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.trigRelease) {\\n      const o = objById(S, p.stroke.id);\\n      const st = p.stroke;\\n640→      p.stroke = null;\\n      if (!o || o.done) return;\\n      const b = o.pairs[st.i][1];\\n      const tol = 6 + extra + (p.mouse ? 1 : 0);\\n      if (hypot(p.x - b[0], p.y - b[1]) <= tol) {\\n        const g = gradeMean(st.t, 0.6, 1.2);\\n        o.grades = o.grades || [];\\n        o.grades.push(g === 'textbook' ? 2 : g === 'clean' ? 1 : 0);\\n        o.times = o.times || [];\\n        o.times.push(st.t);\\n650→        o.stitch = st.i + 1;\\n        o.prog = o.stitch / o.pairs.length;\\n        p.stitches += 1;\\n        const bleedLeft = 1 - o.prog;\\n        if (o.type === 'arteryTear') o.drain = 1 * bleedLeft;\\n        else if (o.type === 'wound') o.drain = 0.4 * bleedLeft;\\n        pushEv(S, ['stitch', Math.round(b[0]), Math.round(b[1]), g]);\\n        if (o.stitch >= o.pairs.length) {\\n          const meanT = o.times.reduce((a, c) => a + c, 0) / o.times.length;\\n          const fg = gradeMean(meanT, 0.6, 1.2);\\n660→          o.done = true; o.alive = false; o.grade = fg; o.drain = 0;\\n          award(S, p, fg, 80 + 20 * o.pairs.length, tune);\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        slip(S, p, 'loose', 1, tune);\\n        pushEv(S, ['loose', o.id]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n670→  function stepSalve(S, p, dt, tune) {\\n    if (p.trig <= 0.3) return;\\n    let any = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n      const o = S.objects[i];\",\"content_concise\":\"620→    if (p.trigEdge) {\\n      /* Press within 9 u of the next near point. Stitches sit off the wound center. */\\n      const reach = 9 + extra + (p.mouse ? 1 : 0);\\n      let o = null, bd = reach;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < S.objects.length; i++) {\\n        const q = S.objects[i];\\n        if (!canTouch(S, q) || !q.pairs || (q.stitch || 0) >= q.pairs.length) continue;\\n        const a = q.pairs[q.stitch][0];\\n        const d = hypot(p.x - a[0], p.y - a[1]);\\n        if (d <= bd) { bd = d; o = q; }\\n630→      }\\n      if (o) {\\n        p.stroke = { kind: 'suture', id: o.id, i: o.stitch, t: 0 };\\n        pushEv(S, ['needle', o.id, o.stitch]);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && down) p.stroke.t += dt;\\n    if (p.stroke && p.stroke.kind === 'suture' && p.trigRelease) {\\n      const o = objById(S, p.stroke.id);\\n      const st = p.stroke;\\n640→      p.stroke = null;\\n      if (!o || o.done) return;\\n      const b = o.pairs[st.i][1];\\n      const tol = 6 + extra + (p.mouse ? 1 : 0);\\n      if (hypot(p.x - b[0], p.y - b[1]) <= tol) {\\n        const g = gradeMean(st.t, 0.6, 1.2);\\n        o.grades = o.grades || [];\\n        o.grades.push(g === 'textbook' ? 2 : g === 'clean' ? 1 : 0);\\n        o.times = o.times || [];\\n        o.times.push(st.t);\\n650→        o.stitch = st.i + 1;\\n        o.prog =