se 10\\\\'s par sat above a clean score, and Second Look fired on a flag that never cleared.',\"},{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\"      'Seven were critical. The reach bugs, the ring, the IV gate, the eye window, the consult toggle, the forceps edge, and the early dish each stopped a case. The par and the sticky rewind were serious and did not by themselves end the run.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/bot/bot.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"    if (o.needsWindow && S.windowOpen <= 0) return false;\"},{\"line_number\":125,\"content\":\"      if (!o.window) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"    'The window is open. Cut.', 'I have the retractor. Pretend I do not.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/art/field.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"  const G = typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis;\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e9136164-8f06-4bb9-9257-45ea34111d8a-12","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107