2,42,32,112,117,108,115,101,91,106,93,32,42,32,46,54,41,32,42,32,40,111,118,32,63,32,49,32,58,32,97,111,91,106,93,41,32,42,32,108,105,116,44,32,99,32,61,32,77,97,116,104,46,109,97,120,40,48,44,32,77,97,116,104,46,109,105,110,40,110,32,45,32,49,44,32,40,108,117,109,32,42,32,40,110,32,45,32,49,41,32,43,32,66,65,89,69,82,91,40,120,32,38,32,51,41,32,124,32,40,40,121,32,38,32,51,41,32,60,60,32,50,41,93,32,42,32,49,46,49,53,32,43,32,46,53,41,32,124,32,48,41,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":30,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":250,\"content\":\"**Cautery.** Hold for a beam on a 6 u spot. Polyp .5 s, pinhole bleeder .35 s, Staccato bead .12 s. Heat fills at .5/s and cools at .6/s; at 1 it locks for 1.2 s. On bare tissue for .25 s it leaves char, -.8 vitals/s, and a slip at .6 s. Grade: no char and no lockout during the kill is Textbook.\"},{\"line_number\":268,\"content\":\"**Long Breath (Dr. Vale).** Needs 35. The world runs at .25 speed while the hands stay at full speed. Drains 16/s; press again to stop. Implement it with a world-time factor in the sim, **not** `game.timeScale`. The field shifts to the cold palette (the painter's `slow`), so glowing strains and dark blood stand out. Music thins, sound low-passes, the heartbeat dominates. Strains and hazards all pulse with outlines. This image is the game's signature: *Verified*, it reads beautifully in the prototype.\"},{\"line_number\":280,\"content\":\"When the last phase clears, the op doesn't just end. Quill: \\\"Dressing.\\\" A timing ring closes on the wound; press on the ring for a stamp, with a bonus for the timing. \\\"CASE CLOSED\\\" stamps across the screen, with `TIME OF COMPLETION 02:14`. Sound drops to one held chord. This is the reward beat. Land it.\"},{\"line_number\":308,\"content\":\"| Vitals critical | Monitor alarm | Vignette, number flashes | double thump per beat |\"},{\"line_number\":366,\"content\":\"| `bleeder` | Pinhole spurting on the beat | Cautery | .5 | Feeds a pool, 6 volume/s |\"},{\"line_number\":388,\"content\":\"### Staccato (Case 4 on)\"},{\"line_number\":389,\"content\":\"Swarm of beads hopping in bursts on a fixed beat, from hidden **nests**. A closing dotted ring shows each landing spot .5 s ahead. A landing bite leaves a `laceration`. Cautery kills a bead in .12 s. Find nests with Sonar; slash, then Forceps. When the last nest goes, the remaining beads die within 3 s. Sound: \\\"tk-tk-tk\\\" on the beat, so the rhythm is playable by ear.\"},{\"line_number\":399,\"content\":\"A shivering web around a coronary vessel on the beating heart, five **reeds** around a mass.\"},{\"line_number\":401,\"content\":\"- **Stage 1:** after each heartbeat's peak the reeds flare for .3 s. A targeted Syringe in that window sedates one (`amp` -.2). Outside the window it spits a small cut. The beat, the ECG and the flare sound are the telegraph, so this plays like a rhythm game.\"},{\"line_number\":406,\"content\":\"Three **lobes** on a glowing staff line with repeat signs. Each lobe's armor opens on its own timer: A every 6 s for 2.5 s, B every 7 s for 2.5 s, C every 9 s for 3 s. A: Cautery 1 s. B: slash, then Forceps. C: targeted Syringe, then Salve 1 s. The first kill starts a 10 s countdown. At 0 the dead lobes regrow, \\\"from the top\\\": vitals -8, a repeat sign flashes, and the staff plays its figure again. Round 2 runs at double speed and adds Staccato beads. Second Look's ghosts show when each lobe will open, so the winning move is to rewind once and plan the order. It can be beaten without rewinding, on skill.\"},{\"line_number\":418,\"content\":\"1. **Exposition.** It conducts: a baton tendril draws glowing arcs, and each beat a section sings: Staccato from one mouth, Legato slivers from another, bleeders along the vessels. Slash three baton tendrils at the pause of each arc. Then burn each mouth's uvula (Cautery 1.5 s).\"},{\"line_number\":419,\"content\":\"2. **Development.** The hush falls. **All sound cuts except the choir, and the monitor goes to static:** no number, no trace, no beep, for stretches of 15 s. Only Quill's readouts remain (\\\"Forty, Doctor.\\\"), plus the tissue's pulse. Fermata domes and Tremolo jitter combine. Find the voice box with Sonar and sedate it on beat windows, three times. This is the game's most memorable moment. Make it feel terrible and wonderful.\"},{\"line_number\":421,\"content\":\"4. **Coda: the Last Note.** One spiral guide, 200 u long, over the beating heart. Fine mode. The stroke can only advance between beats; moving on the beat is a slip. Then Forceps draws the Note out on a rising tone, up to a scream, then **total silence**. Hold it for three seconds. Then one beep. Then Quill: \\\"...Doctor.\\\" Six final stitches to a quiet piano figure, then the dressing.\"},{\"line_number\":464,\"content\":\"3. Staccato.\"},{\"line_number\":474,\"content\":\"**Case 6, Bedside Manner** (Vale, heart; 240, 60, .35). *New: the beating heart, timing to the beat, cursor tremor, first boss.* The patient is the Chief.\"},{\"line_number\":477,\"content\":\"3. Mend: a graft along the vessel, where stitches only land between beats. Salve.\"},{\"line_number\":624,\"content\":\"2. **Swarm:** Staccato, N nests, 4N beads at once.\"},{\"line_number\":675,\"content\":\"1. A story beat with portraits, auto-advanced.\"},{\"line_number\":678,\"content\":\"4. Case 6: Tremolo on the beating heart.\"},{\"line_number\":696,\"content\":\"| **Tuning** | Live sliders, grouped in pages. **Patient:** drain x, slip damage x, healing x, syringe dose, clock x. **Hands:** cursor speed, fine factor, stick curve, assist, magnet radius, grade tolerance x. **Strains:** speed x, health x, spawn rate x, damage x, Staccato beat. **Gift:** charge x, Long Breath drain, Long Breath time factor, Second Look seconds. **Fluids:** bleed x, suction rate, cautery heat. **Reset to defaults** per page and for everything. Values persist under a dev key in `E.store`; a default mark shows on each slider |\"},{\"line_number\":791,\"content\":\"| Heart (6, 11) | A big dome with fat streaks and coronary vessels (`artery`), high `pulse` so it visibly beats; ribs and steel spreader at the rim |\"},{\"line_number\":841,\"content\":\"**Field.** All procedural from state: heartbeat through the painter's `beat` (shape it with a sharp double pulse, and raise its rate as vitals fall), ventilator through `breath`, wound lips closing per stitch, pools creeping along the height field and toward a tilt, tissue flinching where a blade passes.\"},{\"line_number\":855,\"content\":\"One designed sound for everything in table 5.11. Build the long ones as node graphs: suction (filtered noise with rising bandpass), cautery (crackling high noise bursts), scalpel (band-limited hiss following speed), monitor beep (sine, rate and pitch by vitals), alarm, ventilator hiss in time with `breath`, heartbeat (two low sine thumps), defib whine, rain on windows and foghorn for the stages, ship's creak.\"},{\"line_number\":879,\"content\":\"HUSH's song uses the babble's formants on long vowels: three detuned saws, an \\\"ah to oo\\\" formant sweep, slow vibrato, a feedback delay of .31 s at .35. **Effects bus**, since gameplay depends on it. Each strain has a figure: Staccato, short three-note \\\"tk-la\\\" on the beat; Legato, one long slide; Tremolo, 9 Hz amplitude shake; Da Capo, four notes that restart; Fermata, one held note; Cantor, all of them as a slowly moving chord. Pan toward the source. Under Sonar, it swells with proximity.\"},{\"line_number\":1030,\"content\":\"| M5 | Staccato, Legato, Tremolo, ward, Cases 4 to 6, Chapter 2 | Chapter 2 plays through |\"},{\"line_number\":1095,\"content\":\"- `shade({ beat, breath, slow, lens, light, dim, spot })`: see its comment. `dyn` and `over` clear after each shade.\"},{\"line_number\":1135,\"content\":\"  // fx: { beat 0..1, breath px, slow: Long Breath palette, lens: {x, y, r} shows the cold palette inside (Sonar), light: [lx, ly], dim: 0..1 darkness, spot: {x, y, r} stays lit while dim }\"},{\"line_number\":1136,\"content\":\"  shade(fx = {}) { const { W, H, h, m, ao, pulse, dyn, over, u } = this, beat = fx.beat || 0, off = Math.round(fx.breath || 0) * W, slow = !!fx.slow, lens = fx.lens, lr2 = lens ? lens.r * lens.r : 0, dim = fx.dim || 0, spot = fx.spot, sr2 = spot ? spot.r * spot.r : 0, lx = fx.light ? fx.light[0] : -.42, ly = fx.light ? fx.light[1] : -.52, lz = Math.sqrt(Math.max(.1, 1 - lx * lx - ly * ly)), hl = Math.hypot(lx, ly, lz + 1), hx = lx / hl, hy = ly / hl, hz = (lz + 1) / hl;\"},{\"line_number\":1138,\"content\":\"      const j = Math.max(W + 1, Math.min(W * H - W - 2, i + off)), k = 1 + beat * pulse[j], dx = (h[j - 1] - h[j + 1]) * k * .5 + (dyn[i - 1] - dyn[i + 1]) * .5, dy = (h[j - W] - h[j + W]) * k * .5 + (dyn[i - W] - dyn[i + W]) * .5, nl = 1 / Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy + 1), nx = dx * nl, ny = dy * nl, nz = nl;\"},{\"line_number\":1140,\"content\":\"      const lit = dim && !(spot && (x - spot.x) ** 2 + (y - spot.y) ** 2 < sr2) ? 1 - dim : 1, lum = (diff * .92 + s8 * .16 * M.spec + beat * pulse[j] * .6) * (ov ? 1 : ao[j]) * lit, c = Math.max(0, Math.min(n - 1, (lum * (n - 1) + BAYER[(x & 3) | ((y & 3) << 2)] * 1.15 + .5) | 0));\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"d1b32c58-38ea-404e-ac58-c89b279131c0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_422","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js","offset":530,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/tests/run.mjs","offset":420,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function beginCase|phases|strain","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"staccato|kind: 'staccato'|spawnStrain","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7331,"output_tokens":564,"cache_read_input_tokens":66432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"7fee61be-582f-4be0-b692-252220b5ae15"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-18","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"530→        const on = !S.cheat[key];\\n        GAME.Dev.cheat(S, key, on);\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (RT.devTab === 2 && dir === 0) {\\n      const rows = devRows();\\n      const label = rows[RT.devI] || '';\\n      RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n540→      if (label === 'Grand Rounds') { beginCase('ferry', { players: 1, fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      if (label === 'Skills Lab') { beginCase('lab', { fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      const sp = label.indexOf(' ');\\n      const id = sp < 0 ? label : label.slice(0, sp);\\n      const def = GAME.CASES[id];\\n      if (!def) return;\\n      const name = sp < 0 ? '' : label.slice(sp + 1);\\n      let phase = 0;\\n      (def.phases || []).forEach((ph, i) => { if ((ph.name || String(i)) === name) phase = i; });\\n      beginCase(id, { phase, fromStory: false });\\n550→      go('op');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function handleDev() {\\n    if (!RT.devOpen || inSession) return false;\\n    const I = game.input;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    if (I.pressed('cancel')) { RT.devOpen = false; I.consumeAll(); return true; }\\n    if (I.pressed('toolPrev')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 2) % 3;\\n560→    if (I.pressed('toolNext')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 1) % 3;\\n    if (I.pressed('up')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + rows.length - 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (I.pressed('down')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (RT.devI >= rows.length) RT.devI = 0;\\n    if (I.pressed('left')) devAct(-1);\\n    if (I.pressed('right') || I.pressed('confirm')) devAct(I.pressed('confirm') ? 0 : 1);\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawDev(g, r) {\\n570→    const px = E.px;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    const tabs = ['Tune', 'Cheats', 'Jump'];\\n    px.rect(g, r.W - 168, 8, 160, r.H - 16, '#06141a');\\n    E.font.text(g, tabs[RT.devTab], r.W - 160, 12, '#f5b700', { outline: false });\\n    const first = Math.max(0, Math.min(RT.devI - 6, rows.length - 12));\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 12 && first + i < rows.length; i++) {\\n      const k = first + i;\\n      const on = k === RT.devI;\\n      E.font.text(g, (on ? '> ' : '  ') + rows[k], r.W - 160, 28 + i * 12, on ? '#5ff0e0' : '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n580→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawTitle(r, t) {\\n    r.sky(['#071018', '#0e2430']);\\n    r.overlay(g => {\\n      GAME.Art.titleBackdrop(g, r.W, r.H, t || game.real || 0);\\n      E.font.title(g, 'OPEN TABLE', r.W / 2, 28, { scale: 2, align: 'center', colors: ['#f4fff8', '#9aefe4', '#1c6e78'] });\\n      E.font.text(g, TITLE, r.W / 2, 78, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 1, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      E.font.text(g, \\\"Don't let it go quiet\\\", r.W / 2, 96, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', outline: false });\\n590→      const y = 120;\\n      let x = 24;\\n      const beat = [0, 2, 0, 6, 0, 2, 8, 0, 1, 0, 4, 0];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < beat.length; i++) {\\n        const h = 2 + beat[i];\\n        E.px.rect(g, x, y - h, 6, h, '#7CFFB2');\\n        x += 10;\\n      }\\n      const prompt = game.input.label('confirm');\\n      E.font.text(g, prompt, r.W / 2, r.H - 28, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n600→    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function snapshot() {\\n    const S = RT.S;\\n    const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n    let mark = null;\\n    if (RT.light && RT.light.mark) mark = [ox + RT.light.mark[0], oy + RT.light.mark[1]];\\n    const choice = !!(story.talk && story.talk.open && story.talk.choices && story.talk.choices.length && !story.talk.typing);\\n    return {\\n610→      scene: game.sceneName,\\n      menu: RT.menu ? { i: RT.menu.i, labels: RT.menu.items.map(it => (typeof it === 'string' ? it : it.label)) } : null,\\n      story: story.running ? story.node : null,\\n      held: !!story._held,\\n      choice,\\n      op: S ? {\\n        id: S.id, won: !!S.won, lost: !!S.lost, phase: S.phase, phaseName: S.phaseName,\\n        clock: S.clock, vitals: S.vitals, score: S.score, rank: S.rank,\\n        breath: !!S.breath, worldScale: S.worldScale, closed: !!S.closed,\\n      } : null,\",\"content_concise\":\"530→        const on = !S.cheat[key];\\n        GAME.Dev.cheat(S, key, on);\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (RT.devTab === 2 && dir === 0) {\\n      const rows = devRows();\\n      const label = rows[RT.devI] || '';\\n      RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n540→      if (label === 'Grand Rounds') { beginCase('ferry', { players: 1, fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      if (label === 'Skills Lab') { beginCase('lab', { fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      const sp = label.indexOf(' ');\\n      const id = sp < 0 ? label : label.slice(0, sp);\\n      const def = GAME.CASES[id];\\n      if (!def) return;\\n      const name = sp < 0 ? '' : label.slice(sp + 1);\\n      let phase = 0;\\n      (def.phases || []).forEach((ph, i) => { if ((ph.name || String(i)) === name) phase = i; });\\n      beginCase(id, { phase, fromStory: false });\\n550→      go('op');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function handleDev() {\\n    if (!RT.devOpen || inSession) return false;\\n    const I = game.input;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    if (I.pressed('cancel')) { RT.devOpen = false; I.consumeAll(); return true; }\\n    if (I.pressed('toolPrev')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 2) % 3;\\n560→    if (I.pressed('toolNext')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 1) % 3;\\n    if (I.pressed('up')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + rows.length - 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (I.pressed('down')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (RT.devI >= rows.length) RT.devI = 0;\\n    if (I.pressed('left')) devAct(-1);\\n    if (I.pressed('right') || I.pressed('confirm')) devAct(I.pressed('confirm') ? 0 : 1);\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawDev(g, r) {\\n570→    const px = E.px;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    const tabs = ['Tune', 'Cheats', 'Jump'];\\n    px.rect(g, r.W - 168, 8, 160, r.H - 16, '#06141a');\\n    E.font.text(g, tabs[RT.devTab], r.W - 160, 12, '#f5b700', { outline: false });\\n    const first = Math.max(0, Math.min(RT.devI - 6, rows.length - 12));\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 12 && first + i < rows.length; i++) {\\n      const k = first + i;\\n      const on = k === RT.devI;\\n      E.font.text(g, (on ? '> ' : '  ') + rows[k], r.W - 160, 28 + i * 12, on ? '#5ff0e0' : '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n580→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawTitle(r, t) {\\n    r.sky(['#071018', '#0e2430']);\\n    r.overlay(g => {\\n      GAME.Art.titleBackdrop(g, r.W, r.H, t || game.real || 0);\\n      E.font.title(g, 'OPEN TABLE', r.W / 2, 28, { scale: 2, align: 'center', colors: ['#f4fff8', '#9aefe4', '#1c6e78'] });\\n      E.font.text(g, TITLE, r.W / 2, 78, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 1, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      E.font.text(g, \\\"Don't let it go quiet\\\", r.W / 2, 96, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', outline: false });\\n590→      const y = 120;\\n      let x = 24;\\n      const beat = [0, 2, 0, 6, 0, 2, 8, 0, 1, 0, 4, 0];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < beat.length; i++) {\\n        const h = 2 + beat[i];\\n        E.px.rect(g, x, y - h, 6, h, '#7CFFB2');\\n        x += 10;\\n      }\\n      const prompt = game.input.label('confirm');\\n      E.font.text(g, prompt, r.W / 2, r.H - 28, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n600→    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function snapshot() {\\n    const S = RT.S;\\n    const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n    let mark = null;\\n    if (RT.light && RT.light.mark) mark = [ox + RT.light.mark[0], oy + RT.light.mark[1]];\\n    const choice = !!(story.talk && story.talk.open && story.talk.choices && story.talk.choices.length && !story.talk.typing);\\n    return {\\n610→      scene: game.sceneName,\\n      menu: RT.menu ? { i: RT.menu.i, labels: RT.menu.items.map(it => (typeof it === 'string' ? it : it.label)) } : null,\\n      story: story.running ? story.node : null,\\n      held: !!story._held,\\n      choice,\\n      op: S ? {\\n        id: S.id, won: !!S.won, lost: !!S.lost, phase: S.phase, phaseName: S.phaseName,\\n        clock: S.clock, vitals: S.vitals, score: S.score, rank: S.rank,\\n        breath: !!S.breath, worldScale: S.worldScale, closed: !!S.closed,\\n      } : null,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js\",\"offset\":530,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"        const on = !S.cheat[key];\\n        GAME.Dev.cheat(S, key, on);\\n        RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (RT.devTab === 2 && dir === 0) {\\n      const rows = devRows();\\n      const label = rows[RT.devI] || '';\\n      RT.cheatUsed = true;\\n      if (label === 'Grand Rounds') { beginCase('ferry', { players: 1, fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      if (label === 'Skills Lab') { beginCase('lab', { fromStory: false }); go('op'); return; }\\n      const sp = label.indexOf(' ');\\n      const id = sp < 0 ? label : label.slice(0, sp);\\n      const def = GAME.CASES[id];\\n      if (!def) return;\\n      const name = sp < 0 ? '' : label.slice(sp + 1);\\n      let phase = 0;\\n      (def.phases || []).forEach((ph, i) => { if ((ph.name || String(i)) === name) phase = i; });\\n      beginCase(id, { phase, fromStory: false });\\n      go('op');\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function handleDev() {\\n    if (!RT.devOpen || inSession) return false;\\n    const I = game.input;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    if (I.pressed('cancel')) { RT.devOpen = false; I.consumeAll(); return true; }\\n    if (I.pressed('toolPrev')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 2) % 3;\\n    if (I.pressed('toolNext')) RT.devTab = (RT.devTab + 1) % 3;\\n    if (I.pressed('up')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + rows.length - 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (I.pressed('down')) RT.devI = (RT.devI + 1) % rows.length;\\n    if (RT.devI >= rows.length) RT.devI = 0;\\n    if (I.pressed('left')) devAct(-1);\\n    if (I.pressed('right') || I.pressed('confirm')) devAct(I.pressed('confirm') ? 0 : 1);\\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawDev(g, r) {\\n    const px = E.px;\\n    const rows = devRows();\\n    const tabs = ['Tune', 'Cheats', 'Jump'];\\n    px.rect(g, r.W - 168, 8, 160, r.H - 16, '#06141a');\\n    E.font.text(g, tabs[RT.devTab], r.W - 160, 12, '#f5b700', { outline: false });\\n    const first = Math.max(0, Math.min(RT.devI - 6, rows.length - 12));\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 12 && first + i < rows.length; i++) {\\n      const k = first + i;\\n      const on = k === RT.devI;\\n      E.font.text(g, (on ? '> ' : '  ') + rows[k], r.W - 160, 28 + i * 12, on ? '#5ff0e0' : '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function drawTitle(r, t) {\\n    r.sky(['#071018', '#0e2430']);\\n    r.overlay(g => {\\n      GAME.Art.titleBackdrop(g, r.W, r.H, t || game.real || 0);\\n      E.font.title(g, 'OPEN TABLE', r.W / 2, 28, { scale: 2, align: 'center', colors: ['#f4fff8', '#9aefe4', '#1c6e78'] });\\n      E.font.text(g, TITLE, r.W / 2, 78, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 1, outline: '#06141a' });\\n      E.font.text(g, \\\"Don't let it go quiet\\\", r.W / 2, 96, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', outline: false });\\n      const y = 120;\\n      let x = 24;\\n      const beat = [0, 2, 0, 6, 0, 2, 8, 0, 1, 0, 4, 0];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < beat.length; i++) {\\n        const h = 2 + beat[i];\\n        E.px.rect(g, x, y - h, 6, h, '#7CFFB2');\\n        x += 10;\\n      }\\n      const prompt = game.input.label('confirm');\\n      E.font.text(g, prompt, r.W / 2, r.H - 28, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function snapshot() {\\n    const S = RT.S;\\n    const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n    let mark = null;\\n    if (RT.light && RT.light.mark) mark = [ox + RT.light.mark[0], oy + RT.light.mark[1]];\\n    const choice = !!(story.talk && story.talk.open && story.talk.choices && story.talk.choices.length && !story.talk.typing);\\n    return {\\n      scene: game.sceneName,\\n      menu: RT.menu ? { i: RT.menu.i, labels: RT.menu.items.map(it => (typeof it === 'string' ? it : it.label)) } : null,\\n      story: story.running ? story.node : null,\\n      held: !!story._held,\\n      choice,\\n      op: S ? {\\n        id: S.id, won: !!S.won, lost: !!S.lost, phase: S.phase, phaseName: S.phaseName,\\n        clock: S.clock, vitals: S.vitals, score: S.score, rank: S.rank,\\n        breath: !!S.breath, worldScale: S.worldScale, closed: !!S.closed,\\n      } : null,\\n\",\"total_lines\":1410}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-616aa318-65a6-4b3f-90ae-0c9982578b5f-19","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"420→    check('master', Math.abs(game.audio.volume - 0.7) < 0.001, String(game.audio.volume));\\n    check('title draws', !game.errors.length, JSON.stringify(game.errors));\\n    check('PlayStation prompt', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad') === 'R2', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad'));\\n    const devItem = (game.o.menu.items || []).find((it) => it && it[0] === 'Dev Mode');\\n    check('dev mode is on the pause menu', !!(devItem && typeof devItem[1] === 'function'));\\n\\n    const press = (action) => {\\n      game.input.tap(action);\\n      game.advance(game.o.step);\\n      game.advance(game.o.step);\\n430→    };\\n    const enter = () => { game.advance(game.o.step); game.advance(game.o.step); };\\n\\n    game.advance(10.2);\\n    check('attract starts after ten seconds', game.sceneName === 'attract', game.sceneName);\\n    press('confirm');\\n    check('attract returns to the title', game.sceneName === 'title' && !GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu, game.sceneName);\\n\\n    press('confirm');\\n    const labels = (GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu && GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu.labels) || [];\\n440→    check('menu rows', labels.join('|') === 'New Game|Case Files|Grand Rounds|Skills Lab|About', labels.join('|'));\\n    press('down');\\n    press('down');\\n    press('down');\\n    press('down');\\n    press('confirm');\\n    check('about opens', game.sceneName === 'about', game.sceneName);\\n    press('confirm');\\n    check('about advances', RT.creditPage === 1, String(RT.creditPage));\\n    press('cancel');\\n450→    check('about returns', game.sceneName === 'menu', game.sceneName);\\n    press('cancel');\\n\\n    game.go('chart', { caseId: 'c2' });\\n    enter();\\n    const mark = GAME.Shell.snapshot().lightbox;\\n    check('lightbox mark is on the film', mark && Math.abs(mark[0] - 248) <= 1 && Math.abs(mark[1] - 96) <= 1, JSON.stringify(mark));\\n    game.input.feed('move', mark[0], mark[1]);\\n    game.input.feed('down', mark[0], mark[1]);\\n    game.input.feed('up', mark[0], mark[1]);\\n460→    enter();\\n    check('a right chart opens the case', game.sceneName === 'op' && RT.S && RT.S.id === 'c2' && RT.S.clock >= 250, game.sceneName + ' ' + (RT.S && RT.S.clock));\\n\\n    GAME.Dev.reset();\\n    RT.cheatUsed = false;\\n    GAME.Shell.beginCase('c1', { seed: 1 });\\n    game.go('op');\\n    enter();\\n    GAME.openDev();\\n    check('dev panel opens', GAME.Shell.snapshot().dev.open);\\n470→    const drain0 = GAME.TUNE.patient.drain;\\n    game.input.tap('right');\\n    game.advance(game.o.step);\\n    check('a slider dirties tuning', GAME.TUNE.dirty && GAME.TUNE.patient.drain !== drain0, String(GAME.TUNE.patient.drain));\\n    check('tuning is not a cheat flag', RT.cheatUsed === false);\\n    const mid = GAME.TUNE.patient.drain;\\n    game.input.tap('confirm');\\n    game.advance(game.o.step);\\n    check('confirm does not move a slider', GAME.TUNE.patient.drain === mid, String(GAME.TUNE.patient.drain));\\n    GAME.Dev.reset();\\n480→    check('reset restores the documented defaults', !GAME.TUNE.dirty && GAME.TUNE.patient.drain === 1 && GAME.TUNE.hands.cursor === 330);\\n    const dirtyBefore = GAME.TUNE.dirty;\\n    game.settings.set('assist', 0.4);\\n    game.settings.set('cursorSpeed', 200);\\n    check('assist and cursor prefs stay clean', GAME.TUNE.dirty === dirtyBefore && GAME.PREFS.assist === 0.4 && GAME.PREFS.cursor === 200);\\n    game.settings.set('assist', 0.6);\\n    game.settings.set('cursorSpeed', 330);\\n    game.settings.set('glyphs', 'xbox');\\n    check('Xbox prompt', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad') === 'RT', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad'));\\n    game.settings.set('glyphs', 'playstation');\\n490→    check('keyboard prompt', game.input.label('useTool', 'keyboard') === 'Space', game.input.label('useTool', 'keyboard'));\\n    game.input.tap('cancel');\\n    game.advance(game.o.step);\\n    check('dev closes', !RT.devOpen);\\n\\n    const A = GAME.ABOUT;\\n    check('usage line', A.sourceInformation.usage === 'added on import');\\n    check('feedback lengths', A.testingFeedback.length === 4 && A.engineFeedback.length === 6 && A.promptFeedback.length === 4);\\n    check('about name', A.aiHub.name === 'Open Table Second Opinion');\\n    check('no empty about lines', GAME.About.ORDER.every((k) => String(A.sourceInformation[k]).length > 0));\\n500→\\n    game.go('title');\\n    enter();\\n    game.debug.skipStory = true;\\n    game.debug.driver = () => {\\n      const S = RT.S;\\n      if (!S) return { aim: [0, 0], trig: 0 };\\n      return GAME.Bot.device(S, 0, 1 / 45);\\n    };\\n    RT.ranks = {};\\n510→    RT.cheatUsed = false;\\n    GAME.Dev.reset();\\n    game.input.feed('move', 1, 1);\\n    press('confirm');\\n    press('confirm');\\n    check('new game reaches difficulty', game.sceneName === 'difficulty', game.sceneName);\\n    const diff = GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu;\\n    check('intern is first', diff && diff.labels[0] === 'Intern' && diff.i === 0, JSON.stringify(diff));\\n    press('down');\\n    check('one down is resident', GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu.i === 1 && GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu.labels[1] === 'Resident');\\n520→    press('confirm');\\n    let guard = 0;\\n    while (game.sceneName !== 'title' && guard < 160) {\\n      const sn = GAME.Shell.snapshot();\\n      const key = game.sceneName;\\n      if (key === 'story' && sn.choice) press('confirm');\\n      else if (key === 'story') game.advance(0.25);\\n      else if (key === 'chart') {\\n        const m = sn.lightbox || [248, 96];\\n        game.input.feed('move', m[0], m[1]);\\n530→        game.input.feed('down', m[0], m[1]);\\n        game.input.feed('up', m[0], m[1]);\\n        enter();\\n      } else if (key === 'op') game.advance(0.4);\\n      else if (key === 'results' || key === 'ward' || key === 'credits' || key === 'menu' || key === 'difficulty') press('confirm');\\n      else game.advance(0.2);\\n      guard += 1;\\n    }\\n    game.debug.driver = null;\\n    game.debug.skipStory = false;\\n540→    const ranks = GAME.Shell.snapshot().ranks;\\n    check('a new game returns to the title', game.sceneName === 'title', game.sceneName + ' guard ' + guard);\\n    check('every case ranks S', GAME.ORDER.every((id) => ranks[id] === 'S'), JSON.stringify(ranks));\\n    check('the run draws clean', !game.errors.length, JSON.stringify(game.errors).slice(0, 400));\\n  });\\n\\n  const finish = () => {\\n    for (const line of fails) console.log(line);\\n    console.log(n + ' checks, ' + fails.length + ' failed');\\n    process.exit(fails.length ? 1 : 0);\\n550→  };\\n\\n  if (fast) finish();\\n  else {\\n    runLive().then(() => finish()).catch((e) => {\\n      n += 1;\\n      fails.push('FAIL live: ' + (e && e.stack ? e.stack : e));\\n      finish();\\n    });\\n  }\\n560→\\n  async function runLive() {\\n    const htmlName = GAME.CFG.FILE + '.html';\\n    const htmlPath = path.join(work, htmlName);\\n    check('page is handed in', fs.existsSync(htmlPath), htmlName);\\n    if (!fs.existsSync(htmlPath)) return;\\n    const { chromium, firefox, webkit } = await import('playwright');\\n    const fileUrl = 'file://' + htmlPath;\\n    const scratch = process.env.OT_SCRATCH || path.resolve(work, '..', 'tmp', 'grok-goal-08d1b960e391', 'implementer');\\n    fs.mkdirSync(scratch, { recursive: true });\\n570→    const browserLog = [];\\n    const note = (s) => browserLog.push(s);\\n\\n    async function launchOnce(tag) {\\n      const browser = await chromium.launch({ args: ['--autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required'] });\\n      const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 1920, height: 1080 }, deviceScaleFactor: 1 });\\n      const errors = [];\\n      page.on('pageerror', (e) => errors.push(String(e)));\\n      page.on('console', (msg) => { if (msg.type() === 'error') errors.push(msg.text()); });\\n      await page.goto(fileUrl);\",\"content_concise\":\"420→    check('master', Math.abs(game.audio.volume - 0.7) < 0.001, String(game.audio.volume));\\n    check('title draws', !game.errors.length, JSON.stringify(game.errors));\\n    check('PlayStation prompt', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad') === 'R2', game.input.label('useTool', 'gamepad'));\\n    const devItem = (game.o.menu.items || []).find((it) => it && it[0] === 'Dev Mode');\\n    check('dev mode is on the pause menu', !!(devItem && typeof devItem[1] === 'function'));\\n\\n    const press = (action) => {\\n      game.input.tap(action);\\n      game.advance(game.o.step);\\n      game.advance(game.o.step);\\n430→    };\\n    const enter = () => { game.advance(game.o.step); game.advance(game.o.step); };\\n\\n    game.advance(10.2);\\n    check('attract starts after ten seconds', game.sceneName === 'attract', game.sceneName);\\n    press('confirm');\\n    check('attract returns to the title', game.sceneName === 'title' && !GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu, game.sceneName);\\n\\n    press('confirm');\\n    const labels = (GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu && GAME.Shell.snapshot().menu.labels) || [];\\n440→    check('menu rows', labels.join('|') === 'New Game|Cas