{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_430","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The playTune path is used by drive(), which runs during the op scene update.\n\nA test will verify that dev cursor overrides PREFS. It will set a custom driver, configure cursor values via Dev.set, place the player at x=16, and measure travel distance. The existing shell test already manages driver setup and cleanup.\n\nDriver aim still works when devOpen is active because it bypasses readLocal. TUNE.dirty from Dev.set will be reset after the test to avoid polluting the playthrough. The test plan sets cursorSpeed to 200 and assist to 0.2, begins case c1 with seed 1, enters the op scene, and grabs the first player.\n\nThe test places the player at x=16, y=120 with zero speed. It sets hands.cursor to 480 and a driver returning aim [1, 0]. After advancing half a second it records the fast travel distance. It then resets the dev state and runs a prefs-only case from the same starting position to record the slow travel distance. The check asserts that the dev cursor run is at least 1.5 times faster than the preference run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c16e429b-4fc6-4f03-9090-df25c3c049ec-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js","offset":1000,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1988,"output_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":99072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"ce0f0e13-ce64-4576-82d6-14514f9902fc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c16e429b-4fc6-4f03-9090-df25c3c049ec-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1000→          RT.miss += 1;\\n          if (RT.miss >= 3) {\\n            RT.chartFor = RT.chartCase;\\n            const S = beginCase(RT.chartCase, { fromStory: true, seed: 3 });\\n            if (S) S.clock -= 10 * RT.miss;\\n            go('op');\\n          }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) {\\n1010→        r.sky(['#0c1418', '#183028']);\\n        r.overlay(g => {\\n          GAME.Art.stage(g, 'office', r.W, r.H, 0);\\n          const light = RT.light;\\n          E.font.text(g, 'SECOND OPINION', r.W / 2, 12, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n          if (!light) return;\\n          const text = light.text || '';\\n          E.font.text(g, text, r.W / 2, 36, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', outline: '#06141a', wrap: r.W - 40 });\\n          const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n          const mx = ox + light.mark[0], my = oy + light.mark[1];\\n1020→          E.px.rect(g, mx - 6, my - 1, 12, 2, '#f5b700');\\n          E.px.rect(g, mx - 1, my - 6, 2, 12, '#f5b700');\\n          E.font.text(g, 'Misses ' + RT.miss, 8, r.H - 16, '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n        });\\n      },\\n    },\\n    op: {\\n      view: 'overhead', camera: CAM, pausable: true,\\n      enter() { game.setView('overhead'); },\\n      update(dt) {\\n1030→        const S = RT.S;\\n        if (!S) { go('menu'); return; }\\n        handleDev();\\n        game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0);\\n        const fast = game.debug && game.debug.driver && !RT.attract;\\n        if (fast) {\\n          for (let k = 0; k < 16; k++) drive(S, 1 / 45);\\n        } else drive(S, dt);\\n        const mv = game.input.padMove || [0, 0];\\n        if (Math.hypot(mv[0] || 0, mv[1] || 0) > 0.6 || game.input.down('wheelHold')) RT.wheelShow = 0.35;\\n1040→        else RT.wheelShow = Math.max(0, (RT.wheelShow || 0) - dt);\\n        if ((S.won || S.lost) && !RT.leftOp) {\\n          RT.leftOp = true;\\n          if (!RT.attract) go('results');\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) { game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0); drawOp(r, RT.S, false); },\\n    },\\n    results: {\\n      view: 'side', camera: CAM,\\n1050→      enter() {\\n        recordRank();\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        const items = S && S.lost ? ['Retry', 'Give up'] : ['Continue'];\\n        RT.menu = makeMenu(items, (i, label) => {\\n          if (label === 'Retry' && RT.S) {\\n            GAME.Op.retryPhase(RT.S);\\n            RT.leftOp = false;\\n            go('op');\\n            return;\\n1060→          }\\n          leaveResults();\\n        });\\n      },\\n      update() { if (RT.menu) RT.menu.update(); },\\n      draw(r) {\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        r.sky(['#071018', '#102028']);\\n        r.overlay(g => {\\n          GAME.Art.stage(g, 'theatre', r.W, r.H, 0);\\n1070→          const head = S && S.won ? 'CLOSED' : 'LOST';\\n          E.font.text(g, head, r.W / 2, 16, S && S.won ? '#5ff0e0' : '#ff7a6a', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n          if (S) {\\n            const tag = (GAME.TUNE.dirty || RT.cheatUsed) ? 'DEV' : (S.rank || '');\\n            E.font.text(g, tag + '   ' + Math.round(S.score || 0), r.W / 2, 42, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n            E.font.text(g, 'Vitals ' + Math.round(S.vitals) + '   Clock ' + Math.round(S.clock), r.W / 2, 66, '#8fb8b0', { align: 'center', outline: false });\\n          }\\n        });\\n        if (RT.menu) RT.menu.draw(r);\\n      },\",\"content_concise\":\"1000→          RT.miss += 1;\\n          if (RT.miss >= 3) {\\n            RT.chartFor = RT.chartCase;\\n            const S = beginCase(RT.chartCase, { fromStory: true, seed: 3 });\\n            if (S) S.clock -= 10 * RT.miss;\\n            go('op');\\n          }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) {\\n1010→        r.sky(['#0c1418', '#183028']);\\n        r.overlay(g => {\\n          GAME.Art.stage(g, 'office', r.W, r.H, 0);\\n          const light = RT.light;\\n          E.font.text(g, 'SECOND OPINION', r.W / 2, 12, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n          if (!light) return;\\n          const text = light.text || '';\\n          E.font.text(g, text, r.W / 2, 36, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', outline: '#06141a', wrap: r.W - 40 });\\n          const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n          const mx = ox + light.mark[0], my = oy + light.mark[1];\\n1020→          E.px.rect(g, mx - 6, my - 1, 12, 2, '#f5b700');\\n          E.px.rect(g, mx - 1, my - 6, 2, 12, '#f5b700');\\n          E.font.text(g, 'Misses ' + RT.miss, 8, r.H - 16, '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n        });\\n      },\\n    },\\n    op: {\\n      view: 'overhead', camera: CAM, pausable: true,\\n      enter() { game.setView('overhead'); },\\n      update(dt) {\\n1030→        const S = RT.S;\\n        if (!S) { go('menu'); return; }\\n        handleDev();\\n        game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0);\\n        const fast = game.debug && game.debug.driver && !RT.attract;\\n        if (fast) {\\n          for (let k = 0; k < 16; k++) drive(S, 1 / 45);\\n        } else drive(S, dt);\\n        const mv = game.input.padMove || [0, 0];\\n        if (Math.hypot(mv[0] || 0, mv[1] || 0) > 0.6 || game.input.down('wheelHold')) RT.wheelShow = 0.35;\\n1040→        else RT.wheelShow = Math.max(0, (RT.wheelShow || 0) - dt);\\n        if ((S.won || S.lost) && !RT.leftOp) {\\n          RT.leftOp = true;\\n          if (!RT.attract) go('results');\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) { game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0); drawOp(r, RT.S, false); },\\n    },\\n    results: {\\n      view: 'side', camera: CAM,\\n1050→      enter() {\\n        recordRank();\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        const items = S && S.lost ? ['Retry', 'Give up'] : ['Continue'];\\n        RT.menu = makeMenu(items, (i, label) => {\\n          if (label === 'Retry' && RT.S) {\\n            GAME.Op.retryPhase(RT.S);\\n            RT.leftOp = false;\\n            go('op');\\n            return;\\n1060→          }\\n          leaveResults();\\n        });\\n      },\\n      update() { if (RT.menu) RT.menu.update(); },\\n      draw(r) {\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        r.sky(['#071018', '#102028']);\\n        r.overlay(g => {\\n          GAME.Art.stage(g, 'theatre', r.W, r.H, 0);\\n1070→          const head = S && S.won ? 'CLOSED' : 'LOST';\\n          E.font.text(g, head, r.W / 2, 16, S && S.won ? '#5ff0e0' : '#ff7a6a', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n          if (S) {\\n            const tag = (GAME.TUNE.dirty || RT.cheatUsed) ? 'DEV' : (S.rank || '');\\n            E.font.text(g, tag + '   ' + Math.round(S.score || 0), r.W / 2, 42, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n            E.font.text(g, 'Vitals ' + Math.round(S.vitals) + '   Clock ' + Math.round(S.clock), r.W / 2, 66, '#8fb8b0', { align: 'center', outline: false });\\n          }\\n        });\\n        if (RT.menu) RT.menu.draw(r);\\n      },\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js\",\"offset\":1000,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"          RT.miss += 1;\\n          if (RT.miss >= 3) {\\n            RT.chartFor = RT.chartCase;\\n            const S = beginCase(RT.chartCase, { fromStory: true, seed: 3 });\\n            if (S) S.clock -= 10 * RT.miss;\\n            go('op');\\n          }\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) {\\n        r.sky(['#0c1418', '#183028']);\\n        r.overlay(g => {\\n          GAME.Art.stage(g, 'office', r.W, r.H, 0);\\n          const light = RT.light;\\n          E.font.text(g, 'SECOND OPINION', r.W / 2, 12, '#5ff0e0', { align: 'center', scale: 2, outline: '#06141a' });\\n          if (!light) return;\\n          const text = light.text || '';\\n          E.font.text(g, text, r.W / 2, 36, '#e8fbf6', { align: 'center', outline: '#06141a', wrap: r.W - 40 });\\n          const [ox, oy] = origin();\\n          const mx = ox + light.mark[0], my = oy + light.mark[1];\\n          E.px.rect(g, mx - 6, my - 1, 12, 2, '#f5b700');\\n          E.px.rect(g, mx - 1, my - 6, 2, 12, '#f5b700');\\n          E.font.text(g, 'Misses ' + RT.miss, 8, r.H - 16, '#8fb8b0', { outline: false });\\n        });\\n      },\\n    },\\n    op: {\\n      view: 'overhead', camera: CAM, pausable: true,\\n      enter() { game.setView('overhead'); },\\n      update(dt) {\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        if (!S) { go('menu'); return; }\\n        handleDev();\\n        game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0);\\n        const fast = game.debug && game.debug.driver && !RT.attract;\\n        if (fast) {\\n          for (let k = 0; k < 16; k++) drive(S, 1 / 45);\\n        } else drive(S, dt);\\n        const mv = game.input.padMove || [0, 0];\\n        if (Math.hypot(mv[0] || 0, mv[1] || 0) > 0.6 || game.input.down('wheelHold')) RT.wheelShow = 0.35;\\n        else RT.wheelShow = Math.max(0, (RT.wheelShow || 0) - dt);\\n        if ((S.won || S.lost) && !RT.leftOp) {\\n          RT.leftOp = true;\\n          if (!RT.attract) go('results');\\n        }\\n      },\\n      draw(r) { game.focus(game.W / 2, game.H / 2, 0); drawOp(r, RT.S, false); },\\n    },\\n    results: {\\n      view: 'side', camera: CAM,\\n      enter() {\\n        recordRank();\\n        const S = RT.S;\\n        const items = S && S.lost ? ['Retry', 'Give up'] : ['Continue'];\\n        RT.menu = makeMenu(items, (i, label) => {\\n          if (label === 'Retry' && RT.S) {\\n            GAME.Op.retryPhase(RT.S);\\n            RT.leftOp = false;\\n            go('op');\\n            return;\\n          }\\n          leaveResults();\\n        });\\n      },\\n      update() { if (RT.menu) RT.menu.update