{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_434","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Setting IV to needIv when clearing will ensure IV phases finish.\n\nThe test will drive the dev menu to the Clear phase and confirm it wins. Need to verify that pressed() works with tap and advance.\n\nOne advance is enough for the dev menu press to register. The clear phase finishes objects and strain before drive() steps the simulation, so the phase advances in the same frame.\n\nAfter clearing, the phase advances to Repair. Done objects and strain prevent stepStrain from running. Bleeders that are already done will not spawn because stepWorld runs before phaseClear.\n\nStaccato nests are already done. Setting objects to alive false and done is safe. The staccato phase may have no scripts. The cheatUsed flag must be reset after the test so it does not leak into rank saves. Confirming from the dev panel only triggers the action when the confirm button is pressed. toolNext switches tabs before readLocal can interpret it as a digit.\n\nThe dev menu is a custom overlay, not the engine menu, so it will not conflict with other menus. The down key press registers for both the dev menu and the scene because devOpen zeros keys and nudge while the menu is open.\n\nTapping confirm might also trigger useTool if the tap maps to Space or Enter. That could start a tool action in the same frame as the clear phase, but the phase should still advance because objects are marked done first.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f974b25-ef51-4aa6-a835-c8fde1e7a529-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tap\\(action|tap\\(name|pressed\\(action","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f974b25-ef51-4aa6-a835-c8fde1e7a529-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","offset":980,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1989,"output_tokens":1171,"cache_read_input_tokens":111744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"116103b2-6a9d-4e50-8a08-1c7e8130e145"}
