{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_450","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found: speedOf, pullOf, and ghost tests run after the about checks, but the shell group starts on the title and performs heavy navigation.\n\nThe shell group's enter() advances twice. The first advance runs with a null driver, so the cursor does not fly. The second advance uses the real driver and sets the position correctly.\n\npullOf advances once after go. The driver is set so the update uses fast 16 steps. Position is set before go.\n\nThe clear phase runs two advances before opening dev. Phase should remain 1. The c4 staccato check expects phase 1.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-16d788a7-1fdd-44db-811d-9eb444cc14b5-81","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1095,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-16d788a7-1fdd-44db-811d-9eb444cc14b5-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4353,"output_tokens":591,"cache_read_input_tokens":156032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"96cc1feb-72b5-4aa4-a5a3-a8a332048546"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-16d788a7-1fdd-44db-811d-9eb444cc14b5-81","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1095→  }\\n\\n  function stepFermata(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    for (const d of st.domes) if (d.t > 0) d.t -= dt;\\n1100→    st.domes = st.domes.filter(d => d.t > 0);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && st.domes.length === 0 && !(st.eyeOpen > 0)) {\\n      st.eyeOpen = S.breath ? 2.8 : 0.7;\\n      st.eye.open = true;\\n      const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n      if (o) o.open = true;\\n    }\\n    if (st.eyeOpen > 0) {\\n      st.eyeOpen -= dt;\\n      if (st.eyeOpen <= 0) {\\n1110→        st.eye.open = false;\\n        const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n        if (o && !o.done) o.open = false;\\n        if (st.hits < 3 && st.stage === 1) {\\n          /* raise another dome */\\n          if (st.domes.length < 3) st.domes.push({ x: st.eye.x, y: st.eye.y, r: 34, t: 5 });\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const eye = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\",\"content_concise\":\"1095→  }\\n\\n  function stepFermata(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    for (const d of st.domes) if (d.t > 0) d.t -= dt;\\n1100→    st.domes = st.domes.filter(d => d.t > 0);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && st.domes.length === 0 && !(st.eyeOpen > 0)) {\\n      st.eyeOpen = S.breath ? 2.8 : 0.7;\\n      st.eye.open = true;\\n      const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n      if (o) o.open = true;\\n    }\\n    if (st.eyeOpen > 0) {\\n      st.eyeOpen -= dt;\\n      if (st.eyeOpen <= 0) {\\n1110→        st.eye.open = false;\\n        const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n        if (o && !o.done) o.open = false;\\n        if (st.hits < 3 && st.stage === 1) {\\n          /* raise another dome */\\n          if (st.domes.length < 3) st.domes.push({ x: st.eye.x, y: st.eye.y, r: 34, t: 5 });\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const eye = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js\",\"offset\":1095,\"limit\":25,\"raw_output\":\"  }\\n\\n  function stepFermata(S, st, dt, tune) {\\n    st.t += dt;\\n    for (const d of st.domes) if (d.t > 0) d.t -= dt;\\n    st.domes = st.domes.filter(d => d.t > 0);\\n    if (st.stage === 1 && st.domes.length === 0 && !(st.eyeOpen > 0)) {\\n      st.eyeOpen = S.breath ? 2.8 : 0.7;\\n      st.eye.open = true;\\n      const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n      if (o) o.open = true;\\n    }\\n    if (st.eyeOpen > 0) {\\n      st.eyeOpen -= dt;\\n      if (st.eyeOpen <= 0) {\\n        st.eye.open = false;\\n        const o = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n        if (o && !o.done) o.open = false;\\n        if (st.hits < 3 && st.stage === 1) {\\n          /* raise another dome */\\n          if (st.domes.length < 3) st.domes.push({ x: st.eye.x, y: st.eye.y, r: 34, t: 5 });\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const eye = objById(S, st.eye.oid);\\n\",\"total_lines\":1782}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-16d788a7-1fdd-44db-811d-9eb444cc14b5-82","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,57,49,54,95,95,120,52,56,56,101,98,57,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"3cb5480f-b875-40ea-a4c9-7ee7fd0