{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_455","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The clear phase did not advance. It remained at 1 Staccato.\n\nPossible causes for the stuck Clear phase are being investigated. These include the dev menu not landing on the correct phase, the cheat failing to fire, or the confirm action being consumed by another handler.\n\nInput tests confirm the controls work. The investigation is now focused on handleDev and the operation update order.\n\nThe `rows` variable is captured at the start of `handleDev`, but this is harmless because the tab switches before the down presses. The confirm action triggers `devAct(0)`, which runs the win cheat. The investigation is now turning to `phaseClear` and its conditions, starting with `strain.done`.\n\nThe `needIv` flag is ruled out. Neither the c4 nor the staccato phase sets it, so flags do not persist from previous phases. The `hold` flag is also confirmed false. The investigation is now moving to `advancePhase` and how it retrieves the case definition.\n\nThe case definition confirms phase 2 should load. The stuck phase means the cheat never fired, phaseClear returned false, hold was still true, or the advance was skipped. The confirm action should trigger drive immediately after handleDev.\n\nThe game may be paused. If paused, the engine skips scene updates entirely and handleDev never runs. openDev does not pause the game. The pause likely came from an earlier input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9254d38a-9dec-4d1e-89a5-82ddacc009fc-89","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"paused &&|this\\.paused","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9254d38a-9dec-4d1e-89a5-82ddacc009fc-90","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js","offset":2918,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":302,"output_tokens":1215,"cache_read_input_tokens":163456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"2626d87e-9b70-43e0-a202-831dfe96f727"}
