{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_469","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Build succeeded. Observations will be appended to tests.log or handoff.log.\n\ntests.log must remain one line for step 1. Audio observations go to handoff.log. I will let the full suite run and check if it records RMS audio itself. If not, I will append a note to handoff.log.\n\nRunning the full suite now with PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE exported. The timeout is set to six minutes. The debug script will be deleted after the run.\n\nThe fast suite passed the clear phase logic. The debug script is being deleted now. The old tests.log will be overwritten by the full run. I will grep the HTML in parallel to verify the ghost color, playTune fix, and banned words. The exit-interview file was not changed directly.\n\nI will check handoff.log for the append format. I am preparing deviation text in case the full suite needs it, but I will only update deviations after the run passes and only when observations confirm a change. Existing shots do not need regeneration because ghost drawing is already tested by the suite.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d887ef3a-e34a-4d38-a516-4de1620ce5fd-107","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916 && PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 node tests/run.mjs > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/tests.log; echo $? > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/tests.exit","description":"Run the full shipped-game test suite","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d887ef3a-e34a-4d38-a516-4de1620ce5fd-108","name":"grep","input":{"pattern