{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_484","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tests load source files via vm, not the bundled HTML.\n\nThe root HTML and game.html share identical line numbers for key functions. Tests load src/*.js files rather than the bundled HTML.\n\nI will diff the inlined HTML source against the shipped src files to confirm exact function parity. I also need to audit the test assertions for honesty and hunt for real bugs in the new code.\n\nChecking the `playTune` cursor equality logic. The default cursor of 330 may not align with the slider's step size, which could cause floating-point mismatches when comparing against `def.cursor`.\n\nThe slider step size is 21, so the default cursor of 330 can be reached exactly by stepping up and down. This rules out a floating-point mismatch in `playTune`.\n\nNow investigating the ghost paint feature. It renders recorded samples as static discs while ghostT is active. I need to verify that `secondLook` actually records cursor positions into ghosts, and that `drawOp` paints them during the operation scene step rather than only when the document exists.\n\nThe ghost paint overlay runs unconditionally after the shade layer. The test passed and the spy caught the ghost color, confirming drawOp executed and painted the static discs.\n\nI am now inspecting the strain beat and spawn functions to confirm they are real. The clear phase test passed, so phaseClear advanced to Repair. I need to check whether other gates block this transition and if the clear logic handles every strain type.\n\nI need to read phaseClear fully to see if other live conditions block the clear phase transition. I will also hunt for real defects in the ghost recording logic that tests might paper over, and check whether any PLAN criteria are newly broken.\n\nChecking whether ghost coordinates are stored in field space or screen space. If ghosts already include the overlay offset, the paint logic would double-apply it and misplace the afterimage. The tests only verify color, not position, so this offset bug could remain hidden.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba261b7-215d-4542-bfcd-51fcdc0ab951-9","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function secondLook|ghosts|ghostT|function phaseClear|function takeCore|hashCore","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba261b7-215d-4542-bfcd-51fcdc0ab951-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":280,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba261b7-215d-4542-bfcd-51fcdc0ab951-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1260,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ba261b7-215d-4542-bfcd-51fcdc0ab951-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/tests/run.mjs","offset":120,"limit":280}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5937,"output_tokens":1514,"cache_read_input_tokens":38528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"a7997fff-d7e0-4e70-8216-5af1dff2dd90"}
