{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_500","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nBeads are skipped in the object loop but staccato checks still run on live beads. The cheat marks all objects done, so phaseClear should pass for other strains too. S.hold is set to false, which may allow advancePhase.Checking a potential bug in the clear phase test and the ghost drawing test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28e9c62c-9b01-4910-a889-feb51ffa5a99-14","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"cursor|assist|beat|spawn|Clear phase|phaseClear|dev slider|hands\\.cursor|strains\\.beat|strains\\.spawn|guide","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/tests/run.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28e9c62c-9b01-4910-a889-feb51ffa5a99-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":980,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28e9c62c-9b01-4910-a889-feb51ffa5a99-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1580,"limit":220}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4082,"output_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":38400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"3c951c5e-e147-4adb-9200-5f4bad78420f"}
