{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_502","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe ghost drawing test is a valid observation of the real draw path if game.advance triggers the draw overlay. It detects the #67d6ff color used for ghosts, which is honest and would fail if ghosts were not actually painted. The dev cursor test sets hands.cursor to 480 via speedOf, then advances one step with aim [1,0] through the debug driver.Verifying prior fixes and hunting for real demonstrable defects.\n\nThe dev cursor test passed, confirming the speedOf override works. Assist tests are similar.\n\nBeat and spawn tests step the simulation with different beat values and observe landing time, flare window, spawn count, and reed wait.\n\nCautery lock now requires a lock event and a slip event with e[1] === 'lock', rather than any slips.\n\nI need to verify that stepCautery emits the lock and slip events required for the cautery\n\nChecking if game.advance lock mechanic. I also need to confirm the actually calls drawOp. HTML bundle includes The second-look ghost these fixes, since  test may be failingthe hand-in is an HTML because the draw step file. If tests import from src/ but the shipped is not triggered. page is stale, the fixes would not be present in the delivered build.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The suite log is clean. I'll check the bundled page actually contains these fixes, and that the clear-phase and ghost paths aren't just test theater."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe ghost decay logic may be double-stepped. The test calls `secondLook` and then `game.advance`, but the game loop's step function might also step the operation via `GAME.Op.step`. This would decrement `ghostT` twice per frame without clearing ghosts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71c7ab5a-e5ea-45ad-bcbe-0029b710c1a4-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"dev slider that has left|67d6ff|strainBeat|Clear phase finishes|stand-in token","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71c7ab5a-e5ea-45ad-bcbe-0029b710c1a4-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":720,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71c7ab5a-e5ea-45ad-bcbe-0029b710c1a4-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1600,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71c7ab5a-e5ea-45ad-bcbe-0029b710c1a4-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/handoff.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71c7ab5a-e5ea-45ad-bcbe-0029b710c1a4-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/tmp/grok-goal-08d1b960e391/implementer/tests-fast.log","limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8379,"output_tokens":1475,"cache_read_input_tokens":50944,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"8c36ba39-3401-487a-875f-b03a7a34f36a"}
