{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_510","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" the ghost drawing.\n\nTests load source scripts rather than the bundle. I need to verify the bundle contains the playTune fix and clear phase and beat/spawn fixes too. The duplicate FORCE_COLOR deletion in the test parent process is harmless. I am now examining stepCautery and whether clear phase fails for strains with recreated objects.\n\nThe test passed, confirmingChecking the op update path around line 1116 c4 works. I will grep to verify whether clear phase steps the simulation the HTML for the playTune in the same frame as the cheat. Also investigating a potential bug where handleDev returns true comment and strain.done and skips the step. assignments to verify the other fixes are present. I also need to spot-check launch.log exists and shows success, since verification step 2 gates on it.\n\nConfirmed `polyDist` returns `.tan`, so the guide test passes. The suspected bug is that `handleDev` returning true before the op step applies the cheat but defers phase advancement to the next frame. The test only presses confirm once, so it only succeeds if that single press both applies the cheat and steps the op.\n\nThe test passed, so the suspected early-return bug is likely not the cause. I will check the log timestamps to verify whether the evidence is current or stale.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-49abd633-ca75-425d-bc8e-9af12d8bedfc-24","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function cloneTune|cloneTune\\s*[:=]|function clone\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-49abd633-ca75-425d-bc8e-9af12d8bedfc-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Ta