{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_516","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" done. The clear-phase test sequence is being re-examined for a missed bug.\n\nThe clear-phase test sequence is being re-examined for a missed bug.A potential bug was found in `handleDev`.\n\nThe clear-phase test passed because the cheat advanced the phase. Eighteen frames of strain stepping could not finish staccato on its own. The ghost drawing test is being checked for an issue with advancing while on the operation scene after secondLook.\n\nThe `toolNext` handler increments the dev tab but never resets `devI`. The test presses `down` seven times while on tab 1, landing on index 7. That index corresponds to 'win' in the CHEATS array, so the test still passes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9703a57-6c6c-4b98-bc50-ce987a2dd63f-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"67d6ff","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916","glob":"*.{js,mjs,html}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9703a57-6c6c-4b98-bc50-ce987a2dd63f-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/scenes/shell.js","offset":574,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9703a57-6c6c-4b98-bc50-ce987a2dd63f-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function advancePhase|S\\.phaseName","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":80520,"output_tokens":2029,"cache_read_input_tokens":1792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":nu