{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_517","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe `devI` reset on tab switches is harmless. The confirm key on the tune tab calls `devAct(0)`, which returns early without changing anything, so the slider stays put.The second grep for 67d6ff in the root HTML","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3d21c56-484b-4341-97c2-0ad1f0dc88f6-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.hold","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3d21c56-484b-4341-97c2-0ad1f0dc88f6-38","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function advancePhase|hold:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3772,"output_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":81152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"1a6d0bc6-a322-493c-9ba7-4d84772b8be5"}
