{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_518","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" returned no results. The search was limited to js, mjs, and html files inside the dev folder, so the root HTML was likely excluded.\n\nThe first grep located the string in the root HTML at line 19271. The dev folder's game.html also contains it at the same line. Both files appear to includeI am reading the advancePhase the ghost paint code. The win cheat sets  function fully.strain.done via handleDev when confirmed, but drive() still executes because the operation update ignores that return value.\n\nA tap versus held input conflict during dev open is unlikely to trigger a tool. I will check takeCore to see if ghosts are excluded from the hash deviation. If tests pass, this does not refute the claim. PLAN.md's Second Look section should clarify whether ghosts must animate over time or can remain static. The prior gap is fixed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aac1861d-977a-4536-ae3a-400ea84cd3c7-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":1380,"limit":100}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1191,"output_tokens":245,"cache_read_input_tokens":84864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"a45d0551-543f-49e2-889c-69a17e7c5999"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-aac1861d-977a-4536-ae3a-400ea84cd3c7-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1380→        }\\n      } else o.labT = 0;\\n    }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.scripts.length; i++) {\\n      const sc = S.scripts[i];\\n      if (sc.done) continue;\\n      if (S.phaseT >= sc.t) { sc.done = true; runScript(S, sc.do, tune); }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n1390→  function loadPhase(S, def, index) {\\n    const ph = def.phases[index];\\n    S.phase = index;\\n    S.phaseCount = def.phases.length;\\n    S.phaseName = ph.name;\\n    S.phaseT = 0;\\n    S.objects = S.objects.filter(o => o.persist);\\n    S.strain = null;\\n    S.scripts = (ph.at || []).map(a => ({ t: a.t, do: a.do, done: false }));\\n    S.tutorial = !!ph.tutorial;\\n1400→    S.tutDone = !ph.tutorial;\\n    S.flags = Object.assign({}, S.flags, ph.flags || {});\\n    if (ph.dim != null) S.dim = ph.dim;\\n    if (ph.tilt) S.tiltAmp = ph.tilt;\\n    for (const spec of ph.objects || []) addObj(S, clone(spec));\\n    if (ph.strain) spawnStrain(S, ph.strain, ph.strainOpts || {});\\n    if (ph.device) S.device = clone(ph.device);\\n    if (ph.onEnter) runScript(S, ph.onEnter, tuneOf(null));\\n    S.checkpoint = takeCore(S);\\n    /* drop the checkpoint's nested copy weight: checkpoint is the core itself */\\n1410→    pushEv(S, ['phase', index, ph.name]);\\n  }\\n\\n  function advancePhase(S) {\\n    if (S.hold) return;\\n    const def = (GAME.CASES || {})[S.id];\\n    if (!def) { finishCase(S); return; }\\n    if (S.phase + 1 >= def.phases.length) {\\n      if (!S.dressing && !S.won) {\\n        S.dressing = { t: 0, done: false };\\n1420→        pushEv(S, ['dressing', 1]);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    loadPhase(S, def, S.phase + 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  function create(def, opts) {\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n1430→    const diff = opts.difficulty || opts.diff || 'resident';\\n    const doc = def.doctor || 'vale';\\n    const S = blank({\\n      id: def.id, seed: opts.seed || def.seed || 1, players: opts.players || 1,\\n      difficulty: diff, clock: def.clock, vitals: def.vitals, drain: def.drain,\\n      gift: doc === 'sokolova' ? 'look' : doc === 'both' ? 'both' : 'breath',\\n      doctor: doc === 'both' ? 'vale' : doc, site: def.site, par: def.par || 1000,\\n      mode: def.mode || 'case', consult: !!def.consult || doc === 'both',\\n    });\\n    if (doc === 'both') S.activeDoc = 'vale';\\n1440→    S.clock0 = S.clock;\\n    if (def.doctor === 'both') S.consult = true;\\n    loadPhase(S, def, opts.phase || 0);\\n    if (def.lab) { S.hold = true; S.lab = true; S.cheat = { lockVitals: true, freezeClock: true }; }\\n    return S;\\n  }\\n\\n  function createRaw(opts) {\\n    const S = blank(opts);\\n    for (const spec of opts.objects || []) addObj(S, clone(spec));\\n1450→    if (opts.strain) spawnStrain(S, opts.strain, opts.strainOpts || {});\\n    if (opts.scripts) S.scripts = opts.scripts.map(a => ({ t: a.t, do: a.do, done: false }));\\n    S.hold = opts.hold !== false;\\n    S.checkpoint = takeCore(S);\\n    return S;\\n  }\\n\\n  function readInputs(S, inputs, dt) {\\n    inputs = inputs || [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < S.players.length; i++) {\\n1460→      const p = S.players[i];\\n      const inp = inputs[i] || {};\\n      const ox = p.lx != null ? p.lx : p.x, oy = p.ly != null ? p.ly : p.y;\\n      if (inp.x != null) { p.x = inp.x; p.y = inp.y; p.bx = inp.x; p.by = inp.y; }\\n      if (inp.tool) p.tool = inp.tool;\\n      p.inst = hypot(p.x - ox, p.y - oy) / Math.max(dt, 1e-4);\\n      p.lx = p.x; p.ly = p.y;\\n      p.fine = !!inp.fine;\\n      p.mouse = !!inp.mouse;\\n      const trig = inp.trig || 0;\\n1470→      p.trigEdge = trig > 0.3 && p.prevTrig <= 0.3;\\n      p.trigRelease = trig <= 0.3 && p.prevTrig > 0.3;\\n      p.prevTrig = trig;\\n      p.trig = trig;\\n      const gift = !!inp.gift;\\n      p.giftEdge = gift && !p.giftPrev;\\n   