{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_519","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nStaccato spawn and step logic checks out. The slider minimums prevent invalid zero values. A potential bug remains: clear phase may not mark strain beads as done if they are created after the object loop.`advancePhase` returns immediately when a specific condition is met.\n\nBead objects are marked","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d618df3d-8c9e-45a9-a52a-b5af15be8b28-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/core/sim.js","offset":70,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d618df3d-8c9e-45a9-a52a-b5af15be8b28-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"c4:|phaseName|Repair|staccato","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916/src/data/content.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1620,"output_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":86016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"257d2cda-20f1-404e-9671-11466d66334f"}
