,105,109,101,32,108,101,102,116,32,102,114,111,109,32,116,104,101,32,96,99,97,114,100,96,32,101,118,101,110,116,46,32,69,110,116,101,114,44,32,226,156,149,32,111,114,32,97,32,116,97,112,32,97,110,115,119,101,114,115,32,96,114,101,97,100,121,96,46,32,226,150,179,32,111,114,32,77,44,32,110,97,109,101,100,32,111,110,32,116,104,101,32,99,97,114,100,44,32,97,110,115,119,101,114,115,32,96,109,111,114,101,96,46,32,78,111,32,109,101,110,117,115,44,32,110,111,32,115,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,44,32,110,111,32,99,104,111,105,99,101,115,46,32,85,115,101,32,96,65,73,72,117,98,46,114,110,103,40,39,99,97,114,100,39,41,96,32,102,111,114,32,97,110,121,116,104,105,110,103,32,114,97,110,100,111,109,46,10,54,53,50,58,45,32,82,117,108,101,115,58,32,110,111,32,99,104,97,116,44,32,101,109,111,116,101,115,32,111,114,32,99,117,115,116,111,109,32,110,97,109,101,115,44,32,105,110,99,108,117,100,105,110,103,32,112,105,110,103,115,46,32,78,97,109,101,115,32,99,111,109,101,32,102,114,111,109,32,116,104,101,32,72,117,98,32,97,110,100,32,97,114,101,32,110,101,118,101,114,32,105,110,115,101,114,116,101,100,32,97,115,32,72,84,77,76,46,32,78,111,32,96,97,108,101,114,116,96,44,32,96,99,111,110,102,105,114,109,96,44,32,96,112,114,111,109,112,116,96,44,32,96,119,105,110,100,111,119,46,111,112,101,110,96,44,32,110,97,118,105,103,97,116,105,111,110,44,32,115,111,99,107,101,116,115,32,111,114,32,96,102,101,116,99,104,96,46,32,73,110,32,97,32,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,32,116,104,101,32,112,97,117,115,101,32,109,101,110,117,32,104,97,115,32,111,110,108,121,32,82,101,115,117,109,101,44,32,83,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,44,32,67,111,110,116,114,111,108,115,44,32,70,117,108,108,32,115,99,114,101,101,110,32,40,102,97,99,116,32,49,53,41,58,32,110,111,32,81,117,105,116,44,32,82,101,115,116,97,114,116,32,111,114,32,68,101,118,32,77,111,100,101,44,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,119,111,114,108,100,32,107,101,101,112,115,32,114,117,110,110,105,110,103,32,117,110,100,101,114,32,105,116,46,32,84,104,101,32,101,110,103,105,110,101,32,97,108,114,101,97,100,121,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,115,32,79,112,116,105,111,110,115,32,119,104,105,108,101,32,67,114,101,97,116,101,32,105,115,32,104,101,108,100,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":20,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223916__x488eb9/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":114,\"content\":\"3. **Input map.** A custom map must keep the moves and menu actions or the engine warns and menus break. Start from `const { attack, dash, skill, jump, ...base } = E.Input.DEFAULT;`.\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"5. **Glyphs.** `{ key: 'glyphs', value: 'playstation', options: [['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['xbox', 'Xbox']] }` in the same list gives the required Settings option. With `useTool: ['Pad7', 'Pad0', 'Mouse0', 'Space']`, `input.label('useTool')` gave `R2` (PlayStation), `RT` (Xbox), `Left click` (mouse last used), `Space` (keyboard last used). The Pad code listed first is the one shown. The 5x7 font draws `✕ ○ □ △`.\"},{\"line_number\":122,\"content\":\"11. **Touch notice.** `new E.Game({ touch: 'never' })` gives no touch controls, drops the Touch settings, and shows \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\" with a Settings button. But the notice covers the screen at 88% black, which hides the attract mode TASK.md wants running. Patch it (Appendix E).\"},{\"line_number\":139,\"content\":\"| `title` | Hospital skyline at night in the rain, logo, heart-trace underline, \\\"Press Start\\\". 10 s idle → `attract` | `menu` |\"},{\"line_number\":140,\"content\":\"| `menu` | Continue, New Game, Case Files, Grand Rounds, Settings, About. 10 s idle → `attract` | as chosen |\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"| `lobby` | Grand Rounds seats: press to join, add AI colleagues, Start | `op` (Grand Rounds) |\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"A first launch plays: title → menu → New Game → difficulty → Chapter 1 card → first scene → Case 1, with the first tool in the player's hand inside a minute.\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"The first time vitals reach 0 in a case (not on Attending): the world freezes and the paddles come out. The ECG scrolls full-width with 4 charge pips, a marker crossing the peak every .9 s. Press L2 and R2 together (Left click or Space on keyboard and mouse) inside ±.14 s of the peak; ±.06 s is Textbook. Two hits in four attempts: vitals to 30, and play resumes with a jolt, a huge rumble and a white flash. Fewer: patient lost. \\\"Clear!\\\" in gibberish. It doesn't cap the rank: the lost time and low vitals already cost enough.\"},{\"line_number\":318,\"content\":\"The keyboard and mouse are native here, not stand-ins for controller buttons: the same game on the same screens, with the keys PC players expect for this kind of game. The mouse is the best pointer in the game, and the pad is the best-feeling couch device.\"},{\"line_number\":323,\"content\":\"| Use tool | R2 (analog) or ✕ | Left click or Space |\"},{\"line_number\":330,\"content\":\"| Code Blue shock | L2 + R2 | Left click or Space |\"},{\"line_number\":333,\"content\":\"| Ward: talk, use | ✕ | E or Enter, or click the person |\"},{\"line_number\":334,\"content\":\"| Story: advance | ✕ | Enter, Space or click |\"},{\"line_number\":343,\"content\":\"  useTool: ['Pad7', 'Pad0', 'Mouse0', 'Space'], fine: ['Pad6', 'ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight'], gift: ['Pad3', 'KeyF', 'Mouse1'], consult: ['Pad2', 'KeyC'],\"},{\"line_number\":348,\"content\":\"  interact: ['Pad0', 'KeyE', 'Enter'], skip: ['Pad2', 'ControlLeft'], log: ['Pad3', 'KeyB'], more: ['Pad3', 'KeyM'] };\"},{\"line_number\":433,\"content\":\"- Right: \\\"Second opinion confirmed.\\\" +20 s and +20 Steady, and a marker on the op's field.\"},{\"line_number\":607,\"content\":\"- `threequarter` view, `E.TileMap` from text rows, `E.Body`, `E.Humanoid` in scrubs at `size: 1.3`, E.Story for talk, lights on: fluorescent panels, a window wall with rain, a warm desk lamp. Start from `kits/adventure.js` for the movement and talk loop.\"},{\"line_number\":637,\"content\":\"The `lobby` scene: four seats. Player 1 is already in. `game.allowJoin({ max: 4, onJoin })` lets a second pad join with Start or the keyboard's right half with 2. **Add AI colleague** fills a seat with a bot, so a solo player can see co-op and the attract mode can show it. The mouse belongs to player 1. One shared screen, no split. Each player's wheel appears around their own cursor.\"},{\"line_number\":644,\"content\":\"- **Your own card** (`card: true`): the theatre's whiteboard showing the game's name, each player in their color with a tick when ready, how to win, this player's controls from the device they used last, and the time left from the `card` event. Enter, ✕ or a tap answers `ready`. △ or M, named on the card, answers `more`. No menus, no settings, no choices. Use `AIHub.rng('card')` for anything random.\"},{\"line_number\":652,\"content\":\"- Rules: no chat, emotes or custom names, including pings. Names come from the Hub and are never inserted as HTML. No `alert`, `confirm`, `prompt`, `window.open`, navigation, sockets or `fetch`. In a session the pause menu has only Resume, Settings, Controls, Full screen (fact 15): no Quit, Restart or Dev Mode, and the world keeps running under it. The engine already ignores Options while Create is held.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"48daa54a-6126-4d80-871a-a3d7603ac6fd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_536","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The deliverable is a single self-contained HTML file for the playable browser game \"Open Table Second Opinion\".\n\nOpen the HTML file in a browser. Run tests with `node tests/run.mjs` from the dev folder. The game is an offline surgical-action title inspired by Trauma Center.\n\nPress Start or Enter on the title screen to begin. Aim with the mouse and use left-click or Space to operate the surgical tool. Controller support is included via default PlayStation glyphs.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Open Table Second Opinion is a self-contained surgical-action browser game — eleven cases, story, ward, and local or AI Hub co-op — in one HTML file.\n\n- Open `Open-Table-Second-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223916.html` in a browser. It runs from `file://` with no server.\n- On the title, press Enter, Space, or Start, then choose New Game. The mouse aims in surgery; left click or Space uses the tool. A gamepad works too.\n- From the matching dev folder, `node tests/run.mjs` runs the checks."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2009,"output_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":21760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa37-f7cf-7001-9198-38ad04ed0f5e","uuid":"80fe7ff0-3720-4e44-a37c-58d2584346af"}
